'%s URL'=>'URL n %s','%s added the event %s'=>'%s yerna tadyant %s','%s added the event %s to %s.'=>'%s yerna tadyant %s ɣer %s.','%s allows you to modify some or all of the formats used by Events Manager to generate your content. You can choose to override default formats and customize them to your needs. You do not lose your previously defined custom formats should you enable/disable %s or choose to not override a certain set of formats, they\'ll appear again once you enable %s again for that content.'=>'%s ak-yeǧǧa ad tbeddleḍ kra neɣ akk imusal i yettwaseqdac sɣur Events Manager i usnulfu n ugbur-ik. Tzemreḍ ad tferneḍ ad tbeddleḍ imusal imezwer u ad tsagneḍ-iten ɣer lebɣi-ik. Ur ttruḥun ara imusal-ik yugnen yettwabdeen yakan ma tremdeḍ/tsensed %s neɣ ma tferneḍ ur tbeddleḍ ara tagrumma kra n yimusal, ad d-banen daɣen akken ara tarmdeḍ %s i ugbur-nni.','%s are a <a href="%s" target="_blank">WordPress custom taxonomy</a>.'=>'%s d <a href="%s" target="_blank">tamessartut yugnen n WordPress</a>.','%s are also accepted, for example %s equals 1 month and 12 hours before the event starts.'=>'%s daɣen ttwaqbalen, amedya %s yemmal 1 n wayyur d 12 n yisragen send ad tebdu tedyant.','%s belonging to other sub-sites will have an extra slug prepended to it so that your main site can differentiate between its own %s and those belonging to other sites in your network.'=>'%s i yellan deg yismal rewlent nniḍen ad ttwarnunt s uberriḥ amernu akken ad yezmir usmel-ik agejdan ad yemgarad gar %s-is d wid n yismal nniḍen deg uẓeṭṭa-ik.','%s can be displayed just like normal WordPress custom taxonomies in an archive-style format, however Events Manager by default allows you to completely change the standard look of these archives and use our own <a href="%s">custom formatting</a> methods.'=>'%s zemrent ad ttwaskanent am tmessartutin yugnen n WordPress yettwassnen deg umasal n tarcivt, maca Events Manager s wudem amezwer yeğğa-k ad tbeddleḍ akk udem aɣelnaw n tarcivin-a, ad tesqedceḍ ula d tarrayin-nneɣ n <a href="%s">umsal yugnen</a>.','%s cannot be used for a hybrid event, because it gives every booking virtual access.'=>'%s ur yezmir ara ad yettwasqedcen i tedyant ahibrid, acku yettak anekcum virtuel i yal tuṭṭfa.','%s could not be deleted'=>'%s ur yettwakkes ara','%s could not be deleted.'=>'%s ur izmir ara ad yettwakkes.','%s created.'=>'%s yettwasnulfa.','%s custom post types can have archives, just like normal WordPress posts. If enabled, should you visit your base slug url %s and you will see an post-formatted archive of previous %s'=>'Anawen n yimagraden udmawanen n %s zemren ad sɛun iɣbaren, am yimagraden n WordPress ɛadi. Ma yella yermed, ma tzurreḍ aseɣwen n uberriḥ-ik aẓayan %s ad twaliḍ aɣbar s umasal n umagrad n %s yezrin','%s deleted'=>'%s yettwakkes','%s excerpt'=>'Tussift n %s','%s excerpt fallback'=>'Tussift n %s n ddaw','%s includes every add-on sold here.'=>'%s yeddukkel akk isnernan yettwaznen dagi.','%s is attending %s of the group %s.'=>'%s ad yettekki deg %s n ugraw %s.','%s is attending %s.'=>'%s ad yettekki deg %s.','%s is replaced by username, %s is replaced by the user password and %s is replaced by a link to create a password.'=>'%s yettusemmiḍ s yisem n useqdac, %s yettusemmiḍ s wawal n uɛeddi n useqdac u %s yettusemmiḍ s useɣwen i usnulfu n wawal n uɛeddi.','%s is required.'=>'%s yettwasra.','%s item'=>'%s n uferdis' . "\0" . '%s n yiferdisen','%s list footer format'=>'Amasal n uḍar n tebdart n %s','%s list header format'=>'Amasal n uqeṛṛu n tebdart n %s','%s list item format'=>'Amasal n uferdis n tebdart n %s','%s must be set to yes for this to work.'=>'%s ilaq ad yili d ih i wakken aya ad yeddu.','%s overrides all formatting choices, which will be be taken from the settings defined on this page. If you want to override only certain formatting, choose the %s instead.'=>'%s ibeddel akk textiṛiyin n umasal, ara yettwaṭṭfen seg yiɣewwaren yettwaɣren deg usebter-a. Ma tebɣiḍ ad tbeddleḍ kan kra n yimusal, fren %s deg umkan-is.','%s page'=>'Asebter n %s','%s parameters will be permitted in shortcode.'=>'Iɣewwaren %s ad ttwasirgen deg unegzum.','%s row'=>'%s n uzrig' . "\0" . '%s n yizirigen','%s successfully deleted'=>'%s yettwakkes akken iwata','%s successfully deleted.'=>'%s yettwakkes akken iwata.','%s successfully duplicated.'=>'%s yettwanɣel akken iwata.','%s users cancelled bookings.'=>'%s iseqdacen fsxen tuṭṭfiwin.','%s will be replaced by a link to your site privacy policy page.'=>'%s ad yettusemselsi s useɣwen ɣer usebter n tsertit tabaḍnit n usmel-ik.','%s will not be attending %s anymore.'=>'%s ur d-yettekki ara ugar deg %s.','%s will not be attending %s of group %s anymore.'=>'%s ur d-yettekki ara ugar deg %s n ugraw %s.','(New)'=>'(Amaynut)','(always available)'=>'(yewjed yal tikkelt)','(not applicable with event ownership on presently, coming soon!)'=>'(ur teddu ara tura ɣer-s ma yella yermed unamek n uqeddac n tedyant, ad d-yas s lemγawla!)','1,2,3 or 2 (0 = all)'=>'1,2,3 neɣ 2 (0 = akk)','1. Match columns'=>'1. Qqen tigejdiyin','2 for every second day, week, month or year. Leave empty for every one.'=>'2 i yal ass wis sin, dduṛt, ayyur neɣ aseggas. Eǧǧ-it d ilem i yal yiwen.','2. Options'=>'2. Tixtiṛiyin','3. Preview'=>'3. Taskant','<a href="%s">See some more information</a> on how %s work when overriding with formats.'=>'<a href="%s">Wali ugar n telɣut</a> ɣef wamek i teddun %s mi ara tsemselsiḍ s yimusal.','<a href="%s">Visit our blog</a> for the latest news about recent updates.'=>'<a href="%s">Rzu ablug-nneɣ</a> i wallalen imaynuten ɣef yileqqmen n melmi kan.','<li>No events in this location</li>'=>'<li>Ulac tidyanin deg wadrar-agi</li>','<p>Events Manager is ready to go! It is highly recommended you read the <a href=\'%s\'>Getting Started</a> guide on our site, as well as checking out the <a href=\'%s\'>Settings Page</a></p>'=>'<p>Events Manager yewjed! Nettwali ilaq ad teɣreḍ amnir n <a href=\'%s\'>Tazwara</a> deg usmel-nneɣ, daɣen ad twaliḍ <a href=\'%s\'>Asebter n yiɣewwaren</a></p>','<strong>ERROR</strong>: Couldn&#8217;t register you... please contact the <a href="mailto:%s">webmaster</a> !'=>'<strong>TUCCḌA</strong>: Ur nezmir ara ad ak-neklas... nermes <a href="mailto:%s">anedbal n usmel</a> !','<strong>ERROR</strong>: Please enter a username.'=>'<strong>ANEZRI</strong>Ttxil-k sekcem isem n useqdac.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: Please type your e-mail address.'=>'<strong>TUCCḌA</strong>: Ma ulac aɣilif, sekcem tansa-inek n yimayl.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: The email address isn&#8217;t correct.'=>'<strong>ANEZRI</strong>Tansa email d turameɣtut.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: This email is already registered, please choose another one.'=>'<strong>ANEZRI</strong> Tansa-agi email tettwaseqdec yakan.Ttxil-k sekcem tayeḍ.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: This username is already registered, please choose another one.'=>'<strong>TUCCḌA</strong>: Isem-agi n useqdac yettwaklas yakan, fren wayeḍ.','<strong>ERROR</strong>: This username is invalid because it uses illegal characters. Please enter a valid username.'=>'<strong>ANEZRI</strong>Isem n useqdac d urameɣtu acku iseqdac isekkilen igedlen. Ttxil-k sekcem isem n useqdac ameɣtu.','<strong>Notes:</strong> Ticket availability not taken into account (i.e. you can overbook). Emails are not resent automatically.'=>'<strong>Iwenniten:</strong> Tilin n tikitin ur tettwaḥseb ara (d wagi, tzemreḍ ad tɛebbiḍ aṭas). Imaylen ur ttwaznen ara i tikkelt-nniḍen s wudem awurman.','<strong>Notes:</strong> Ticket availability not taken into account when approving new bookings (i.e. you can overbook).'=>'<strong>Iwenniten:</strong> Tilin n tikitin ur tettwaḥseb ara mi ara tqebleḍ tuṭṭfiwin timaynutin (d wagi, tzemreḍ ad tɛebbiḍ aṭas).','<strong>Warning : </strong> By enabling this, registered users will not be able to see bookings they make as guests in their "My Bookings" page.'=>'<strong>Alɣu : </strong> S wudem-a, iseqdacen yettwaklesen ur zmiren ara ad walin tuṭṭfiwin i xedmen am yimerza deg usebter-nsen "Tuṭṭfiwin-iw".','<strong>Warning : </strong> Various features afforded to users with an account will not be available, e.g. viewing bookings. Once you enable this and select a user, modifying these values will prevent older non-user bookings from displaying the correct information.'=>'<strong>Alɣu : </strong> Timeẓluyin yemgaraden i yettwafkan i yiseqdacen s ukaunt ur ttwajiden ara, amedya tuṭṭfiwin. Ticki tremdeḍ aya u tferneḍ useqdac, abeddel n yizalen-a ad yeǧǧ tuṭṭfiwin n zik war useqdac ur d-banent ara s talɣut tameɣtut.','A booking intent cannot have its status changed.'=>'Addad n tirmit n tuṭṭfa ur yezmir ara ad yettwabeddel.','A booking was cancelled'=>'Tuṭṭfa tettwasefsex','A booking\'s payment gateway is set when the booking is made and cannot be changed.'=>'Tawwurt n usewweṛ n tuṭṭfa tettwasbadu mi ara tettwag tuṭṭfa u ur tezmir ara ad tettwabeddel.','A guest-accessible cancellation flow for the EU statutory <strong>right of withdrawal</strong>. Enable this only if you sell to consumers who have a right of withdrawal — <strong>fixed-date events are generally exempt</strong>. Events Manager provides the mechanism; you supply your own legal withdrawal policy text below.'=>'Tarrayt n usefsex i tzemmer ad tekcem yal yiwen, i <strong>azref n usuɣal ɣer deffir</strong> yettwaḍman sɣur EU. Rmed-it kan ma tzenzeḍ i yimsaleyen yesɛan azref n usuɣal ɣer deffir; <strong>tidyanin n uzmez usbiḍ ur ttwaḥsabent ara s umata</strong>. Events Manager yettak tarrayt, u kečč ad d-tefkeḍ aḍris n tsertit-ik n usuɣal ukessar.','A hybrid event needs a physical venue.'=>'Tadyant ahibrid tesra adrar n fizik.','A list of further dates, such as 2027-03-11|2027-03-18, used alone or with a rule.'=>'Tabdart n yizemzen nniḍen, am 2027-03-11|2027-03-18, yettwasqedcen weḥd-s neɣ d ugzul.','A location with this name is already on this site (location %d).'=>'Adrar s yisem-a yella yakan deg usmel-a (adrar %d).','A location with this name is already on this site.'=>'Adrar s yisem-a yella yakan deg usmel-a.','A new event has been published by #_CONTACTNAME.<br/>Name : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Date : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Time : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Edit this event - #_EDITEVENTURL <br/> View this event - #_EVENTURL'=>'Tadyant tamaynut tettwasuffeɣ s #_CONTACTNAME.<br/>Isem : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Azemz : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Akud : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Ẓreg tadyant-agi - #_EDITEVENTURL <br/> Wali tadyant-agi - #_EVENTURL','A new event has been submitted by #_CONTACTNAME.<br/>Name : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Date : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Time : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Please visit #_EDITEVENTURL to review this event for approval.'=>'Tadyant tamaynut tettwazen s #_CONTACTNAME.<br/>Isem : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Azemz : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Akud : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Ṛzu #_EDITEVENTURL akken ad twaliḍ tadyant-agi i uqbal.','A new event was created'=>'Tettwasnulfa tedyant tamaynut','A new user account has been created for you. Please check your email for access details.'=>'Amiḍan amaynut n useqdac yettwarna i kečč. Ẓer imayl-ik i telɣut n unekcum.','A previously published event has been modified by #_CONTACTNAME, and this event is now unpublished and pending your approval.<br/>Name : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Date : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Time : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Please visit #_EDITEVENTURL to review this event for approval.'=>'Tadyant yettwasuffɣen send tettwabeddel s #_CONTACTNAME, tura ur d-tesbedd ara u tettṛaju taqbalt-ik.<br/>Isem : #_EVENTNAME <br/>Azemz : #_EVENTDATES <br/>Akud : #_EVENTTIMES <br/>Ṛzu #_EDITEVENTURL akken ad twaliḍ tadyant-agi i uqbal.','A repeating event needs a repeat-until date or a number of times.'=>'Tadyant i d-yettuɣalen tesra azemz n taggara n tɛiwdt neɣ amḍan n tikkal.','A test email will be sent to your account email - %s'=>'Imayl n uɛeṛṛeḍ ad yettwazen ɣer yimayl n umiḍan-ik - %s','A token is required.'=>'Ilaq ajuṭun.','A user cancelled a booking'=>'Aseqdac yefsex tuṭṭfa','A valid Expo push token is required.'=>'Ilaq ajuṭun Expo ameɣtu.','A valid blog ID must be provided, you can only reset one blog at a time.'=>'Ilaq ad tefkeḍ asulay n ublug ameɣtu, tzemreḍ ad tarreḍ ɣer wazal amezwaru kan yiwen n ublug yal tikkelt.','A valid email'=>'Imayl ameɣtu','A virtual event can hold its link back until shortly before it starts. Until then, visitors and attendees see a short text in place of the link, and join links sent to attendees only start working at that time.'=>'Tadyant virtuel tezmer ad teṛǧu aseɣwen-is alamma qrib ad tebdu. Alamma d lweqt-nni, imsuɣal d yimttekkiyen ad walin aḍris awezzil deg wadeg n useɣwen, u iseɣwan n uttekki i ttwaznen i yimttekkiyen ad ddun kan di lweqt-nni.','AFTER the withdrawal period — please review carefully'=>'SELD tanzagt n usuɣal, ttxil sefqed s ttawil','AI / MCP Setup'=>'Asbadu n AI / MCP','Abbreviated weekdays'=>'Ussan n tlalit yettwamecṭuḥen','Abbreviated weekdays?'=>'Ussan n tlalit yettwamecṭuḥen?','Abilities that create, update, delete, or otherwise modify Events Manager data.'=>'Tizemrin ara d-isnulfun, ara isleqqmen, ara yekksen neɣ ara ibeddlen isefka n Events Manager.','Access'=>'Anekcum','Accordion'=>'Akurdyun','Account Connection'=>'Tuqqna n umiḍan','Acknowledgment email'=>'Imayl n tuqbalt','Acknowledgment email body'=>'Tafekka n yimayl n tuqbalt','Acknowledgment email subject'=>'Asentel n yimayl n tuqbalt','Actions'=>'Tigawin','Activate license'=>'Rmed turagt','Activate plugin'=>'Rmed azegrar','Active'=>'Urmid','Add %s'=>'Rnu %s','Add Dates '=>'Rnu izemzen ','Add Event'=>'Rnu tadyant','Add Location'=>'Rnu adrar','Add New'=>'Rnu amaynut','Add New %s'=>'Rnu %s amaynut','Add New Archetype'=>'Rnu Archetype amaynut','Add New Event'=>'Rnu tadyant tamaynut','Add New Event Category'=>'Rnu taggayt n tedyant tamaynut','Add New Event Tag'=>'Rnu tabzimt n tedyant tamaynut','Add New Location'=>'Rnu adrar amaynut','Add New Repeating Event'=>'Rnu tadyant i d-yettuɣalen tamaynut','Add Note'=>'Rnu awennit','Add Repeating Event'=>'Rnu tadyant i d-yettuɣalen','Add Reply-To booker?'=>'Rnu Reply-To n win i yuṭṭfen?','Add Reply-To event owner?'=>'Rnu Reply-To n bab n tedyant?','Add Time Slot'=>'Rnu tazmilt n wakud','Add To Calendar'=>'Rnu ɣer tfada','Add a negative number or minus sign to the start of the date interval to allow cancellations after events have started.'=>'Rnu uṭṭun uslig neɣ azamul n ukessar ɣer tazwara n tallunt n uzemz i wakken ad tsirgeḍ asefsex deffir ad ttwabdun tedyanin.','Add a start or end date (or both) to impose time constraints on ticket availability. Leave either blank for no upper/lower limit.'=>'Rnu azemz n tazwara neɣ n taggara (neɣ sin) akken ad tessebded tilas n wakud i tuffɣa n tikit. Eǧǧ yiwen d ilem ma ur tebɣiḍ ara talast n uufella/n uddaw.','Add a tax rate to your ticket prices (entering 10 will add 10% to the ticket price).'=>'Rnu afeṛṛun n userreḥ ɣer ssuma n tkitin-ik (ma tskecmeḍ 10 ad yernu 10% i ssuma n tkit).','Add any of these columns to an events file. A row with none of them filled in is a single event.'=>'Rnu yiwen seg tigejdiyin-a ɣer ufaylu n tedyanin. Izirig ur nesɛi yiwen deg-sent d tadyant asuf.','Add br tags to HTML emails?'=>'Rnu tibzimin br ɣer yimaylen n HTML?','Add location'=>'Rnu adrar','Add new ticket'=>'Rnu tikit tamaynut','Add or remove %s'=>'Rnu neɣ kkes %s','Add or remove events'=>'Rnu neɣ kkes tidyanin','Add tax to ticket price?'=>'Rnu aserreḥ i ssuma n tkit?','Add to your table from the columns below.'=>'Rnu ɣer tfelwit-ik seg ijga ukessar.','Add-ons'=>'Isnernan','Add-ons and prices are up to date.'=>'Isnernan d wazal ttwaleqqmen.','Add-ons are separate plugins that work with the free Events Manager plugin, so you do not need Events Manager Pro to use them.'=>'Isnernan d izegrar yemgaraden i yedduklen d uzegrar Events Manager n baṭel, ihi ur teḥwaǧeḍ ara Events Manager Pro akken ad ten-tesqedceḍ.','Additional CSS'=>'CSS amernan','Address'=>'Tansa','Address line 2'=>'Izirig wis sin n tansa','Address only'=>'Tansa kan','Address:'=>'Tansa:','Adds a checkbox below the location options that limits results to events attendees can join virtually, including hybrid events.'=>'Yernu tankult seddaw n textiṛiyin n wadrar i yessagaden igmaḍ ɣer tedyanin i izemren yimttekkiyen ad ttekkin deg-sent s wudem virtuel, ula d tidyanin ahibrid.','Adds a guest-accessible withdrawal flow and, optionally, a site-wide footer link.'=>'Ternuḍ tarrayt n usuɣal i izemren yal yiwen ad tt-isseqdec, u, ma tebɣiḍ, aseɣwen deg uḍar n usmel.','Adds the time and the hidden text to the event editor, so each event can set its own. If not, every event uses the defaults below.'=>'Yernu akud d uḍris yeffren ɣer umaẓrag n tedyant, akken yal tadyant ad tesbadu win-is. Ma ulac, yal tadyant ad tesqdec ayen yellan s umezwer seddaw-a.','Admin Icon'=>'Tignit n unedbal','Admin Tools'=>'Ifecka n tedbelt','Administrator Email'=>'Imayl n unedbal','Advanced'=>'Anaẓi','Advanced Mode'=>'Askar anaẓi','Advanced Search Fields'=>'Urtiyen n unadi anaẓi','Advanced search mode'=>'Askar n unadi anaẓi','Advanced search style'=>'Aɣanib n unadi anaẓi','Advanced settings'=>'Iɣewwaren inaẓiyen','After'=>'Deffir','All'=>'Akk','All %s'=>'Akk %s','All Ascending'=>'Akk s walluy','All Blogs'=>'Akk iblugen','All Categories'=>'Merra','All Cities/Towns'=>'Tiɣremt/Tibhirin akk','All Countries'=>'Tiɣerɣar akk','All Day'=>'Ass meṛṛa','All Day Message'=>'Izen n wass ummid','All Descending'=>'Akk s usider','All Event Categories'=>'Taggayin n tedyant akk','All Event Tags'=>'Tibzimin n tedyant akk','All Event Types'=>'Anawen n tedyanin merra','All Events'=>'Akk tidyanin','All Regions'=>'Timnaḍin akk','All States'=>'Tuddar akk','All Tags'=>'Tibzimin akk','All Time'=>'Yal akud','All Timeslots'=>'Akk tazmilin n wakud','All confirmed and pending bookings will be emailed a general event cancellation notification.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin meṛṛa yettusentmen d yegguni ad ttwaznent tilɣa tamatut n usefsex n tedyant.','All countries text'=>'Aḍris n yimura meṛṛa','All day'=>'Ass akken','All day (yes or no)'=>'Ass akken (yes or no)','All events'=>'Tidyanin akk','All events link text?'=>'Aḍris n useɣwen "akk tidyanin"?','All events will be moved to trash.'=>'Tidyanin meṛṛa ad ttwawint ɣer taqecwalt.','All options below relate to data that may have been submitted by or collected from the user requesting their personal data, which would also include events and locations where they are the author.'=>'Akk textiṛiyin ddaw qqnent ɣer yisefka i yezmer ad ttwaznen neɣ ttwaklasen sɣur useqdac i yessutren isefka-ines udmawanen, ayen ara yesɛun daɣen tidyanin d idrar ideg d ameskar.','All our sold add-ons'=>'Akk isnernan nneɣ yettwaznen','All regions text'=>'Aḍris n tmeẓriwin meṛṛa','All settings, events and bookings for every site on this network will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'Akk iɣewwaren, tidyanin d tuṭṭfiwin n yal asmel n uẓeṭṭa-agi ad ttwakksent i lebda. Aya ur yezmir ara ad yettwasefsex.','All states text'=>'Aḍris n yiberdan meṛṛa','All towns/cities text'=>'Aḍris n timdinin/tiɣermin meṛṛa','All translations of this event will be detached from the recurring event.'=>'Tisuqqilin meṛṛa n tedyant-agi ad ttwasenṣlent seg tedyant i d-yettuɣalen.','All your settings and events will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'Akk iɣewwaren d tidyanin-ik ad ttwakksent i lebda. Aya ur yezmir ara ad yettwasefsex.','All your settings, including email templates and template formats for Events Manager will be deleted.'=>'Akk iɣewwaren-ik, ula d tneɣrufin n yimayl d wamasal n tneɣrufin n Events Manager ad ttwakksen.','Allow %s to appear in the built-in search results.'=>'Sireg %s ad d-banen deg igmaḍ n unadi yettwarnan.','Allow Maybe?'=>'Sireg "Ahat"?','Allow Multiple Uploads'=>'Sireg asali uṭṭun n yifuyla','Allow RSVP Actions'=>'Sireg tigawin n tinnubga','Allow WordPress post-style archives.'=>'Sireg iɣbaren s wawalen n imagraden n WordPress.','Allow anonymous event submissions?'=>'Sireg uzzna warisem n tedyanin?','Allow bookings with registered emails?'=>'Sireg tuṭṭfiwin s yimaylen yettwaklesen?','Allow double bookings?'=>'Sireg tuṭṭfiwin sin tikkal?','Allow format shortcode parameters?'=>'Sireg iɣewwaren n umasal n unegzum?','Allow guest bookings?'=>'Sireg tuṭṭfiwin n yimerza?','Allow overbooking when approving?'=>'Sireg tuṭṭfa s ugar n idagen mi ara teqbel?','Allow subsites to create their own'=>'Sireg yismal imaynuten ad snulfun i yiman-nsen','Allow users to respond with a \'Maybe\' status rather than Attending or Not Attending'=>'Sireg iseqdacen ad rren s uddad "Ahat" deg wadeg n ttekki neɣ ur ttekki ara','Allowed Extensions'=>'Isiɣzaf yurgen','Already Booked'=>'Yettwaṭṭef yakan','Already attending'=>'Yettekki yakan','Already booked'=>'Yettwaṭṭef yakan','Already have a license? Download the plugin from %s, upload it under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'Tesɛiḍ yakan turagt? Sider azegrar seg %s, sekcem-it deg Izegrar > Rnu azegrar amaynut, sakin rmed turagt-ik seg yiɣewwaren-is.','Already migrated: %s'=>'Yettwaneqqel yakan: %s','Also, the following will occur:'=>'Daɣen, ayen i d-iteddun ad yeḍru:','Always check the latest stable version?'=>'Senqed yal tikkelt lqem usligen aneggaru?','Always show and ask for consent'=>'Sken dima u suter tuqqna','An email will be sent to an administrator of your choice when an event is published by users who are not administrators.'=>'Ad yettwazen yiwen n yimayl i unedbal i tferneḍ mi ara tettwasuffeɣ yiwen n tedyant sɣur yiseqdacen ur nelli d inedbalen.','An email will be sent to the event contact if someone cancels their booking.'=>'Ad yettwazen yiwen n yimayl i useqdac n tedyant ma yella win i yuṭṭfen isemmet tuṭṭfa-ines.','An email will be sent to the event owner when their event is approved. Users requiring event approval do not have the <code>publish_events</code> capability.'=>'Ad yettwazen yiwen n yimayl i bab n tedyant mi ara tettwaqbel tedyant-is. Iseqdacen i yesɛan ilaq n uqbal n tedyant ur sɛin ara tisirag <code>publish_events</code>.','An email will be sent to your administrator emails when an event is submitted and pending approval.'=>'Ad yettwazen yiwen n yimayl ɣer yimaylen n yindbalen-ik mi ara tettwazen yiwen n tedyant u tettraju asentem.','An error has occurred, not all sites were upgraded successfully.'=>'Tella tuccḍa, mačči akk isemlen i yettwaleqqmen s lǧehd.','An error occurred.'=>'Teḍra-d tuccḍa.','An event with no bookings.'=>'Tadyant war tuṭṭfiwin.','An event with this name and start is already on this site (event %d).'=>'Tadyant s yisem-a d tazwara-a telha yakan deg usmel-a (tadyant %d).','An import is running. Wait for it to finish, or pause it first.'=>'Asekcam la iteddu. Ṛǧu alamma yekfa, neɣ seḥbes-it send.','An organizer with this name is already on this site.'=>'Amsuddes s yisem-a yella yakan deg usmel-a.','And much more'=>'U ugar n waya','Anonymous Submitter Info'=>'Talɣut n umazan warisem','Anonymous event submissions'=>'Uzzna warisem n tedyanin','Anonymous submitters cannot see or modify their event once submitted. You can customize the success message they see here.'=>'Imazanen warisem ur zmiren ara ad walin neɣ ad beddlen tadyant-nsen ticki tettwazen. Tzemreḍ ad tsagneḍ izen n yedda ara walin da.','Another request is already updating this online location.'=>'Asuter nniḍen la d-yettleqqim adrar-a n internet.','Any Type'=>'Anaw ilha','Appears as the first default search option.'=>'Tettban d afran amezwaru n unadi amezwer.','Appears as the label for this search option.'=>'Yettban d tabzimt i textiṛt-a n unadi.','Appears on the text search filter above the categories list.'=>'Tettban ɣef usti n unadi n uḍris nnig tebdart n taggayin.','Appears on the text search filter above the tags list.'=>'Tettban ɣef usti n unadi n uḍris nnig tebdart n tibzimin.','Appears within the input box.'=>'Yettban deg tebwaḍt n unekcum.','Apply global capabilities?'=>'Snes tizemmar timatutin?','Approval Required?'=>'Yeḥwaǧ aqbal?','Approve'=>'Qbel','Approved'=>'Yettwaqbel','Archetype'=>'Amedya amezwaru','Archetypes UI Builder'=>'Imsebded n Archetypes','Are current events past events?'=>'Tidyanin tamirant d tidyanin yezrin?','Are you sure you want to cancel your booking?'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tesfesxeḍ tuṭṭfa-inek?','Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tkemmleḍ?','Are you sure you want to convert all repeating events into recurring events?'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tbeddleḍ akk tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen ɣer tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen?','Are you sure you want to convert this repeating event?'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tbeddleḍ tadyant-a i d-yettuɣalen?','Are you sure you want to delete all recurrences of this event?'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tekkseḍ yialugen meṛṛa n tedyant-a?','Are you sure you want to delete this archetype? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Tebɣiḍ ad tekkseḍ Archetype-a s tidet? Tigawt-a ur tezmir ara ad tettwasefsex.','Are you sure you want to delete this file? It will be deleted upon submission.'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tekkseḍ afaylu-a? Ad yettwakkes mi ara tazneḍ.','Are you sure you want to delete this item? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tekkseḍ aferdis-a? Tigawt-a ur tezmir ara ad tettwasefsex.','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket?'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tekkseḍ tikit-a?','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket? All bookings related to this ticket will be deleted once you save this %s.'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tekkseḍ tikit-a? Tuṭṭfiwin meṛṛa yettwaqqnen d tikit-a ad ttwakksent mi ara teskelseḍ %s-a.','Are you sure you want to delete?'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tekkseḍ?','Are you sure you want to delete? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tekkseḍ? Tigawt-a ur tezmir ara ad tettwasefsex.','Are you sure you want to detach this event? By doing so, this event will be independent of the recurring set of events.'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tsenṣleḍ tadyant-a? S tigawt-a, tadyant-a ad tuɣal d tuzzigt seg ugraw n tedyanin i d-yettuɣalen.','Are you sure you want to disable bookings? If you do this and save, you will lose all previous bookings. If you wish to prevent further bookings, reduce the number of spaces available to the amount of bookings you currently have'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tsenseḍ tuṭṭfiwin? Ma txedmeḍ aya u tskelseḍ, ad tesruḥeḍ tuṭṭfiwin meṛṛa yezrin. Ma tebɣiḍ ad tḥebseḍ tuṭṭfiwin-nniḍen, senqes amḍan n yidagen yewjden ɣer wamḍan n tuṭṭfiwin i tesɛiḍ tura','Are you sure you want to proceed? We recommend you back up your database first, just in case!'=>'Tebɣiḍ ad tkemmleḍ s tidet? Nessumer ad tsekles azadur-ik n isefka send, i wakken ad yili!','Are you sure you want to reset Events Manager?'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad terreḍ Events Manager ɣer wazal amezwaru?','Are you sure you want to uninstall Events Manager?'=>'Tebɣiḍ s tidet ad tekkseḍ Events Manager?','As a site admin, you see all group events, users will only be able to choose groups they are admins of.'=>'Am anedbal n usmel, twalaḍ akk tidyanin n yigrawen, iseqdacen ad zemren kan ad fernen igrawen ideg d inedbalen.','Ascending'=>'S walluy','Aside from pages we automatically generate and include certain jQuery files, if you are using Widgets, Shortcode or PHP to display specific items you may need to tell us where you are using them for them to work properly. Below are options for you to include specific jQuery dependencies only on certain pages.'=>'Ɣer yidis n yisebtar i d-nesnulfu yerna nerna kra n ifuyla jQuery, ma tesqedceḍ iwiǧiten, inegzumen neɣ PHP i uskan n yiferdisen yettwabdaren, ahat ilaq ad aɣ-d-tesnewweḍ anda ara ten-tesqedceḍ i wakken ad xedmen akken ilaq. Ddaw llant tixtiṛiyin i tmerna n ttabaɛiyin jQuery yettwafernen kan ɣef kra n yisebtar.','Attachment ID not found.'=>'ID n useɣwen ur yettwaf ara.','Attendee %d'=>'Amttekki %d','Attendee %s'=>'Amttekki %s','Attendee (Per Space Booked)'=>'Amttekki (i yal adig yettwaṭṭef)','Attendee names, answers to attendee fields and check-in status are copied and kept with each ticket. Without Events Manager Pro they are not shown, so you will see each booking, its tickets and the person who booked.'=>'Ismawen n yimttekkiyen, tiririyin i yigran n yimttekkiyen d waddad n unekcum ttwaneqlen u ttwaḥḍen s yal tikit. War Events Manager Pro ur d-ttbanen ara, ihi ad twaliḍ yal tuṭṭfa, tikitin-is d wemdan i d-yeṭṭfen.','Attendees'=>'Imttekkiyen','Attending'=>'Ad ttekkiɣ','Attributes'=>'Timeẓluyin','AutoTLS'=>'AutoTLS','Avail. Spaces'=>'Idagen yellan','Availability'=>'Tilin','Available'=>'Yewjed','Available Archetypes'=>'Archetypes yewjiden','Available Spaces'=>'Idagen yewjden','Available for'=>'Yewjed i','Available from'=>'Yewjed seg','Available spaces'=>'Idagen yellan','Available until'=>'Yewjed alamma','Average Sale'=>'Tasaṭ tamegzut','Average Ticket'=>'Tikit tamegzut','Awaiting Online Payment'=>'Yettraǧu asewweṛ srid','Awaiting Payment'=>'Yettṛaju asewweṛ','Bar Graph'=>'Awonaf n yiseddaren','Base Event Settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n taffa n tedyant','Base Location Settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n taffa n yidrar','Base font size'=>'Tiddi n tsefsit n taffa','Base font weight'=>'Uẓẓil n tsefsit n taffa','Base line height'=>'Teɣzi n yizirig n taffa','Basic HTML is allowed in ticket labels and descriptions.'=>'HTML axatar yettwasireg deg tebratin d unaw n tikitin.','Basic Only'=>'Azadur kan','Be aware that some themes will not work with this option, if so (or you want to make your own changes), you can create a file named <code>single-%s.php</code> <a href=\'#\'>as shown on the WordPress codex</a>, and leave this set to Posts.'=>'Ɣur-k, kra n yisental ur xeddmen ara s textiṛt-a, ma yella (neɣ tebɣiḍ ad txedmeḍ isenfal-ik), tzemreḍ ad tesnulfuḍ afaylu isem-is <code>single-%s.php</code> <a href=\'#\'>am akken i d-yettwabder deg codex n WordPress</a>, yerna eǧǧ-it deg Imagraden.','Before'=>'Send','Before you save your changes, you can quickly send yourself a test email by clicking this button.'=>'Send ad teklseḍ ibeddilen-ik, tzemreḍ ad tazneḍ imayl n uɛeṛṛeḍ i yiman-ik s usiti ɣef tqeffalt-agi.','Below are translations for your location address. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'Ddaw-agi llan tisuqqilin n tansa n wadrar-ik. Ma yeǧǧa d ilem, ad tettwaseqdec tutlayt n tedyant tanaṣlit.','Below are translations for your tickets. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'Ddaw-agi llan tisuqqilin n tikitin-ik. Ma yeǧǧa d ilem, ad tettwaseqdec tutlayt n tedyant tanaṣlit.','Below you will find texts that will be displayed to users in various areas during the bookings process, particularly on booking forms.'=>'Ukessar ad twaliḍ iḍrisen ara d-yettwaskanen i iseqdacen deg tmura yemgaraden deg ukud n tuṭṭfa, daɣen deg tseggiwin n tuṭṭfa.','Block Editor (Gutenberg)'=>'Amaẓrag n yiḥedran (Gutenberg)','Block Editor development is still ongoing, switch back to the Classic Editor if you experience issues.'=>'Taneflit n umaẓrag n yiḥedran mazal-itt, uɣal ɣer umaẓrag aklasiki ma temmuggreḍ-d uguren.','Block editor layout'=>'Taneɣruft n umaẓrag n yiḥedran','Blog Default Timezone'=>'Tamnaḍt tasragant tamezwert n wablug','Body Classes'=>'Iclasen n tfekka','Book Now'=>'Ṭṭef tura','Book Now!'=>'Ṭṭef tura!','Booked'=>'Yettwaṭṭef','Booked Spaces'=>'Idagen yettwaṭṭfen','Booked User Emails'=>'Imaylen n yiseqdacen i yuṭṭfen','Booked/Available'=>'Yettwaṭṭef/Yewjed','Booking'=>'Tuṭṭfa','Booking %s'=>'Tuṭṭfa %s','Booking %s.'=>'Tuṭṭfa %s.','Booking Actions'=>'Tigawin n tuṭṭfa','Booking Cancellation Warning'=>'Alɣu n usefsex n tuṭṭfa','Booking Cancelled'=>'Tuṭṭfa tettwaḥbes','Booking Chart'=>'Taskant n tuṭṭfiwin','Booking Comment'=>'Awennit n tuṭṭfa','Booking Confirmation'=>'Asentem n tuṭṭfa','Booking Confirmed'=>'Tuṭṭfa tettusentem','Booking Cut-Off Date'=>'Azemz n tagara n tuṭṭfa','Booking Data'=>'Isefka n tuṭṭfa','Booking Date'=>'Azemz n tuṭṭfa','Booking Details'=>'Ifatusen n tuṭṭfa','Booking Email Templates'=>'Timudmin n yimayl n tuṭṭfa','Booking Form'=>'Tamserkant n tuṭṭfa','Booking ID'=>'Id n tuṭṭfa','Booking ID.'=>'ID n tuṭṭfa.','Booking Intent'=>'Tirmit n tuṭṭfa','Booking Management Pages'=>'Isebtar n tummunt n tuṭṭfiwin','Booking Meta'=>'Méta n tuṭṭfa','Booking Notes'=>'Iwenniten n tuṭṭfa','Booking Pending'=>'Tuṭṭfa tettraǧu','Booking RSVP'=>'Tiririt ɣef tinnubga n tuṭṭfa','Booking RSVP status set to \'%s\'.'=>'Addad RSVP n tuṭṭfa yettwasbadu ɣer \'%s\'.','Booking Rejected'=>'Tuṭṭfa tettwagi','Booking Related Placeholders'=>'Isemlen n wadig yemṣadan d tuṭṭfa','Booking Status'=>'Addad n tuṭṭfa','Booking Statuses'=>'Addaden n tuṭṭfa','Booking Submit Button'=>'Taqeffalt n uzna n tuṭṭfa','Booking Summary'=>'Agzul n tuṭṭfa','Booking admin pages'=>'Isebtar n unedbal n tuṭṭfa','Booking already made'=>'Tuṭṭfa tettwaxdem yakan','Booking button feedback messages'=>'Iznan n tmuɣli n tqeffalt n tuṭṭfa','Booking cancellation emails are not sent.'=>'Imaylen n usefsex n tuṭṭfa ur ttwaznen ara.','Booking cancellation emails will be sent.'=>'Imaylen n usefsex n tuṭṭfa ad ttwaznen.','Booking cancellations'=>'Asefsex n tuṭṭfiwin','Booking cancelled'=>'Tuṭṭfa tettwaḥbes','Booking cancelled email'=>'Imayl n tuṭṭfa yettwaḥbesen','Booking cancelled email subject'=>'Asentel n yimayl n tuṭṭfa yettwaḥbesen','Booking cannot be made, not enough spaces available!'=>'Tuṭṭfa ur tezmir ara ad tettwasen, ulac idagen yewjden yemmden!','Booking complete'=>'Tuṭṭfa temmed','Booking confirmed email'=>'Imayl n tuṭṭfa yettusentem','Booking confirmed email subject'=>'Asentel n yimayl n tuṭṭfa yettusentem','Booking could not be %s.'=>'Tuṭṭfa ur tezmir ara ad tili %s.','Booking could not be created'=>'Tuṭṭfa ur tezmir ara ad tettwarnu','Booking could not be deleted.'=>'Tuṭṭfa ur tettwakkes ara.','Booking could not be saved.'=>'Tuṭṭfa ur tettwaklas ara.','Booking data is invalid.'=>'Isefka n tuṭṭfa ur ttwaqblen ara.','Booking error'=>'Tuccḍa n tuṭṭfa','Booking form feedback messages'=>'Iznan n tmuɣli n tserkant n tuṭṭfa','Booking form section headers'=>'Izwal n tgezmiyin n tserkant n tuṭṭfa','Booking form texts/messages'=>'Iḍrisen/iznan n tserkant n tuṭṭfa','Booking in progress'=>'Tuṭṭfa teddu','Booking not found.'=>'Tuṭṭfa ulac-itt.','Booking note successfully added.'=>'Awennit n tuṭṭfa yettwarna akken iwata.','Booking pending email'=>'Imayl n tuṭṭfa yegguni','Booking pending email subject'=>'Asentel n yimayl n tuṭṭfa yegguni','Booking reference'=>'Tansa n tuṭṭfa','Booking rejected email'=>'Imayl n tuṭṭfa yettwagin','Booking rejected email subject'=>'Asentel n yimayl n tuṭṭfa yettwagin','Booking status could not be changed.'=>'Addad n tuṭṭfa ur yettwabeddel ara.','Booking status is invalid.'=>'Addad n tuṭṭfa ur yettwaqbal ara.','Booking successful, pending confirmation (you will also receive an email once confirmed).'=>'Tuṭṭfa tekcem, tettṛaju asentem (ad d-teṭṭfeḍ imayl mi ara tettusentem).','Booking successful.'=>'Tuṭṭfa tekcem.','Booking summary default text'=>'Aḍris amezwer n ugzul n tuṭṭfa','Booking...'=>'Tuṭṭfa...','Bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin','Bookings %s. Mails Sent.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin %s. Imaylen ttwaznen.','Bookings Consent Error'=>'Tuccḍa n tuqqna n tuṭṭfiwin','Bookings Forms'=>'Tiferkiyin n tuṭṭfiwin','Bookings Stats'=>'Tisnaddanin n tuṭṭfiwin','Bookings Table Settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n tfelwit n tuṭṭfiwin','Bookings View'=>'Askan n tuṭṭfiwin','Bookings are closed for this event.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin ttwamdent i tedyant-agi.','Bookings are disabled in Events Manager. Migrating tickets turns them on.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin ttwansen deg Events Manager. Aneqqel n tikitin ad ten-yermed.','Bookings closed'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin ttwamdent','Bookings data'=>'Isefka n tuṭṭfiwin','Bookings disabled'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin ttwansent','Bookings for %s'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin n %s','Bookings have closed (e.g. event has started).'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin ttwamdent (amedya tadyant tebda).','Bookings that are uncancelled are returned to their previous state (if available), the %1$s PHP constant value or if previous options are not available then pending/approved according to your booking approval settings.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin ur nettwasefsex ara ad uɣalent ɣer waddad-nsent n zik (ma yella), azal n umentil PHP %1$s neɣ ma ulac tifranin n zik ad uɣalent d yettṛajun/yettwaqbel almend n yiɣewwaren-ik n uqbal n tuṭṭfa.','Bookings to individual %s recurrences will be preserved unless you delete tickets or choose to reschedule and delete rescheduled recurrences.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin n yal alugen n %s ad ttwaḥerzent ala ma tekkseḍ tikitin neɣ tferneḍ ad tsenfaliḍ u tekkseḍ yialugen yettwasenfalen.','Bookings to individual event recurrences will be preserved if event times and ticket settings are not modified.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin n yal alugen n tedyant ad ttwaḥerzent ma yella akuden n tedyant d yiɣewwaren n tikitin ur ttwabeddlen ara.','Bookings will be automatically cancelled.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin ad ttwaḥbsent s wudem awurman.','Bookings will not be confirmed until the event administrator approves it.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin ur ttwasentamen ara alamma yeqbel-itent unedbal n tedyant.','Bookings/Registration'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin/Asekles','Buffer'=>'Tilisa','Bulk Actions'=>'Tigawin igerwen','Bulk actions'=>'Tigawin igerwen','Button & page labels'=>'Isemmaden n tqeffalt d usebter','Buy %s'=>'Aɣ %s','Buy on Woo.com'=>'Aɣ deg Woo.com','By default, event spaces become unavailable once there are enough CONFIRMED bookings. To reserve spaces even if unapproved, choose yes.'=>'S wudem amezwer, idagen n tedyant ur ttwajiden ara ticki llan ddeqs n tuṭṭfiwin ITTWASENTMEN. I wakken ad tḥerzeḍ idagen daɣen ma ur ttwaqbalen ara, fren ih.','By default, events that have an end date later than today will be included in searches, set this to yes to consider events that started \'yesterday\' as past.'=>'S wudem amezwer, tidyanin yesɛan azemz n taggara d wayeḍ n ass-agi ad ttwabnent deg unadi, sbadu ɣer ih i wakken ad ttwaḥsben tidyanin i yebdan \'iḍelli\' d tidyanin yezrin.','By default, if a calendar day only has one event, it display a single event when clicking on the link of that calendar date. If you select Yes here, you will get always see a list of events.'=>'S wudem amezwer, ma yella yiwen n wass n tfada yesɛa kan yiwet n tedyant, ad d-yeskan yiwet n tedyant mi ara tsiteḍ ɣef useɣwen n wass-a n tfada. Ma tferneḍ Ih da, ad twaliḍ yal tikkelt tabdart n tidyanin.','By default, if a guest tries to book an event using the email of a user account on your site they will be asked to log in, selecting yes will bypass this security measure.'=>'S wudem amezwer, ma yeɛreḍ umerza ad yeṭṭef tadyant s yimayl n ukaunt n useqdac ɣef usmel-ik, ad yettwasuter ad yeqqen, afran n ih ad yeǧǧ aya.','By default, when a booking is made by a user, this booking is tied to a user account, if the user is not registered nor logged in and guest bookings are enabled, an account will be created for them.'=>'S wudem amezwer, mi ara txedmeḍ tuṭṭfa, tuṭṭfa-a tebedd ɣer ukaunt n useqdac, ma yella useqdac ur yeklis ara neɣ ur yeqqin ara u tuṭṭfiwin n yimerza ttwarmden, ukaunt ad yettwasnulfu i yimi-ines.','By editing your primary recurrence set, you will change all subsequent default values of your other recurrences.'=>'S uẓrag n ugraw-ik agejdan n yialugen, ad tbeddleḍ azal meṛṛa amezwer n yialugen-nniḍen.','By using formats, you can control how your %s are displayed from within the Events Manager <a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>Formatting</a> tab above without having to edit your theme files.'=>'S useqdec n yimusal, tzemreḍ ad tḥekmeḍ deg wamek ara d-banen %s-ik seg yiccer n <a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>Amsal</a> n Events Manager ukkud war ma tẓergeḍ ifuyla n usentel-ik.','CPT'=>'CPT','CPT (Plural)'=>'CPT (Aget)','CPT (Single)'=>'CPT (Asuf)','CPT name (plural) must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'Isem CPT (aget) ilaq ad yesɛu kan isekkilen imecḍaḍen, imḍanen akked yijerriden n ukessar.','CPT name must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'Isem CPT ilaq ad yesɛu kan isekkilen imecḍaḍen, imḍanen akked yijerriden n ukessar.','CPTs'=>'CPTs','CSS File'=>'Afaylu CSS','CSV file'=>'Afaylu CSV','CSV file does not appear to contain valid data.'=>'Afaylu CSV ur d-yettban ara yegber isefka imeɣta.','Calendar'=>'Tafada','Calendar Day Event List Settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n tebdart n tidyanin n wass n tfada','Calendar Selection'=>'Afran seg tefada','Calendar Size'=>'Tiddi n tfada','Calendar events/day limit'=>'Talast n tidyanin/n wass deg tfada','Calendar settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n tfada','Calendar size'=>'Tiddi n tfada','Call get-booking-requirements with this event\'s ID for the exact required fields, their payload locations (attendee fields go under em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee), and a ready-to-submit example.'=>'Siwel get-booking-requirements s ID n tedyant-a i wakken ad tawiḍ urtiyen ilaqen, ideg ttwarzen (urtiyen n yimttekkiyen ddan deg em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee), d umedya yewjden i uzzenz.','Calling em_get_option() too early whilst EM\\Archetypes class is not available.'=>'Asiwel n em_get_option() uqbel akud mi ara tella tneɣruft EM\\Archetypes ur telli ara.','Can attendees change their RSVP status? You can choose whether they can uncancel an RSVP below as well.'=>'Zemren imttekkiyen ad beddlen addad n tinnubga-nsen? Tzemreḍ ad tferneḍ daɣen ma zemren ad uɣalen ad rzun tinnubga ukessar.','Can be in form of pixels or a percentage such as %s or %s.'=>'Tezmer ad tili s yiwenniten neɣ s tafrayt am %s neɣ %s.','Can users cancel their booking?'=>'Zemren iseqdacen ad semmten tuṭṭfa-nsen?','Can users uncancel their booking?'=>'Zemren iseqdacen ad uɣalen ad rzun tuṭṭfa-nsen yettwasemmten?','Cancel'=>'Sesfex','Cancel Ticket Recreation'=>'Sefsex tulsa n usnulfu n tikit','Cancel all confirmed and pending bookings automatically.'=>'Ḥbes akk tuṭṭfiwin yettwasentemen neɣ yegguni s wudem awurman.','Cancel bookings?'=>'Ḥbes tuṭṭfiwin?','Cancelation complete'=>'Asefsex yemmed','Cancelation error'=>'Tuccḍa n usefsex','Cancelation in progress'=>'Asefsex yedda','Canceling...'=>'Asefsex...','Cancellation'=>'Asemmet','Cancellation Actions'=>'Tigawin n weḥbas','Cancellations'=>'Asefsex','Cancellations are not permitted for this booking.'=>'Ur ttwasirgent ara tigtin n usefsex i tuṭṭfa-agi.','Cancelled'=>'Yettwaḥbes','Cancelled event email'=>'Imayl n tedyant yettwaḥbesen','Cannot create a Archetype CPT name %s, this must be at most 20 characters long, containing letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Ur zmiregh ara ad snulfuɣ isem n CPT n Archetype %s, ilaq ad yili d 20 n yisekkilen ugar, yesɛa kan isekkilen, uṭṭunen, tiruccaḍ d yiɣenjiwen n uzwel.','Canvas tabs'=>'Iccaren n teɣzut','Categories'=>'Taggayin','Categories dropdown label'=>'Tabzimt n tebdart n taggayin i d-yeccuren','Categories list page'=>'Asebter n tebdart n taggayin','Category'=>'Taggayt','Category IDs'=>'Id n taggayin','Category Related Placeholders'=>'Isemlen n wadig yemṣadan d taggayt','Category pages'=>'Isebtar n taggayt','Category:'=>'Taggayt:','Change'=>'Beddel','Changed timeslots get %s'=>'Tuzmilin n wakud yettwabeddlen ad d-awint %s','Changes a booking status, such as approving, rejecting, or cancelling it.'=>'Yettbeddil addad n tuṭṭfa, am wawal n uqbal, agi neɣ afsex.','Changes saved'=>'Isenfal ttwaklasen','Changes saved.'=>'Ibeddilen kelsen.','Changing the location of this event will delete its %s meeting or broadcast, and anyone holding the old link will no longer be able to join.'=>'Abeddel n wadrar n tedyant-a ad yekkes tuddsa neɣ tuzzna n %s, u wid i yesɛan aseɣwen aqdim ur zmiren ara ad ddun.','Chart Options'=>'Tixtiṛiyin n udlis','Chart Type'=>'Anaw n udlis','Check Dev Versions'=>'Senqed lqemmen n usnernu','Check attendees in at the door by scanning tickets, manage events and bookings, and follow booking and sales status from your phone. Available on the App Store for iPhone and iPad. Included with Pro Plus, or available by subscription for any Events Manager site.'=>'Ssenqed imttekkiyen ɣer tewwurt s uḍfar n tikitin, sefrek tidyanin d tuṭṭfiwin, u ḍfer addad n tuṭṭfiwin d tisatin seg tilifun-ik. Yella deg App Store i iPhone d iPad. Yeddukkel d Pro Plus, neɣ s ujerred i yal asmel n Events Manager.','Check this option if you want the event contact to receive an email when someone books places. An email will be sent when a booking is first made (regardless if confirmed or pending)'=>'Fren afran-a ma tebɣiḍ anermis n tedyant ad yawi imayl mi ara ṭṭfen kra n yidagen. Imayl ad yettwazen mi ara tettwaxdem tuṭṭfa tamezwarut (ɣas ma tettwasentem neɣ tettṛaju)','Check this option if you want to prevent the WordPress registration email from going out when a user anonymously books an event.'=>'Fren tixtiṛt-a ma tebɣiḍ ad ur d-yettwazen ara imayl n usekles n WordPress mi ara yexdem useqdac tuṭṭfa n tedyant s war isem.','Check this option to enable Google Map integration.'=>'Wali tixtiṛt-a i wakken ad tesremdeḍ amsidef n Google Maps.','Checking for dev versions.'=>'Anadi ɣef yileqqmen n usnerni.','Checking for the latest stable version.'=>'Anadi ɣef lqem aneggaru yerzan.','Checking...'=>'Asenqed...','Checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release, skipping the staggered rollout delay (which can take up to 24 hours). Any newer stable version will appear on your Plugins or Updates page for a manual update.'=>'Isenqed WordPress.org s wudem ameḍran i lqem usligen aneggaru, ur yețṛaju ara asuffeɣ s waṭas n yiḍ (ayen ara yeddun alamma d 24 n yisragen). Yal lqem usligen amaynut ad d-yettban deg usebter-nnek n yiseɣzaf neɣ n yileqqmen i uleqqem s ufus.','Choose a color for your %s. You can access this using the %s placeholder.'=>'Fren yiwen n yini i %s-ik. Tzemreḍ ad tkecmeḍ ɣer-s s useqdec n usmel n wadig %s.','Choose a settings file saved from a backup or another Events Manager installation and click the \'%s\' button.'=>'Fren afaylu n yiɣewwaren yettwaklesen seg usekles neɣ seg usbeddi nniḍen n Events Manager, sakin sit ɣef tqeffalt \'%s\'.','Choose an image for your %s, which can be displayed using the %s placeholder.'=>'Fren yiwet n tugna i %s-ik, ara d-yettwaskanen s useqdec n usmel n wadig %s.','Choose another file'=>'Fren afaylu nniḍen','Choose from most used %s'=>'Fren seg %s yettwaseqdacen aṭas','Choose from most used event categories'=>'Fren seg taggayin n tedyant yettwaseqdacen aṭas','Choose from most used event tags'=>'Fren seg tibzimin n tedyant yettwaseqdacen aṭas','Choose graph type and stacking view options. Some views and stacking may not be available for all setting combinations.'=>'Fren anaw n uwonaf akked textiṛiyin n usegmi. Kra n tmuɣliwin d usegmi ur ttwafen ara i yal tmetti n yiɣewwaren.','Choose how prices are displayed. <code>@</code> will be replaced by the currency symbol, and <code>#</code> will be replaced by the number.'=>'Fren amek ara ttwaskanen ssuma. <code>@</code> ad yettwasmelsi s usentel n wadrim, u <code>#</code> ad yettwasmelsi s wuṭṭun.','Choose how timeslots are listed in booking forms for recurring events and events with multiple timeslots.'=>'Fren amek ara ttwabdren tallunin deg tseddast n tuṭṭfa i tedyanin i d-yettuɣalen akked tedyanin yesɛan aṭas n tallunin.','Choose how to format your group heading dates. Leave blank for default.'=>'Fren amek ara tmasleḍ izemzen n yizwal n ugraw. Eǧǧ-it ilem i useqdec n umasal amezwer.','Choose how to format your group headings.'=>'Fren amek ara tmasleḍ izwal n yegrawen.','Choose how to show a information about an event when clicking or hovering over a single event on the calendar.'=>'Fren amek ara d-tskeneḍ talɣut ɣef tedyant mi ara tsiteḍ neɣ tettεeddiḍ s uɣerbal ɣef yiwet n tedyant deg tfada.','Choose the start date for comparing equivalent date ranges. The latest comparison end date is day before main duration start date.'=>'Fren azemz n usenna i usmifer n yizrar n yizemzen yemṣadan. Azemz aneggaru n tagara n usmifer d ass send azemz n usenna n tanzagt tagejdant.','Choose to show events within a specific time range.'=>'Fren ad d-tskeneḍ tidyanin deg yiwen n tazrawt n wakud i d-yettwafernen.','Choose what to show users on their booking management page.'=>'Fren acu ara d-yettwaskan i yiseqdacen deg usebter-nsen n usefrek n tuṭṭfiwin.','Choose whether or not to display a login form in the booking form area to remind your members to log in before booking.'=>'Fren ma ara d-yettwaskan neɣ ala tamserkant n tuqqna deg tmura n tserkant n tuṭṭfa i wakken ad tesmektiḍ iɛeggalen-ik ad qqnen send ad ṭṭfen.','Choose whether to display the main search bar. If disabled, advanced search fields will be shown in \'Inline\' mode automatically. You must also choose to enable at least one advanced search field, to avoid having an emtpy search form.'=>'Fren ma tebɣiḍ ad d-tbanen tfelwit tagejdant n unadi. Ma yella tensa, urtiyen n unadi anaẓi ad d-banen s wudem awurman deg uskar \'Inline\'. Ilaq daɣen ad tferneḍ ad tremdeḍ ma drus yiwen n urti n unadi anaẓi, i wakken ur d-yettili ara wemsal n unadi ilem.','Choose whether to show a preview of the upcoming events for the date clicked on, or directly link to the calendar day.'=>'Fren ma tebɣiḍ ad d-tskeneḍ tamuɣli n tidyanin ara d-yusan i wass i tsiteḍ ɣer-s, neɣ ad tarzeḍ s wudem uslig ɣer wass n tfada.','Choose which %s account hosts this event.'=>'Fren amiḍan %s ara yuddsen tadyant-a.','Choose which order your tickets appear.'=>'Fren amizwer ara d-banent tikitin.','Choose your currency for displaying event pricing.'=>'Fren adrim-ik i uskan n ssuma n tedyant.','Choose/Upload Image'=>'Fren/Sali-d tugna','City'=>'Taddart','City/Town'=>'Tamdint/Taɣremt','City/Town:'=>'Tamdint/Taɣremt:','Classic Editor'=>'Amaẓrag aklasiki','Clear All'=>'Sfeḍ akk','Click the button below to mass-convert all your repeating events into recurring events.'=>'Sit ɣef tqeffalt ukessar i wakken ad tsizdgeḍ akk tidyanin-ik i d-yettuɣalen ɣer tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen.','Click to toggle'=>'Ssed i usnifel','Clicking these buttons will not have any effect until you save your settings!'=>'Asiti ɣef tqeffalin-a ur d-yesɛi ara tangalt alamma tseklesed iɣewwaren-ik!','Close Ticket Editor'=>'Mdel amaẓrag n tikitin','Collapse All'=>'Ḍfes kulec','Color'=>'Ini','Column %d'=>'Tagejdit %d','Column in the file'=>'Tagejdit deg ufaylu','Columns for repeating events'=>'Tigejdiyin n tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen','Columns to choose'=>'Ijga ara tferneḍ','Columns to export'=>'Ijga ara tsifḍeḍ','Columns to show'=>'Ijga ara d-yettwaskanen','Comma-separated address(es) notified of each withdrawal for manual review. Leave blank to use the site admin email.'=>'Tansiwin (yemfarqen s tfesyin) ara yettwaselɣun ɣef yal usuɣal i uselken s ufus. Eǧǧ-it d ilem i useqdec n imayl n unedbal n usmel.','Comma-separated list of allowed file extensions: %s. Leave blank to allow any.'=>'Tabdart yebḍan s tefrayin n yiseggimen n yifuyla yettusirgen: %s. Eǧǧ-it d ilem akken ad tsirgeḍ kra.','Comment'=>'Awennit','Communications Consent'=>'Tuqqna n tgectiwin','Compare With'=>'Smifer d','Compare features'=>'Serwet timahilin','Compared to'=>'Amsifer d','Configure the base settings for your events. These settings affect how events are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'Seɣwer iɣewwaren n taffa n tidyanin-ik. Iɣewwaren-a ɣef-sen i ttwakelsen tidyanin u amek ara ttwaksen deg uzadur n isefka.','Configure the base settings for your locations. These settings affect how locations are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'Seɣwer iɣewwaren n taffa n yidrar-ik. Iɣewwaren-a ɣef-sen i ttwakelsen yidrar u amek ara ttwaksen deg uzadur n isefka.','Confirm'=>'Sentem','Confirm button'=>'Taqeffalt n usentem','Confirmation email could not be sent to admin. Registrant should have gotten their email (only admin see this warning).'=>'Imayl n usentem ur yezmir ara ad yettwazen i unedbal. Amsekles ilaq ad yawi imayl-is (anedbal kan i d-yettwali alɣu-a).','Confirmations'=>'Isentamen','Confirmed'=>'Yettusentem','Confirmed Spaces'=>'Idagen yettusentmen','Confirmed booking email'=>'Imayl n tuṭṭfa yettusentem','Congratulations! Your email settings work.'=>'Ihni! Iɣewwaren n yimayl-ik ttxeddmen.','Connect'=>'Tuqqna','Connect Events Manager to MCP-compatible AI clients (Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT custom connectors, VS Code, Codex) by exposing Events Manager Abilities through the WordPress MCP Adapter. Clients authenticate through a one-click consent screen and a refreshable Application Password — no manual key juggling.'=>'Qqen Events Manager ɣer yimsaɣen AI yemṣadan d MCP (Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT custom connectors, VS Code, Codex) s usekcem n tezmirin n Events Manager s WordPress MCP Adapter. Imsaɣen ttwasesteben s ugdil n uqbal s yiwen n usiti d Awal n uɛeddi n usnas i yettwaleqqmen, war aseqdec n tsura s ufus.','Connect a %s account in the Events Manager settings before using it as an event location.'=>'Qqen amiḍan %s deg yiɣewwaren n Events Manager send ad t-tesqedceḍ am adrar n tedyant.','Connect an account'=>'Qqen amiḍan','Connect to import events and locations from %s.'=>'Qqen akken ad tkteṛeḍ tidyanin d yidrar seg %s.','Consent'=>'Tuqqna','Consent %s on %s'=>'Tuqqna %s di %s','Consent Error'=>'Tuccḍa n tuqqna','Consent Text'=>'Aḍris n tuqqna','Consent previously %s on %s'=>'Tuqqna zik %s di %s','Consented By Default'=>'Yeqqen s wudem amezwer','Contact a site administrator for your password.'=>'Nermes anedbal n usmel i wawal-ik n uɛeddi.','Content supplied within shortcode tags and the %s parameters will be HTML entity-decoded and sanitized.'=>'Agbur i d-yettwafka deg tebzimin n unegzum akked yiɣewwaren %s ad ttwafken s HTML entity u ad ttwasfḍen.','Content supplied within shortcode tags like %s will be HTML entity-decoded.'=>'Agbur i d-yettwafka deg tebzimin n unegzum am %s ad yettwafek s HTML entity.','Control how subsites use Archetypes. Define network-wide types here and decide whether subsites can create, choose, or must use your list. You can also allow/deny renaming specific base settings.'=>'Wali amek ara seqdacen yismal imaynuten Archetypes. Sbadu da anawen n uẓeṭṭa meṛṛa u wali ma yismal zemren ad snulfun, ad fren neɣ ilaq ad seqdacen umuɣ-nnek. Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tsirgeḍ/tgiḍ ibeddilen n kra n yiɣewwaren n taffa.','Controls how many events being held at a location are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Iḥkem deg waṭas n tidyanin yettwabdaren deg wadrar i d-ttbanen deg yal asebter mi ara tesqedceḍ yismilen n wadig am %s. Eǧǧ-it d ilem i war talast.','Controls how many events belonging to a category are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Ixeddem acḥal n tidyanin n taggayt i d-yettwaskanen deg yiwen n usebter mi ara tesqedceḍ iwenniten am %s. Eǧǧ-it d ilem i war talast.','Controls how many events belonging to a tag are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Ixeddem acḥal n tidyanin n tebzimt i d-yettwaskanen deg yiwen n usebter mi ara tesqedceḍ iwenniten am %s. Eǧǧ-it d ilem i war talast.','Convert ALL Repeating Events'=>'Beddel AKK tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen','Convert Recurring'=>'Beddel ɣer ayen i d-yettuɣalen','Convert and Deactivate Repeating Events'=>'Sizdeg u ssexsi tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen','Coordinates'=>'Imsegdalen','Copies your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %s into Events Manager. Nothing in the original plugin is changed or deleted, so you can run this, check the result, and roll it back or run it again.'=>'Yeneqqel tidyanin-ik, idrar, imsuddsen, tikitin d yimttekkiyen seg %s ɣer Events Manager. Ulac ayen yettwabeddlen neɣ yettwakksen deg uzegrar aqdim, ihi tzemreḍ ad t-tseddreḍ, ad twaliḍ agmuḍ, ad t-tuɣaleḍ ɣer deffir neɣ ad t-tɛawdeḍ.','Copy default value'=>'Nɣel azal amezwer','Copy over our new v6 formats to make the best of our new UI design!'=>'Nɣel imasalen-nneɣ imaynuten n v6 akken ad tessemrseḍ afeṣṣel-nneɣ amaynut n useqdac!','Cost'=>'Ssuma','Could not check event validation. Saving without pre-check — please verify the event details.'=>'Ur izmir ara ad ssenqed asentem n tedyant. Asekles war uselken uzwir, ma ulac aɣilif ssenqed ifatusen n tedyant.','Could not open the PDF file for inspection.'=>'Ur izmir ara ad yldi afaylu PDF i usenqed.','Could not open the file for inspection.'=>'Ur izmir ara ad yldi afaylu i usenqed.','Could not read image size information.'=>'Ur izmir ara ad yeɣer talɣut n teɣzi n tugna.','Count'=>'Amḍan','Country'=>'Tamurt','Coupons and discount codes'=>'Ikuponen d tengalin n tkumit','Create %s'=>'Snulfu %s','Create Zoom meetings and webinars from the event editor, and register attendees on Zoom when they book. With Pro, attendees are registered once they pay and receive their own join links.'=>'Ssirem inagan d webinarat n Zoom seg umaẓrag n tedyant, u smekti imttekkiyen deg Zoom mi ttesṭṭfen. S Pro, imttekkiyen ttwaklasen ticki xelṣen u remmasen iseɣwan-nsen n uttekki.','Create a location or start typing to search a previously created location.'=>'Snulfu-d adrar neɣ bdu ara tarreḍ i unadi ɣef udrar yettwasnulfun uzwir.','Create booking'=>'Snulfu-d tuṭṭfa','Create event'=>'Snulfu-d tadyant','Create event ticket'=>'Snulfu-d tikit n tedyant','Create location'=>'Snulfu-d adrar','Creates a ticket for an Events Manager event.'=>'Yesnulfa-d tikit i tedyant n Events Manager.','Creates an Events Manager %s.'=>'Yesnulfa-d %s n Events Manager.','Creates an Events Manager booking. Call get-booking-requirements first to get this event\'s required fields, payload locations, and an example payload.'=>'Yesnulfa-d tuṭṭfa n Events Manager. Siwel get-booking-requirements send i wakken ad tawiḍ urtiyen ilaqen n tedyant-a, ideg ttwarzen, d umedya n yisefka.','Creates an Events Manager event.'=>'Yesnulfa-d tadyant n Events Manager.','Creates an Events Manager location.'=>'Yesnulfa-d adrar n Events Manager.','Currency'=>'Adrim','Currency Format'=>'Amasal n wadrim','Currency code'=>'Tangalt n wadrim','Currency position (prefix or suffix)'=>'Adig n wadrim (prefix or suffix)','Currency symbol'=>'Aseklu n wadrim','Currently overridden by the EM_GUTENBERG constant in wp-config.php (%s).'=>'Tura yettwasenfel s uḥedday EM_GUTENBERG deg wp-config.php (%s).','Custom Dates'=>'Izemzen yugnen','Custom Link'=>'Aseɣwen udmawan','Custom Links'=>'Iseɣwan udmawanen','Custom booking forms and individual attendee forms'=>'Tisemrkanin n tuṭṭfa udmawanin d tisemrkanin n yimttekkiyen','Custom fields are the same as attributes, except you cannot restrict specific values, users can add any kind of custom field name/value pair. Only available in the WordPress admin area.'=>'Urtiyen yugnen am yiraten, anagar ur tezmireḍ ara ad tesgugmeḍ azalen yettwaskanen, iseqdacen zemren ad rnun yal isem/azal n urti yugnen. Yella kan deg tmennaṭ n unedbal n WordPress.','Customize Feedback Messages'=>'Sagen iznan n tmuɣli','Customize the format of the selected search dates, we recommend a brief format to keep things short.'=>'Sagen amasal n yizemzen n unadi yettwafernen, nettwasmuttu amasal ameẓẓyan i wakken ad yeqqim kra yeḥṛes.','Customize the message your user sees when they resubmit/update their event.'=>'Sagen izen ara iwali useqdac mi ara yales uzzna/yeleqqem tadyant-is.','Customize the message your user sees when they submitted their event.'=>'Sagen izen ara iwali useqdac mi ara yazen tadyant-is.','Customizer'=>'Afecku n usagen','Daily'=>'Yal ass','Database Cleanup'=>'Aselkem n uzadur n isefka','Date'=>'Azemz','Date Format'=>'Amasal n uzemz','Date Picker Format'=>'Amasal n umefran n uzemz','Date Preview Mode'=>'Askar n tmuɣli n uzemz','Date Separator'=>'Anabraz n yizemzen','Date and Time'=>'Azemz akked wakud','Date and Time formats follow the <a href="%s">WordPress time formatting conventions</a>'=>'Imusal n uzemz akked wakud ḥerzen <a href="%s">isadaren n umasal n wakud n WordPress</a>','Date and time'=>'Azemz d wakud','Date/Time'=>'Azemz/Asrag','Dates'=>'Izemzen','Dates must have correct formatting. Please use the date picker provided.'=>'Izemzen ilaq ad ɣer amasal ameɣtu. Ttxil seqdec amefran n yizemzen.','Dates such as 2027-03-04 or March 4, 2027 are always read the same way.'=>'Izemzen am 2027-03-04 neɣ March 4, 2027 ttwaɣraen yal tikkelt s yiwen n wudem.','Dates written as numbers'=>'Izemzen yettwaruen d yimḍanen','Day %d'=>'Ass %d','Day first: 03/04/2027 is April 3'=>'Ass d amezwaru: 03/04/2027 d April 3','Days of week'=>'Ussan n yimalas','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>You have requested #_BOOKINGSPACES space/spaces for #_EVENTNAME.<br/>When : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Where : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Your booking is currently pending approval by our administrators. Once approved you will receive an automatic confirmation.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'A #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Tesutreḍ #_BOOKINGSPACES adig/idagen i #_EVENTNAME.<br/>Melmi : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Anda : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Tuṭṭfa-inek tettṛaju taqbalt n yinedbalen-nneɣ. Mi ara tettwaqbel, ad d-teṭṭfeḍ asentem awurman.<br/>Ugar n tmusni,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>You have successfully reserved #_BOOKINGSPACES space/spaces for #_EVENTNAME.<br/>When : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Where : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'A #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Tuṭṭfeḍ #_BOOKINGSPACES adig/idagen i #_EVENTNAME akken iwata.<br/>Melmi : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Anda : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Ugar n tmusni,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'A #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Tuṭṭfa i tesutreḍ n #_BOOKINGSPACES idagen deg #_EVENTNAME di #_EVENTDATES tettwasefsex.<br/>Ugar n tmusni,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been rejected.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'A #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Tuṭṭfa i tesutreḍ n #_BOOKINGSPACES idagen deg #_EVENTNAME di #_EVENTDATES tettwagi.<br/>Ugar n tmusni,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear %s'=>'A %s','Dear Guest, <br/>We regret to inform you that #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'A yimdan, <br/>Nesḥassef ad ɣer-wen nini #_EVENTNAME di #_EVENTDATES tettwaḥbes.<br/>Ugar n tmusni,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Decimal Point'=>'Tanqiḍt tazrigt','Decode shortcode content?'=>'Fek tangalt i d-yettwarun deg unegzum?','Decode shortcode format parameters?'=>'Fek iɣewwaren n umasal n unegzum?','Default'=>'Amezwer','Default %s color'=>'Ini amezwer n %s','Default %s list format'=>'Amasal amezwer n tebdart n %s','Default %s list options'=>'Tixtiṛiyin timezwura n tebdart n %s','Default (site setting)'=>'Amezwer (aɣewwar n usmel)','Default Category'=>'Taggayt tamezwert','Default Country'=>'Tamurt tamezwert','Default List Scope'=>'Azrag amezwer n tebdart','Default Location'=>'Adrar amezwer','Default Location Country'=>'Tamurt tamezwert n wadrar','Default Timezone'=>'Tamnaḍt tasragant tamezwert','Default View'=>'Tamuɣli tamezwer','Default archive ordering'=>'Amizwer amezwer n yiɣbaren','Default calendar size'=>'Tiddi tamezwert n tfada','Default distance'=>'Tanekra tamezwert','Default distance unit'=>'Aseggas n tanekra tamezwert','Default event archive ordering'=>'Amizwer amezwer n yiɣbaren n tedyant','Default event list format'=>'Amasal amezwer n tebdart n tidyanin','Default event list format footer'=>'Aḍar n umasal amezwer n tebdart n tidyanin','Default event list format header'=>'Aqeṛṛu n umasal amezwer n tebdart n tidyanin','Default event list ordering'=>'Asmizwer amezwer n tebdart n tidyanin','Default event style'=>'Aɣanib amezwer n tedyant','Default font family'=>'Tawacult n tsefsit tamezwert','Default list ordering'=>'Amizwer amezwer n tebdart','Default map height'=>'Teɣzi tamezwert n tmidit','Default map width'=>'Tehri tamezwert n tmidit','Default plugin setting'=>'Aɣewwar amezwer n usiɣzef','Default scope to show your events in shortcodes, widgets and any other displays where scope is not defined. Events page and archive scopes can be defined in the %s settings section.'=>'Azrag amezwer i uskan n tidyanin-ik deg yineglamen, iwiǧiten akked kra n yisekliyen ideg ur yettwasbadu ara uzrag. Azrag n usebter n tidyanin d yiɣbaren yezmer ad yettwasbadu deg tigezmi n yiɣewwaren n %s.','Default: %s'=>'Amezwer: %s','Delete'=>'Kkes','Delete %s'=>'Kkes %s','Delete User'=>'Kkes aseqdac','Delete booking'=>'Kkes tuṭṭfa','Delete event'=>'Kkes tadyant','Delete everything migrated from %s (events, locations, tickets, bookings, terms) and restore converted content? The original data is not affected.'=>'Kkes kullec i yettwaneqlen seg %s (tidyanin, idrar, tikitin, tuṭṭfiwin, ilugan) u err ayen yettwabeddel ɣer wadday? Isefka imezwura ur ttwabeddalen ara.','Delete everything the import of %s created (events, locations, organizers, categories, tags and downloaded images)? Items that were already on the site are not affected.'=>'Kkes kullec i d-yerna usekcem n %s (tidyanin, idrar, imsuddsen, taggayin, tibzimin d tugniwin yettwasdren)? Iferdisen i yellan yakan deg usmel ur ttwabeddalen ara.','Delete location'=>'Kkes adrar','Delete selected'=>'Kkes ayen yettwafernen','Delete ticket'=>'Kkes tikit','Deleted'=>'Yettwakkes','Deletes an Events Manager %s.'=>'Yekkes %s n Events Manager.','Deletes an Events Manager ticket if it has no bookings.'=>'Yekkes tikit n Events Manager ma ur tesɛi ara tuṭṭfiwin.','Deletes or trashes an Events Manager event.'=>'Yekkes neɣ yerra ɣer tqecwalt tadyant n Events Manager.','Deletes or trashes an Events Manager location.'=>'Yekkes neɣ yerra ɣer tqecwalt adrar n Events Manager.','Depending on server settings, some sending methods may ignore this settings.'=>'Ɣer iɣewwaren n uqeddac, kra n tarrayin n uzen zemrent ad ttunefken iɣewwaren-agi.','Depending on the nature of your site, you will be subject to one or more national and international privacy/data protection laws such as the %s. Below are some options that you can use to tailor how Events Manager interacts with WordPress privacy tools.'=>'Ɣef wanaw n usmel-ik, ad tettwasɣelleḍ i yiwen neɣ ugar n yiqanunen inamen d yimmalen n tbaḍnit/ummesten n yisefka am %s. Ddaw llant kra n textiṛiyin i wakken ad tesbaduḍ amek i d-teddu Events Manager d yifecka n tbaḍnit n WordPress.','Descending'=>'S usider','Description'=>'Asnummel','Detach'=>'Senṣel','Details'=>'Ifatusen','Details about the event.'=>'Ifatusen ɣef tedyant.','Details about the location.'=>'Ifatusen ɣef udrar.','Detect User Country'=>'Snirem tamurt n useqdac','Dev Mode active: Just a friendly reminder that you are updating to development versions. Only admins see this message, and it will go away when you disable this <a href="#pro-api">here</a> in your settings.'=>'Askar n usnerni urmid: asmekti kan ines tleqqmeḍ ɣer yileqman n usnerni. Ala inedbalen i d-yettwalin izen-agi, ad ttwaḥbes mi ara tsenseḍ aya <a href="#pro-api">dagi</a> deg yiɣewwaren-ik.','Development Versions &amp; Updates'=>'Lqemmen n usnernu &amp; yileqqmen','Difference from the price paid at the time of sale'=>'Amgirred seg ssuma yettwaxelṣen mi ttwazenz','Direct Link'=>'Arez uslig','Disable'=>'Sens','Disable  WordPress Thumbnails?'=>'Sens tugniwin timecṭuḥin n WordPress?','Disable %s'=>'Ssens %s','Disable new registration email?'=>'Ssens imayl n usekles amaynut?','Disable thumbnails?'=>'Sens tugniwin timecṭuḥin?','Disable title rewriting?'=>'Sens uɛiwed n uzwel?','Disabled'=>'Yensa','Disconnect'=>'Gzem tuqqna','Disconnect All'=>'Kkes tuqqna n kulec','Discounts (After Taxes)'=>'Isenqasen (ticki iserreḥ)','Discounts Before Taxes'=>'Isenqasen send iserreḥ','Dismiss'=>'Suref','Dismiss Message'=>'Ttu izen','Disonnect'=>'Kkes tuqqna','Display %s as'=>'Sken %s am','Display %s on your blog.'=>'Sken %s deg ublug-ik.','Display Settings'=>'Aseɣwer n ubeqqeḍ','Display Status'=>'Sken addad','Display a geolocation search textbox which syncs with the main search geolocation box (if enabled).'=>'Sken tabwaḍt n unadi s wadig i yemtawin akked tebwaḍt tagejdant n unadi s wadig (ma yella tettwarmed).','Display a list of event locations on Events Manager.'=>'Sken tabdart n yidrar n tedyanin deg Events Manager.','Display a list of events on Events Manager.'=>'Sken tabdart n tidyanin deg Events Manager.','Display a prominent "Withdraw from contract" link in the site footer, since the law expects the function to be continuously and easily reachable.'=>'Sken aseɣwen ibanen "Ur ttkemmil ara aɛaqed" deg uḍar n usmel, axaṭer ddreɛ yetturǧa tawuri-a ad tili tezmer ad tettwaweḍ s tafrayt yal tikkelt.','Display booking summary?'=>'Sken agzul n tuṭṭfa?','Display calendar in events page?'=>'Sken tafada deg usebter n tidyanin?','Display events on your blog.'=>'Sken tidyanin deg ublug-ik.','Display free booking summary?'=>'Sken agzul n tuṭṭfa tilelli?','Display global %s on main blog?'=>'Sken %s amatu deg ublug agejdan?','Display global events on main blog?'=>'Sken tidyanin tamatutin deg ublug agejdan?','Display locations on your blog.'=>'Sken idrar deg ublug-ik.','Display login form?'=>'Sken tamserkant n tuqqna?','Display on Frontend'=>'Sken deg tsisleɣt','Display on WP Dashboard'=>'Sken deg tfelwit n WP','Display on bookings dashboard'=>'Sken deg tfelwit n tuṭṭfiwin','Display on event bookings admin'=>'Sken deg unedbal n tuṭṭfiwin n tedyant','Display only locations with upcoming events.'=>'Sken kan idrar s tidyanin ara d-yasen.','Display subsection titles above groups of line items, such as taxes, discounts and surcharges.'=>'Sken izwal n tgezmiyin timecṭuḥin nnig yegrawen n yiferdisen n yizirigen, am iserreḥen, isenqas akked tafiṭṭuyin.','Display subsection titles?'=>'Sken izwal n tgezmiyin timecṭuḥin?','Display taxes separately?'=>'Sken iserreḥen s tama?','Display the booking summary if the event is free. If there are any available tickets worth more than 0 then the event is not considered free.'=>'Sken agzul n tuṭṭfa ma tella tedyant d tilelli. Ma llant tikitin yewjiden yesɛan azal ugar n 0 tadyant ur telli ara d tilelli.','Display the number of available spaces (or booking status if full/closed/cancelled) in each timeslot button or dropdown option.'=>'Sken amḍan n yidagen yewjiden (neɣ addad n tuṭṭfa ma tummid/tettwamdel/tettwasefsex) deg yal taqeffalt neɣ afran n tallunt.','Display the timeslot date as well as the time when viewing a specific calendar day.'=>'Sken azemz n tallunt akked wakud mi ara twaliḍ ass yettwafernen n tefada.','Display ticket prices without tax and calculate the tax total separately.'=>'Sken ssuma n tkitin war aserreḥ u ḥseb amatu n iserreḥen s tama.','Display your events in a calendar widget.'=>'Sken tidyanin-ik deg uwiǧit n tfada.','Displaying %1$s&#8211;%2$s of %3$s'=>'Asken n %1$s&#8211;%2$s seg %3$s','Displays %s from all sites on the network by default. You can still restrict %s by blog using shortcodes and template tags coupled with the <code>blog</code> attribute. Requires global tables to be turned on.'=>'Yeskan %s seg yismal akk n uẓeṭṭa s wudem amezwer. Tzemreḍ ad tḥedded %s s ublug s useqdec n yineɣruzen d tebdarin n tneɣrufin s useqdec n useklu <code>blog</code>. Yesra ad ttwarmed tfelwiyin tamatutin.','Displays a booking summary including itemized subtotals, taxes, discounts, surcharges and totals where applicable.'=>'Yeskan agzul n tuṭṭfa s ufessas n ugzul, iserreḥen, isenqas, tafiṭṭuyin d ymutuyen ma yella.','Distance Values'=>'Azalen n tanekra','Do not import'=>'Ur tekcem ara','Do not include'=>'Ur d-sekcem ara','Do you already have an account with us? %s'=>'Tesɛiḍ yakan amiḍan yid-neɣ? %s','Document'=>'Isemli','Documentation'=>'Tasemlit','Don\'t have it? Leave this blank and we\'ll email you a secure link to choose your booking.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara? Eǧǧ-it d ilem u ad ak-nazen yimayl n useɣwen aɣellsan akken ad tferneḍ tuṭṭfa-inek.','Download %s'=>'Sader %s','Download featured images given as web addresses'=>'Sider tugniwin tigejdanin yettunefken d tansiwin web','Draft'=>'Tamerkast','Drafts'=>'Isuddar','Dropdown Selection'=>'Afran seg wumuɣ ara d-yettusliden','Due to how we change how this custom taxonomy is displayed when overriding with formats it is strongly advised that you assign a %s page below, which increases compatibility with various plugins and themes.'=>'Ɣef sebba n wamek i nbeddel askan n tmessartut-a yugnen mi ara tsemselsiḍ s yimusal, yettwanṣeḥ aṭas ad tefkeḍ asebter n %s ddaw, ayen ara yesnernin amṣada d yiseɣzaf d yisental yemgaraden.','Duplicate'=>'Sleg','Duplicate %s'=>'Nɣel %s','Duplicate this event'=>'Sgugem tadyant-agi','Duplicating Events and Locations has been disabled by Events Manager, to avoid breaking data. You can use our Events Manager duplication features instead.'=>'Tuɣalin n tidyanin d yidrar tensa s Events Manager, akken ur ttwaksen ara isefka. Tzemreḍ ad tesqedceḍ timeẓluyin n tuɣalin n Events Manager.','Duration'=>'Tazi','During'=>'Deg','E-mail'=>'Imayl','E-mail: %s'=>'Email: %s','ERROR : Email Not Sent.'=>'TUCCḌA : Imayl ur yettwazen ara.','Each event can have its own timezone if enabled. If set to no, then all newly created events will have the blog timezone, which currently is set to %s'=>'Yal tadyant tezmer ad tesɛu tamnaḍt-is tasragant ma yella yermed. Ma yella yensa, akk tidyanin timaynutin ad sɛun tamnaḍt tasragant n ublug, tura d %s','Earlier Dates'=>'Izwal yezrin','Edit'=>'Ẓreg','Edit %s'=>'Ẓreg %s','Edit Booking'=>'Ẓreg tuṭṭfa','Edit Details'=>'Ẓreg ifatusen','Edit Event'=>'Ẓreg tadyant','Edit Event Category'=>'Ẓreg taggayt n tedyant','Edit Event Tag'=>'Ẓreg tabzimt n tedyant','Edit Location'=>'Ẓreg adrar','Edit Recurring Event'=>'Ẓreg tadyant i d-yettuɣalen','Edit Repeating Event'=>'Ẓreg tadyant i d-yettuɣalen','Edit User'=>'Ẓreg aseqdac','Edit events'=>'Ẓreg tidyanin','Edit location'=>'Ẓreg adrar','Edit locations'=>'Ẓreg idrar','Edit/View'=>'Ẓreg/Wali','Editor'=>'Amaẓrag','Email'=>'Imayl','Email Address'=>'Tansa n yimayl','Email Exists'=>'Imayl yellan yakan','Email Message'=>'Izen n yimayl','Email Sent.'=>'Imayl yettwazen.','Email Settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n yimayl','Email Subject'=>'Asentel n yimayl','Email address'=>'Tansa n yimayl','Email event owner?'=>'Azen imayl i bab n tedyant?','Email events admin?'=>'Azen imayl i unedbal n tedyanin?','Email not sent.'=>'Imayl ur yettwazen ara.','Email sent successfully to %s'=>'Imayl yettwazen akken i %s','Email: %s'=>'Imayl: %s','Emails'=>'Imaylen','Embed Display Type'=>'Anaw n uskan yettwaseddun','Enable'=>'Rmed','Enable %s'=>'Rmed %s','Enable %s attributes?'=>'Rmed iraten n %s?','Enable %s custom fields?'=>'Rmed urtiyen yugnen n %s?','Enable All Styling?'=>'Rmed akk iɣunab?','Enable Archives?'=>'Rmed iɣbaren?','Enable Code Editor for Formats'=>'Rmed amaẓrag n tengalt i yimusal','Enable Comments?'=>'Rmed iwenniten?','Enable Dev Updates?'=>'Rmed ileqqmen n usnernu?','Enable Event Dynamic Timeslots?'=>'Rmed tallunt n wakud tadinamikit n tedyant?','Enable Event Status?'=>'Rmed addad n tedyant?','Enable Event Timeslots?'=>'Rmed tallunt n wakud n tedyant?','Enable Google Maps integration?'=>'Rmed amsidef n Google Maps?','Enable No-User Booking Mode?'=>'Rmed askar n tuṭṭfa war useqdac?','Enable Theme Styling?'=>'Rmed aɣanib n usentel?','Enable Timezone Support?'=>'Rmed tallelt n tmennaḍt tasragant?','Enable Visual Uploader'=>'Rmed asaliyen aẓran','Enable a code/syntax highlighter when clicking on the larger formatting textbox options below, for easier editing of larger HTML parts.'=>'Rmed amaẓrag n tengalt/n tseddast mi ara tsit ɣef textiṛiyin n tebwaḍt n umasal timeqqranin ddaw, i usefrek n yiḥedran HTML imeqqranen.','Enable a modern visual uploader UI.'=>'Rmed agrudem atrar n usali aẓran.','Enable advanced fields?'=>'Rmed urtiyen anaẓiyen?','Enable bookings?'=>'Rmed tuṭṭfiwin?','Enable categories?'=>'Rmed taggayin?','Enable custom event archetypes?'=>'Rmed Archetypes n tidyanin udmawanen?','Enable custom ticket ordering?'=>'Rmed amizwer udmawan n tkitin?','Enable global tables mode?'=>'Rmed askar n tfelwit tamatut?','Enable locations?'=>'Rmed idrar?','Enable multiple file uploads by default.'=>'Rmed asali n waṭas n yifuyla s wudem amezwer.','Enable or disable each notification type. The event/item owner and managers can further control their own preferences from the mobile app.'=>'Rmed neɣ sens yal anaw n tilɣa. Bab n tedyant/n uferdis d inedbalen zemren ad ḥekmen ugar deg textiṛiyin-nsen seg usnas aziraz.','Enable organizers?'=>'Rmed imsuddsen?','Enable push notifications?'=>'Rmed tilɣa n uḥezzeb?','Enable recurrence?'=>'Rmed alugen?','Enable registration for this event'=>'Rmed ajerred i tedyant-agi','Enable repeated events?'=>'Rmed tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen?','Enable right-of-withdrawal button?'=>'Rmed taqeffalt n yizref n usuɣal ɣer deffir?','Enable tags?'=>'Rmed tibzimin?','Enabled'=>'Yermed','Enabled (off by default)'=>'Yermed (yensa s umezwer)','Enabled (on by default)'=>'Yermed (yermed s umezwer)','Enables additional advanced search fields such as dates, country, etc.'=>'Yermed urtiyen n unadi anaẓiyen yernan am yizemzen, tamurt, atg.','Enabling this will prevent us from loading our CSS file on every page, and will only load on specific pages generated by Events Manager.'=>'Asermed n waya ad iḥbes asali n ufaylu CSS-nneɣ ɣef yal asebter, yerna ad yettwali kan ɣef yisebtar yettwasnulfan sɣur Events Manager.','Encryption is always recommended if your SMTP server supports it. If your server supports TLS, this is also the most recommended method.'=>'Awgelhen yettusumer yal tikkelt ma yella aqeddac-ik SMTP yessefrek-it. Ma yella aqeddac-ik yessefrek TLS, wagi d tarrayt yettusumren akk.','End'=>'Taggara','End Date'=>'Azemz n taggara','End Time'=>'Akud n taggara','End date'=>'Azemz n taggara','End time'=>'Akud n taggara','End time is required.'=>'Akud n taggara ilaq.','Ends in %s'=>'Ad yekfu deg %s','Enjoying Events Manager? Help Us Improve!'=>'Tḥemmleḍ Events Manager? Ɛiwen-aɣ ad nesnerni!','Enter a maximum number of spaces (required).'=>'Sekcem amḍan afellay n yidagen (ilaq).','Enter a number.'=>'Sekcem uṭṭun.','Enter a ticket name.'=>'Sekcem isem n tikit.','Enter the number of hours before an event starts for when users can cancel a booking. Leave blank for the start time of the event.'=>'Sekcem amḍan n yisragen send ad ibdu usenfar mi ara zemren ise