t Submitter Emails'=>'Imaylen n yiseqdacen i yuznen tidyanin','Event Summary'=>'Agzul n tedyant','Event Tag'=>'Tabzimt n tedyant','Event Tags'=>'Tibzimin n tedyant','Event Tickets Plus sells tickets as WooCommerce products. Linking keeps each booking attached to its original WooCommerce order.'=>'Event Tickets Plus tzzenz tikitin am yimenzayen WooCommerce. Aseqqen yeḥrez yal tuṭṭfa ɣer taladna-ines tazwarat n WooCommerce.','Event Time(s)'=>'Akud(en) n tedyant','Event Type'=>'Anaw n tedyant','Event and venue descriptions'=>'Aglam n tedyant d wadrar','Event approved email'=>'Imayl n uqbal n tedyant','Event approved subject'=>'Asentel n uqbal n tedyant','Event archives scope'=>'Azrag n yiɣbaren n tedyant','Event attached to %s.'=>'Tadyant tettwaqqen ɣer %s.','Event booking forms'=>'Tamserkant n tuṭṭfa n tedyant','Event cancelled'=>'Tadyant tettwasefsex','Event cancelled '=>'Tadyant tettwasefsex ','Event categories'=>'Taggayin n tedyant','Event could not be attached.'=>'Tadyant ur tezmir ara ad tettwaqqen.','Event could not be deleted.'=>'Tadyant ur tettwakkes ara.','Event could not be detached.'=>'Tadyant ur tezmir ara ad tettwasenṣel.','Event could not be saved.'=>'Tadyant ur tettwaklas ara.','Event data is invalid.'=>'Isefka n tedyant ur ttwaqblen ara.','Event detached.'=>'Tadyant tettwasenṣel.','Event format'=>'Amasal n tedyant','Event fully booked'=>'Tadyant tummidt','Event is fully booked.'=>'Tadyant tebda tuṭṭfa tummidt.','Event list scope'=>'Azrag n tebdart n tidyanin','Event modal preview format'=>'Amasal n tmuɣli n tedyant deg usfaylu udhim','Event name'=>'Isem n tedyant','Event not found, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Tadyant ur tettwaf ara, ihi tugna yettwasliyen ur tettwasbadu ara d tugna tameẓlit-is.','Event not found.'=>'Tadyant ulac-itt.','Event pages'=>'Isebtar n tedyant','Event published email'=>'Imayl n usuffeɣ n tedyant','Event published subject'=>'Asentel n usuffeɣ n tedyant','Event re-attached to %s.'=>'Tadyant tettwaqqen ɣer %s tikkelt-nniḍen.','Event reapproved email'=>'Imayl n uqbal tis-snat n tedyant','Event reapproved subject'=>'Asentel n uqbal tis-snat n tedyant','Event registration and booking management for WordPress. Recurring events, locations, webinars, google maps, rss, ical, booking registration and more!'=>'Asekles n tedyanin d usefrek n tuṭṭfiwin i WordPress. Tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen, idrar, iwebinaren, tkarḍa n google, rss, ical, asekles n tuṭṭfa d wayen-nniḍen!','Event resubmitted email'=>'Imayl n tuzna tis-snat n tedyant','Event resubmitted subject'=>'Asentel n tuzna tis-snat n tedyant','Event start date/time, location name'=>'Azemz/akud n tazwara n tedyant, isem n udrar','Event style'=>'Aɣanib n tedyant','Event submission notifications will be sent to emails added here.'=>'Tilɣa n tuzna n tedyant ad ttwaznent ɣer yimaylen yettwarnan da.','Event submitted email'=>'Imayl n tuzna n tedyant','Event submitted subject'=>'Asentel n tuzna n tedyant','Event timezones for blog %s have been reset to %s.'=>'Tamnaḍt tasragant n tedyanin n ublug %s tettwarr ɣer %s.','Event timezones have been reset to %s.'=>'Tamnaḍt tasragant n tedyanin tettwarr ɣer %s.','Event timezones on all blogs have been reset to %s.'=>'Tamnaḍt tasragant n tedyanin deg yiblugen merra tettwarr ɣer %s.','Event title format'=>'Amasal n uzwel n tedyant','Event tooltip preview format'=>'Amasal n tmuɣli n tedyant deg tallelt','Event tooltips format'=>'Amasal n yiwenniten n tedyant','Event website'=>'Asmel n tedyant','Event.'=>'Tadyant.','Event/Location admin pages'=>'Isebtar n unedbal n tedyant/n wadrar','Eventful Locations?'=>'Idrar s tidyanin?','Events'=>'Tidyanin','Events Calendar'=>'Tafada n tidyanin','Events Duration'=>'Tizi n tedyanin','Events I\'m Attending'=>'Tidyanin ideg ttekkiɣ','Events Manager'=>'Events Manager','Events Manager - %s'=>'Events Manager - %s','Events Manager 5.9 introduced timezone functionality, which does not require certain fields in your database. To maintain backwards compatibility with earlier versions, these fields will still be created.'=>'Events Manager 5.9 yerna tamezzut n tmenna tasragant, ur teḥwaǧ ara kra n urtiyen deg uzadur-ik n isefka. I wakken ad d-yeqqim yemṣada d ileqman yezrin, urtiyen-agi mazal ad ttwaznulfun.','Events Manager 6 onwards has optional styling that maximizes consistency accross different themes. If you\'d like your theme to take over in some or all aspects of our plugin, you can disable our styling here.'=>'Events Manager 6 d wayen i d-iteddun sɛan aɣanib d axtiṛan ayen ara yesnernin amṣada deg yisental yemgaraden. Ma tebɣiḍ aṣental-ik ad yeṭṭef amkan deg kra neɣ akk uḍfaren n usiɣzef-nneɣ, tzemreḍ ad tesnseḍ aɣanib-nneɣ da.','Events Manager Add-ons'=>'Isnernan n Events Manager','Events Manager Bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin n Events Manager','Events Manager Data'=>'Isefka n Events Manager','Events Manager Management'=>'Asefrek n Events Manager','Events Manager Pro'=>'Events Manager Pro','Events Manager Pro %s has received a major security update. Please <a href="%s">read our announcement</a> and log into your account for upgrade options.'=>'Events Manager Pro %s yeṭṭef aleqqem ameqqran n taɣellist. Ɣer <a href="%s">ulɣu-nneɣ</a> u qqen ɣer umiḍan-ik i tefrat n uleqqem.','Events Manager Settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n Events Manager','Events Manager Test Email'=>'Imayl n uɛeṛṛeḍ n Events Manager','Events Manager app'=>'Asnas Events Manager','Events Manager bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin n Events Manager','Events Manager bookings linked to their WooCommerce orders (Events Manager for WooCommerce)'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin n Events Manager yeqqnen ɣer tladnin-nsent n WooCommerce (Events Manager for WooCommerce)','Events Manager can copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %1$s. Nothing in %1$s is changed, so you can check the result before switching it off.'=>'Events Manager izmer ad yenqel tidyanin-ik, idrar, imsuddsen, tikitin d yimttekkiyen seg %1$s. Ulac ayen i yettwabeddlen deg %1$s, ihi tzemreḍ ad twaliḍ agmuḍ send ad t-tsenseḍ.','Events Manager can now show you the latest stable release as soon as it is published, we <b>strongly</b> recommend you do this. Enable this under %1$s. %2$s'=>'Events Manager izmer tura ad k-d-yeskan lqem aqbur aneggaru mi ara yettwasuffeɣ, <b>nettwali</b> ilaq ad tgeḍ aya. Rmed-it deg %1$s. %2$s','Events Manager cannot be uninstalled from this site.'=>'Events Manager ur izmir ara ad yettwakkes seg usmel-agi.','Events Manager for WooCommerce'=>'Events Manager for WooCommerce','Events Manager found events from %s on this site and can copy them, with their venues, organizers, tickets and attendees.'=>'Events Manager yufa tidyanin seg %s deg usmel-a u izmer ad ten-yenqel, d idrar-nsent, imsuddsen, tikitin d yimttekkiyen.','Events Manager has been maintained, developed and supported for free since it was released in 2008, positive reviews are one that help us keep going.'=>'Events Manager yettwaḥrez, yettwasneflul yerna yettwallel baṭel seg ujerred-is deg 2008, tamawt tazreg d ayen i aɣ-yettɛawanen ad neddu zdat.','Events Manager has implemented multiple ways to help prevent or reduce these costs drastically, please check our %s page for more information.'=>'Events Manager isefrek ayen aṭas n ttarrayin i usefsex neɣ i wakken ad ttwaǧǧeḥ ssuma-agi, wali asebter %s i wugar n talɣut.','Events Manager has introduced location types, which can include online locations such as a URL or integrations with webinar platforms such as Zoom! Enable different location types in your settings page, for more information see our %s.'=>'Events Manager isefrek ianawen n yidrar, i izemren ad gen idrar srid am URL neɣ amtawi d yiɣallen n webinar am Zoom! Rmed ianawen n yidrar yemxalafen deg usebter n yiɣewwaren, i wugar n talɣut wali %s.','Events Manager has introduced new privacy tools to help you comply with international laws such as the GDPR, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a> for more information.'=>'Events Manager isefrek ifecka imaynuten n tudert tabaḍnit akken ad k-ɛawnen ad temṣadeḍ d yiqanunen idelsanen am GDPR, <a href="%s">wali tasemlit-nneɣ</a> i wugar n talɣut.','Events Manager has no rule for %1$s, so this was imported as %2$d date.'=>'Events Manager ur yesɛi ara alugen i %1$s, ihi yettwaneqqel d %2$d n uzemz.' . "\0" . 'Events Manager ur yesɛi ara alugen i %1$s, ihi yettwaneqqel d tabdart n %2$d n yizemzen.','Events Manager has no rule for %s.'=>'Events Manager ur yesɛi ara alugen i %s.','Events Manager has no rule for these yet. Such rows are imported as a list of dates, or skipped if you choose that, and the result report names each one.'=>'Events Manager ur yesɛi ara alugen i wid-a akka tura. Izirigen am wa ttwaskcamen d tabdart n yizemzen, neɣ ttwazgalen ma tferneḍ aya, u uneqqis n agmuḍ ismenzi yal yiwen.','Events Manager now has a <a href="">mobile app</a> 🥳 🎉, download it now!'=>'Events Manager tesɛa tura <a href="">asnas n tilifun</a> 🥳 🎉, sider-it tura!','Events Manager now supports multiple timezones for your events! Your events will initially match your blog timezone.'=>'Events Manager tura isefrek aṭas n tmennaḍin tisragantin i tidyanin-ik! Tidyanin-ik ad mṣadant s tazwara d tamnaḍt tasragant n ublug-ik.','Events Manager repeats daily, weekly, monthly on a weekday such as the second Tuesday, and yearly, up to an end date. It has no rule for a day of the month or for ending after a number of times. Either way the result report names each row.'=>'Events Manager yettɛawad yal ass, yal dduṛt, yal ayyur deg wass n dduṛt am wis sin n Tlata, u yal aseggas, alamma d azemz n taggara. Ur yesɛi ara alugen i wass n wayyur neɣ i taggara mbaɛd amḍan n tikkal. Ma yella, uneqqis n agmuḍ ismenzi yal izirig.','Events Manager tools — create and manage events, bookings, locations, tickets and media — for MCP-compatible AI clients.'=>'Ifecka n Events Manager, snulfu-d u sefrek tidyanin, tuṭṭfiwin, idrar, tikitin d umidya i yimsaɣen AI yemṣadan d MCP.','Events Manager validation errors from the last save, if any.'=>'Tuccḍiwin n usentem n Events Manager seg usekles aneggaru, ma llant.','Events Manager was not uninstalled. This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'Events Manager ur yettwakkes ara. Aẓeṭṭa-agi yebḍa tagrumma n tfelwiyin n tedyanin d tuṭṭfiwin, ihi tukksa seg usmel-agi ad tekkes i lebda tidyanin d tuṭṭfiwin n yal asmel n uẓeṭṭa. Kkes seg %s deg ubdil.','Events Manager\'s permalink settings are changed to match, so links to your events keep working without redirects.'=>'Iɣewwaren n useɣwen n Events Manager ttwabeddlen akken ad mṣaḍan, ihi iseɣwan n tidyanin-ik ad ddun war asemmed.','Events Types (Archetypes)'=>'Tanewwiwin n tidyanin (Archetypes)','Events With Bookings Enabled'=>'Tidyanin s tuṭṭfiwin yermed','Events can choose their own?'=>'Tidyanin zemrent ad fernent iman-nsent?','Events can have a status associated with them, such as a cancelled event, which can then be filtered out of search listings. By default, or if disabled, events have an %s status.'=>'Tidyanin zemrent ad sɛun addad am tedyant yettwaḥbesen, ayen ara yeǧǧen ad ttwasizdeg seg tebdarin n unadi. S wudem amezwer, neɣ ma yella yensa, tidyanin sɛan addad %s.','Events can have multiple times per day, the timeslots can be selected from booking forms, timeslots do not have their own event page and are housed under the same event.'=>'Tidyanin zemrent ad sɛun aṭas n yakuden deg wass, tallunt n wakud tezmer ad tettwafren seg tmerkanin n tuṭṭfa, tallunt n wakud ur tesɛi ara asebter-is n tedyant yerna temḥaz tadyant yiwen.','Events cannot start after they end.'=>'Tidyanin ur zmiren ara ad bdun seld ukken ad fakken.','Events current and next month'=>'Tidyanin n wayyur-agi d wayyur i d-yilin','Events date modal preview format'=>'Amasal n tmuɣli n tidyanin n wass deg usfaylu udhim','Events imported from CSV files'=>'Tidyanin yettwakcemen seg yifuyla CSV','Events list page'=>'Asebter n tebdart n tidyanin','Events list settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n tebdart n tedyanin','Events next month'=>'Tidyanin n wayyur i d-yilin','Events on %s'=>'Tidyanin n %s','Events page'=>'Asebter n tidyanin','Events per day'=>'Tidyanin i yal ass','Events require a user to own them. In order to allow events to be submitted anonymously you need to assign that event a specific user. We recommend you create a "Anonymous" subscriber with a very good password and use that. Guests will have the same event permissions as this user when submitting.'=>'Tidyanin ssefk ad ɛan aseqdac i yezwaren. I wakken ad tesirgeḍ uzzna warisem n tedyanin, ilaq ad tefkeḍ i tedyant aseqdac usbiḍ. Nettwala ad tesnulfuḍ ameltaɣ "Warisem" s wawal n uɛeddi igerrzen aṭas, tesqedceḍ-t. Imenzayen ad sɛun izerfan n tedyant am useqdac-a mi ara ttazzin.','Events this month'=>'Tidyanin n wayyur-agi','Events this month (today onwards)'=>'Tidyanin n wayyur-agi (seg ass-agi d wayen i d-yeḍfern)','Events this week (today to %s)'=>'Tidyanin n yimalas-agi (seg ass-agi ɣer %s)','Events this whole week (%s to %s)'=>'Tidyanin n yiseggasen-agi meṛṛa (%s ɣer %s)','Events with multiple dates will appear on each of those dates in the calendar.'=>'Tidyanin s waṭas n yizemzen ad d-banent deg yal wass seg wussan-a deg tfada.','Events with timeslots can further break up timeslots dynamically by adding timeslot durations, buffers and frequencies to create multiple timeslots from one time range. For example, in the mornings, you can have a timeslot every 45 minutes at the start of each hour.'=>'Tidyanin s tlunt n wakud zemrent ad fkent tallunt n wakud s wudem adinamiki s tmerna n tarrayt, n tazmilt d tallunt gar-asen i wakken ad snulfunt aṭas n tlunt n wakud seg yiwen n uzrag n wakud. Amedya, deg uzeggaɣ, tzemreḍ ad tesɛuḍ tallunt n wakud yal 45 n tesdidin deg tazwara n yal asrag.','Events within 12 months'=>'Tidyanin deg 12 n wayyuren','Events within 2 months'=>'Tidyanin deg 2 n wayyuren','Events within 3 months'=>'Tidyanin deg 3 n wayyuren','Events within 6 months'=>'Tidyanin deg 6 n wayyuren','Events won\'t recurr on the following dates:'=>'Tidyanin ur d-ttuɣalent ara deg yizemzen-agi:','Every Minute'=>'Yal tasdidt','Everyone'=>'Wid akk','Everyone else sees the link text without the link. Attendees whose booking includes virtual access get their own join link once the booking is approved. Without bookings, the link is always shown.'=>'Wid nniḍen walan aḍris n useɣwen war aseɣwen. Imttekkiyen yesɛan anekcum virtuel deg tuṭṭfa-nsen ad d-ṭṭfen aseɣwen-nsen n uttekki ticki tettwaqbel tuṭṭfa. War tuṭṭfiwin, aseɣwen yettban yal tikkelt.','Everything in Pro'=>'Kullec deg Pro','Everything in Pro, plus every add-on listed here, on a single license.'=>'Kullec deg Pro, rnu yal asnerni yettwabder dagi, s yiwet n turagt.','Everything on %s is public, so the link appears on the event page and in calendar feeds.'=>'Kullec deg %s d azayez, ihi aseɣwen ad d-yettban deg usebter n tedyant u deg yimuttayen n tafada.','Example Input'=>'Amedya n unekcum','Example:'=>'Amedya:','Excerpt'=>'Agzul','Exclude %s'=>'Beṛṛa %s','Exclude Countries'=>'Ɣef tmura','Exclude on'=>'Ɣef tuffɣa','Exclude taxes from subtotal?'=>'Ffer iserreḥen seg ugzul?','Expand All'=>'Ldi kulec','Export'=>'Sifeḍ','Export Bookings'=>'Sifeḍ tuṭṭfiwin','Export CSV'=>'Sifeḍ CSV','Export Settings'=>'Sifeḍ iɣewwaren','Export these bookings.'=>'Sifeḍ tuṭṭfiwin-a.','Export your Events Manager settings and restore them here or on another website running this plugin.'=>'Sifeḍ iɣewwaren-ik n Events Manager u err-iten da neɣ ɣef usmel nniḍen i iseqdacen asiɣzef-a.','Exported on %s'=>'Yettwasifeḍ ass n %s','Exporter'=>'Asifeḍ','Failed to write upload to temporary file.'=>'Ur yeddi ara uru n usali ɣer ufaylu aẓayan.','Fallback panels'=>'Tigezmiwin n tuγalin','Featured'=>'Yettwafren','Featured (yes or no)'=>'Yettwafren (yes or no)','Featured image (web address or media ID)'=>'Tugna tafellayt (tansa web neɣ asulay n umidya)','Fields marked * are needed. A field can be given to one column only.'=>'Iferdisen yettwacraḍen * ttwasran. Aferdis yezmer ad yettwefk i yiwet n tgejdit kan.','File'=>'Afaylu','File Type'=>'Anaw n ufaylu','File upload is required'=>'Asali n ufaylu ilaq','File upload is required.'=>'Asali n ufaylu ilaq.','Finalize Timezones Upgrade'=>'Fak aleqqem n tmednin tisraganin','Find more dates from the calendar.'=>'Af ugar n yizemzen seg tfada.','Finished'=>'Ifukk','Finishing'=>'Tuggna ɣer taggara','First Name'=>'Isem','First page'=>'Asebter amezwaru','First row'=>'Izirig amezwaru','For monthly: first, second, third, fourth or last.'=>'I wayyur: first, second, third, fourth neɣ last.','For more information see our %s.'=>'I wugar n telqayt, wali %s.','For more information see our <a href="%s">data privacy documentation</a>.'=>'I wugar n telɣut wali <a href="%s">tasemlit n tbaḍnit n yisefka</a> nneɣ.','For multiple emails, separate by commas (e.g. email1@test.com,email2@test.com,etc.)'=>'I waṭas n yimaylen, fren-iten s yijerriden (amedya email1@test.com,email2@test.com,etc.)','For use with the %s placeholder'=>'I useqdec akked usmel n wadig %s','For weekly: one or more, such as Mon, Wed. For monthly: one, used with the week of the month.'=>'I dduṛt: yiwen neɣ ugar, am Mon, Wed. I wayyur: yiwen, yettwasqedcen d dduṛt n wayyur.','For when start/end %s are present, this will separate the two (include spaces here if necessary).'=>'Mi ara llin %s n usenker/n taggara, aya ad yeferrek gar sin (rnu isallen da ma yella ilaq).','Force network-defined list (no subsite choice)'=>'Err s tezmert umuɣ yettwasbadun deg uẓeṭṭa (ulac afran i yismal imaynuten)','Formatting'=>'Amsal','Found %d orphaned events, deleted %d successfully'=>'Ttwafen %d n tedyanin timeddukkal, ttwakksent %d s wudem igerrez','Found in %s'=>'Yettwaf deg %s','Free'=>'Baṭel','Free companion plugins'=>'Izegrar imendiwen n baṭel','Free plugins from the Events Manager team, available on WordPress.org.'=>'Izegrar n baṭel seg tarbaɛt n Events Manager, yellan deg WordPress.org.','Frequency'=>'Tiyawt','From '=>'Seg ','From %1$s to %2$s'=>'Seg %1$s ɣer %2$s','From %s a year'=>'Seg %s deg useggas','Front-end management pages'=>'Isebtar n usefrek deg uzenziɣ n zdat','Full Calendar Options'=>'Textiṛiyin n FullCalendar','Full-Size Calendar'=>'Tafada s tiddi taččurant','Fully Booked'=>'Tummel','Fully booked'=>'Tuṭṭfa tummidt','Further Information'=>'Talɣut tamernant','Future'=>'Ittasen','Future Events Only?'=>'Tidyanin ittasen kan?','Future events'=>'Tidyanin ara d-yasen','Future events only'=>'Tidyanin ittasen kan','Gather panels that can\'t run in the canvas into a tabbed "Event Details" box'=>'Sdukkel tigezmiwin ur izmir ara ad xedmen deg teɣzut ɣer tfekka "Talqayt n tedyant" s iccaren','General'=>'Amatu','General JS'=>'JS amatu','General Options'=>'Iferdisen imatuten','General settings'=>'Iɣewwaren imatuten','Geolocation Search'=>'Anadi s wadig','Get %s'=>'Awi %s','Get booking'=>'Awi-d tuṭṭfa','Get booking requirements'=>'Awi-d ilaqen n tuṭṭfa','Get event'=>'Awi-d tadyant','Get event availability'=>'Awi-d tuɣdest n tedyant','Get location'=>'Awi-d adrar','Get ticket'=>'Awi-d tikit','Getting Help for Events Manager'=>'Tallelt i Events Manager','Give each date of a recurring event its own meeting link'=>'Efk i yal azemz n tedyant i d-yettuɣalen aseɣwen-is n tdukkli','Give the file to import with --file=<path>.'=>'Efk afaylu ara tekcmeḍ s --file=<path>.','Global %s slug'=>'Aberriḥ n %s amatu','Global Map Format'=>'Amasal n tmidit tamatut','Google Calendar'=>'Google Calendar','Google Map Type'=>'Anaw n tmidit n Google','Google Maps API Browser Key'=>'Tasarut n yiminig n Google Maps API','Google Maps API provides you with ways to display maps of your locations and help site visitors find events near their desired locations.'=>'Google Maps API ak-d-yefk iwudam i uskan n tummidin n yidrar-ik yerna ad ɛawen inebgawen ad af-d tidyanin ɣer wanda ara bɣun.','Google Maps Style'=>'Aɣanib n Google Maps','Google Maps Styling Wizard'=>'Amaẓrag n uɣanib n Google Maps','Google Maps and Location Services'=>'Google Maps d tmahlin n wadig','Google Maps require an API key, please see our %s page for instructions on obtaining one.'=>'Google Maps tesra tasarut API, ttxil-k wali asebter %s i tiwelhiwin ɣef wamek ara tt-tawiḍ.','Google has introduced new pricing for displaying maps on your site. If you have moderate traffic levels, this may likely affect you with surprise and unexpected costs!'=>'Google isefrek ssuma tamaynut i uskan n tefsiwin deg usmel-ik. Ma yella uzuɣ-ik d ameɣnas, aya izmer ad k-yesḥassef s ssuma ur nettwaqeɛ ara!','Google may charge you for usage, depending on how much traffic your site receives. For more information about how and where Events Manager uses the Google Maps API, and how to manage costs, please see our %s page.'=>'Google yezmer ad ak-yeḥseb ɣef useqdec, almend n umḍan n yineblayen n usmel-ik. I wugar n telɣut ɣef wamek d wanda i d-yesqedac Events Manager Google Maps API, d wamek ara tesɛeddiḍ ɣef leḥsab, ttxil-k wali asebter %s.','Google offers different map displays, each with varying prices and free usage allowance. See our %s page for more information on these display options.'=>'Google yettak askan n tmidit yemgaraden, yal yiwen s ixef-is d tezmert n useqdec ilelli. I wugar n telɣut ɣef uskan-a, wali asebter %s.','Grid'=>'Iẓiki','Group By'=>'Sdukkel s','Group Events'=>'Tidyanin n ugraw','Group Ownership'=>'Taɣara n ugraw','Grouped Lists'=>'Tibdarin yettwasdukklen','Grouped Lists View'=>'Tamuɣli n tebdarin yettwagrawen','Grouped list default'=>'Tebdart yettwagrawen tamezwert','Grouped list format'=>'Amasal n tebdart yettwagrawen','Grouped list header'=>'Aqeṛṛu n tebdart yettwagrawen','Guest Default User'=>'Aseqdac amezwer n yimenzayen','Guest User'=>'Aseqdac anaddam','Guest Users'=>'Iseqdacen n yinebgawen','HTML Allowed.'=>'HTML yettwasireg.','HTML allowed.'=>'HTML yettwasirgen.','HTML entity-decoded shortcode content will be sanitized after being decoded, we STRONGLY recommend leaving this enabled.'=>'Agbur n unegzum yettwafken s HTML entity ad yettwasfeḍ ticki yettwafek, nettwali yelha aṭas ma teǧǧeḍ aya yermed.','HTML is not accepted.'=>'HTML ur yettwaqbal ara.','Headings'=>'Inixfan','Help'=>'Tallelt','Here you can disable individual item styling eompletely or just allow basic styling. Basic styling will try to impose general structuring (such as calendar structures) but won\'t use our Strict styling rules.'=>'Da tzemreḍ ad tesnseḍ aɣanib n yal aferdis s lekmal neɣ ad tesirgeḍ kan aɣanib azadur. Aɣanib azadur ad ɛerḍen ad ssebdun taneɣruft tamatut (am tneɣrufin n tifadiwin) maca ur ttwaseqdacen ara ilugan n uɣanib uḥerfan.','Hidden Links'=>'Iseɣwan yeffren','Hidden by default?'=>'Yettwaffer s wudem amezwer?','Hidden from listings (yes or no)'=>'Yeffren seg tebdarin (yes or no)','Hidden from upcoming'=>'Yeffren seg wid i d-iteddun','Hidden link text'=>'Aḍris n useɣwen yeffren','Hidden links'=>'Iseɣwan yeffren','Hide'=>'Ffer','Hide Advanced Options'=>'Ffer tinefrunin tinaẓiyin','Hide Advanced Search'=>'Ffer anadi anaẓi','Hide Search'=>'Ffer anadi','Hide form until tickets selected?'=>'Ffer tasertit alamma ttwafernent tkitin?','Hide label'=>'Tabzimt n uffer','Hide link until %s minutes before the event starts'=>'Ffer aseɣwen alamma ɣer %s tisdidin send ad tebdu tadyant','Hide on %s screen size?'=>'Ffer deg tehri n ugdil %s?','Hold spaces while booking?'=>'Ḥrez idagen deg tuṭṭfa?','Hold time'=>'Akud n uḥraz','Holds'=>'Ṭṭfen','Host account'=>'Amiḍan n usmersu','Hosted by %s'=>'Yettwasuddes sɣur %s','Hours'=>'Isragen','How events appear on each calendar day: a labelled pill per event, a single dot, one dot per event (up to the day limit), or a coloured ring around the date. Override per calendar with the %s parameter.'=>'Amek ara d-banent tidyanin deg yal ass n tfada: tabeḍḍat s tebzimt i yal tadyant, yiwet n tnqiḍt, yiwet n tnqiḍt i yal tadyant (alamma d talast n wass), neɣ tayiwt yeɣlin ɣef uzemz. Beddel i yal tafada s uɣewwar %s.','How long before an event can users cancel?'=>'Acḥal send tedyant i zemren iseqdacen ad semmten?','How many minutes before an event starts its link is shown, when the event has no time of its own.'=>'Acḥal n tisdidin send ad tebdu tadyant ara d-yettban aseɣwen-is, ma tadyant ur tesɛi akud-is.','How many minutes the picked spaces are held for a visitor who has not submitted their booking yet.'=>'Acḥal n tisdidin ara ttwaḥerzen idagen yettwafernen i umerza ur d-yuzin ara tuṭṭfa-ines.','How the first rows will import with the columns and options as last previewed. Nothing has been saved yet.'=>'Amek ara kecmen izirigen imezwura s tgejdiyin d tixtiṛiyin akken i d-yettwaskan taggara. Ulac ayen yettwaskles akka tura.','However, there were some problems whilst sending confirmation emails to you and/or the event contact person. You may want to contact them directly and letting them know of this error.'=>'Maca, llant kra n wuguren deg uzzna n yimaylen n usentem ɣer-k d/neɣ ɣer umdan n unermis n tedyant. Ahat ilaq ad tnermseḍ-iten s wudem usdid u ad tent-id-twalimeḍ n tuccḍa-agi.','Hundreds of free hours have gone into making this free plugin, show your support and add a small link to the plugin website at the bottom of your event pages.'=>'Ihi-d ayen yeṭṭuqten n yisragen n zzerb i uskar n usiɣzef-a ilelli, ini-d tallelt-ik s tmerna n useɣwen amecṭuḥ ɣer usmel n usiɣzef deg ukessar n yisebtar n tedyanin-ik.','Hybrid'=>'Ahibrid','Hybrid (Physical/Virtual)'=>'Ahibrid (Fizik/Virtuel)','Hybrid Venue (Physical/Virtual)'=>'Adrar ahibrid (Fizik/Virtuel)','I consent to my submitted data being collected and stored as outlined by the site %s.'=>'Qebleɣ ad ttwajemɛen u ad ttwaskelsen isefka-iw yettwazen am akken yettwazen deg usmel %s.','I consent to the use of my provided contact information for communication purposes.'=>'Qebleɣ aseqdec n talɣut-iw n unermis i tiywin n unermis.','I hereby withdraw from the contract for the following booking: %1$s (#%2$d).'=>'Ssefsxeɣ aɛaqed i tuṭṭfa-a: %1$s (#%2$d).','ID'=>'ID','IP: %s'=>'IP: %s','Icon to appear in dashboard admin menu for this Archetype. Accepts URLs to PNG/SVG images, %s or leave blank for default.'=>'Tignit ara d-yettbanen deg umuɣ n unedbal n teflut i Archetype-a. Yeqbel URLs n tugniwin PNG/SVG, %s neɣ eǧǧ-it d ilem i wakken ad d-yettwaseqdec umezwer.','If File Type is also set, only these extensions within the permitted File Type will be permitted.'=>'Ma yella Anaw n ufaylu yettwasbadu daɣen, ala iseggimen-agi i yellan deg Anaw n ufaylu yettusirgen ara yettusirgen.','If HTML emails are enabled, br tags will automatically be added for new lines.'=>'Ma yella imaylen n HTML ttwarmden, tibzimin br ad ttwarnunt s wudem awurman i yizirigen imaynuten.','If a booking exists for that email address, we have sent a link to manage your withdrawal. Please check your inbox.'=>'Ma tella tuṭṭfa i tansa-a n yimayl, nuzen-ak-d aseɣwen akken ad tiliḍ asenfar n uffeɣ-ik. Ma ulac aɣilif wali tibuxxent-ik.','If a booking is made and an email cannot be sent, this is added to the success message.'=>'Ma tettwaxdem tuṭṭfa u ur yezmir ara ad yettwazen imayl, aya ad yettwarnu ɣer yizen n lmuvafaqa.','If a calendar day has only one event, you can force a direct link to the event (recommended to avoid duplicate content).'=>'Ma yella yiwen n wass n tfada yesɛa kan yiwet n tedyant, tzemreḍ ad tessirdeḍ arez uslig ɣer tedyant (ittusumer i wakken ad tfakkeḍ agbur yettwarrun).','If a user has not previously given or revoked consent for a specific submitted data type (such as bookings), do we assume user has given consent by default?'=>'Ma yella useqdac ur yefki ara neɣ ur yesfesax ara tuqqna zik i wanaw yettwaznen n yisefka (am tuṭṭfiwin), nɣil yefka tuqqna s wudem amezwer?','If already attending and double bookings are disabled, this message will be displayed, followed by a link to the users booking page.'=>'Ma yettekki yakan u tuṭṭfiwin sin tikkal ttwansent, izen-a ad d-yettwaskan, yeḍfer-it useɣwen ɣer usebter n tuṭṭfiwin n useqdac.','If an event does not have a category assigned when editing, this one will be assigned automatically.'=>'Ma yella tadyant ur tesɛi ara taggayt mi ara tt-tẓergeḍ, taggayt-a ad tettwasbaḍu s wudem awurman.','If an event is cancelled, the following actions can be taken upon cancellation.'=>'Ma yella tadyant tettwaḥbes, tigawin-a zemrent ad ttwaxedment mi ara tettwaḥbes.','If an event is cancelled, you can exclude them from event lists. You can display cancelled events in shortcode using the %s parameter.'=>'Ma tettwaḥbes tedyant, tzemreḍ ad tt-tekkseḍ seg tebdarin n tidyanin. Tzemreḍ ad d-tesekneḍ tidyanin yettwaḥbesen deg unegzum s useqdec n uɣewwar %s.','If an event lasts all day, this text will show if using the %s placeholder'=>'Ma yella tedyant ɣef wass ummid, aḍris-a ad d-yettban ma yella yettwaseqdac usmel n wadig %s','If checked every booking must select one or the minimum number of this ticket.'=>'Ma yettwacebbeḍ, yal tuṭṭfa ilaq ad tefren yiwet neɣ amḍan adday n tikit-agi.','If enabled replies to these automated emails will be sent to the person who made the booking. This takes precedence over the event owner Reply-To.'=>'Ma yermed, tiririyin ɣer yimaylen-agi iwurmanen ad ttwaznent i umdan i yg-ixedmen tuṭṭfa. Aya yesɛa azwir ɣef Reply-To n bab n tedyant.','If enabled replies to these automated emails will, by default, be sent to the email of the event owner.'=>'Ma yermed, tiririyin ɣer yimaylen-agi iwurmanen ad ttwaznent, s wudem amezwer, ɣer yimayl n bab n tedyant.','If enabled, Events Manager checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release rather than waiting for the staggered update rollout, which can take up to 24 hours. Releases found this way are shown for a manual update only and are never auto-installed, unless you define the %1$s constant. %2$s'=>'Ma yella yermed, Events Manager ad isenqed WordPress.org s wudem ameḍran i wakken ad yaf lqem usligen aneggaru, war ma yețṛaju asuffeɣ s waṭas n yiḍ, ayen ara yeddun alamma d 24 n yisragen. Ileqqmen yettwafen s wudem-a ttwaskanen kan i uleqqem s ufus, ur ttwasbeddan ara s wudem awurman, ala ma tesbaneḍ amentil %1$s. %2$s','If enabled, fully booked timeslots remain visible but cannot be selected.'=>'Ma yella yermed, tallunin tummidin ad qqimen d tilalin maca ur zmiren ara ad ttwafernent.','If enabled, guest visitors can supply an email address and a user account will automatically be created for them along with their booking. They will be also be able to log back in with that newly created account.'=>'Ma yella yermed, yimerza ara d-yernun ad zemren ad fken tansa imayl u ad yettwasnulfu ukaunt n useqdac s wudem awurman i yimi-nsen akken ad ttwakelsen tuṭṭfa-nsen. Ad zemren daɣen ad uɣalen ad qqnen s ukaunt-a amaynut.','If enabled, the entire booking form will show once a space is selected, or if an ticket is already pre-selected with minimum spaces.'=>'Ma yella yermed, tasertit n tuṭṭfa meṛṛa ad d-tettwaskan ticki yettwafren yiwen n udag, neɣ ma yella yiwen n tkit yettwafren yakan s idagen imecṭuḥen.','If enabled, the latest dev version will always be checked instead of the latest stable version of the plugin.'=>'Ma yella yermed, lqem aneggaru n usnernu ad yettwasenqed deg unida n lqem usligen aneggaru n usiɣzef.','If enabled, the spaces a visitor picks on the booking form are held for them while they fill in the rest of the form, so nobody else can take them before they submit. Held spaces count as taken for everyone else until the booking is submitted or the hold runs out. A hold can be no larger than one booking, so set a maximum number of spaces per booking on your events or tickets to limit how much of an event one visitor can hold.'=>'Ma yermed, idagen i d-yextar yimsuɣ deg tsemrkant n tuṭṭfa ttwaḥebsen fell-as mi ara yeččar ayen yeqqimen deg tsemrkant, akken ur ten-yezmir ara yiwen nniḍen ad ten-yeṭṭef send ad t-yazen. Idagen ttwaḥebsen ttwaḥsaben d wid yettwaṭṭfen i wiyaḍ alamma tettwazen tuṭṭfa neɣ ad yekfu uḥbas. Aḥbas yezmer ad yili d amectuḥ ɣef tuṭṭfa yiwet, ihi sbadu amḍan afellay n yidagen i yal tuṭṭfa deg tidyanin neɣ tikitin-ik akken ad tḥettmeḍ acḥal n tedyant i izemmer yiwen n yimsuɣ ad t-yeḥbes.','If enabled, users can book an event more than once.'=>'Ma yella yermed, iseqdacen zemren ad ṭṭfen tadyant yiwet n tikkelt neɣ ugar.','If enabled, users can cancel their bookings themselves from their bookings page.'=>'Ma yella yermed, iseqdacen zemren ad semmten tuṭṭfiwin-nsen s yiman-nsen seg usebter n tuṭṭfiwin-nsen.','If guests cannot make bookings, they will be asked to register in order to book. However, enabling this will still show available tickets.'=>'Ma yella yimerza ur zmiren ara ad ṭṭfen, ad ttwasuteren ad ttwaklesen i wakken ad ṭṭfen. Maca, ma tremdeḍ aya, tikitin yewjiden ad ttwaskanent daɣen.','If inclusion rules are entered above, this setting is ignored.'=>'Ma yella ilugan n usduy ttwaserggen nnig, iɣewwaren-a ur ttwaseqdacen ara.','If left blank, no emails will be sent. Separate emails with commas for more than one email.'=>'Ma yella ilem, ur yettwazen yiwen n yimayl. Beṛṛa imaylen s tfeṛṛadin ma yella ugar n yiwen.','If left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'Ma yeǧǧa d ilem, ad yettwaseqdec uzal amezwer.','If left blank, this email will not be sent.'=>'Ma yella ilem, imayl-a ur yettwazen ara.','If set to yes the capabilities will be applied all your network blogs and you will not be able to set custom capabilities each blog. You can select no later and visit specific blog settings pages to add/remove capabilities.'=>'Ma tferneḍ "Ih" tizemmar ad ttwasnent ɣer yiblugen merra n uẓeṭṭa-ik u ur tezmireḍ ara ad tesbaduḍ tizemmar yugnen i yal ablug. Tzemreḍ ad tferneḍ "Ala" ticki u ad tzuręḍ isebtar n yiɣewwaren n yiblugen yettwafernen akken ad trnuḍ/tekkseḍ tizemmar.','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of events.'=>'Ma tefkaḍ ih, tamerkant n unadi ad d-tettwali ddaw tebdart n tidyanin-ik.','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of locations.'=>'Ma tefkaḍ ih, tamerkant n unadi ad d-tettwali ddaw tebdart n yidrar-ik.','If set to yes, advanced search fields can toggled by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'Ma yella tferneḍ ih, urtiyen n unadi anaẓi zemren ad ttwaskanen/ttwaffren s usiti ɣef tignit "Anadi anaẓi".','If set to yes, advanced search fields will be hidden by default and can be revealed by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'Ma yella tferneḍ ih, urtiyen n unadi anaẓi ad ttwaffren s wudem amezwer u zemren ad d-banen s usiti ɣef tignit "Anadi anaẓi".','If set to yes, full sized images will be used and HTML width and height attributes will be used to determine the size.'=>'Ma tefkaḍ ih, ad ttwaseqdacent tugniwin s teɣzi tuɣridt, yerna timeẓluyin n tehri d teɣzi n HTML ad ttwaseqdacent i usbadu n teɣzi.','If set to yes, the FullCalendar will be used instead of the standard calendar on the events page.'=>'Ma tebdeḍ "ih", FullCalendar ad yettwaseqdec deg wadeg n tafada tamezwert deg usebter n tedyanin.','If set to yes, your emails will be sent in HTML format, otherwise plaintext.'=>'Ma tferneḍ "Ih", imaylen-ik ad ttwaznen s umasal HTML, neɣ ala d aḍris aččuran.','If set, the total number of spaces for a single booking to this event cannot exceed this amount.'=>'Ma yettwasbadu, amḍan amatu n yidagen i yiwen n tuṭṭfa n tedyant-agi ur izmir ara ad yeɛdu amḍan-a.','If syncing is turned on for a booking status below, when a user RSVPs, the booking status will automatically be changed along with RSVP status.'=>'Ma yella umtawi yermed i uddad n tuṭṭfa ukessar, mi ara yerr useqdac i tinnubga, addad n tuṭṭfa ad yettubeddel s wudem awurman akked uddad n tinnubga.','If the booking is free, this will be displayed instead of the %s heading.'=>'Ma tella tuṭṭfa d tilelli, aya ad d-yettwaskan deg wadeg n uzwel %s.','If the consent checkbox is not checked during a booking, this error will be returned.'=>'Ma tankult n tuqqna ur tettwacukk ara deg tuṭṭfa, tuccḍa-a ad d-tuɣal.','If the consent checkbox is not checked when submitting information such as events or locations, this error will be returned.'=>'Ma tankult n tuqqna ur tettwacukk ara mi ara ttazneḍ talɣut am tedyanin neɣ idrar, tuccḍa-a ad d-tuɣal.','If the user made a previous booking and cannot double-book.'=>'Ma yeṭṭef useqdac yakan u ur izmir ara ad yeṭṭef snat tikkal.','If the user tries to make a booking with spaces that exceeds the maximum number of spaces per booking.'=>'Ma yeɛreḍ useqdac ad yeṭṭef s yidagen ttzegren amḍan afellay n yidagen i yal tuṭṭfa.','If the user tries to make a booking without requesting any spaces.'=>'Ma yeɛreḍ useqdac ad yeṭṭef war ma yesuter ula d yiwen n udag.','If there are any new updates, you should now see them in your Plugins or Updates admin pages.'=>'Ma llan yileqqmen imaynuten, tzemreḍ ad ten-twaliḍ tura deg yisebtar n Iseɣzaf neɣ n Yileqqmen.','If there are member-only tickets, you can choose whether or not to show these tickets to guests.'=>'Ma llant tikitin n yiɛeggalen kan, tzemreḍ ad tferneḍ ma ara d-skaneḍ neɣ ala tikitin-a i yimerza.','If there\'s no fields to show in the main search section, this button will be used instead at the bottom of the advanced fields.'=>'Ma yella ulac urtiyen ara d-yettwaskanen deg tegzemt tagejdant n unadi, tqeffalt-a ad tettwaseqdac deg umkan-is deg uḍar n yurtiyen anaẓiyen.','If this is incorrect, click cancel and try a more specific address.'=>'Ma ur yelhi ara, sit ɣef semmet u ɛreḍ tansa yettwasnen akken iwata.','If translations are left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'Ma ur tent-teẓẓuyeḍ ara tisuqqilin, ad yettwaseqdec uzal amezwer.','If viewing a page for events on a specific date, this is the title that would show up. To insert date values, use <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP time format characters</a>  with a <code>#</code> symbol before them, i.e. <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, etc.<br/>'=>'Ma yella tettwali yiwen n usebter n tidyanin n yiwen n wass, wagi d azwel ara d-yettbanen. I wakken ad ternuḍ azal n yizemzen, seqdec <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">isekkilen n umasal n wakud n PHP</a>  s yiwen n usekkil <code>#</code> send-asen, am <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, atg.<br/>','If you are experiencing errors when trying to use any of these accounts, try disconnecting and connecting again.'=>'Ma tecclem-ik tuccḍa mi ara tesqedceḍ yiwen seg yimiḍanen-a, ɛreḍ ad tekkseḍ tuqqna syen ad teqqneḍ tikkelt-nniḍen.','If you change time patterns such as start times or durations, any previously created timeslots falling outside the new settings will be %s.'=>'Ma tbeddleḍ udlifen n wakud am yizemzen n tazwara neɣ tizi, yal tazmilt n wakud yettwasnulfen uzwir yellan beṛṛa n yiɣewwaren imaynuten ad yettwa%s.','If you choose \'Pages\' then %s will be shown using your theme default page template, alternatively choose from page templates that come with your specific theme.'=>'Ma tferneḍ \'Isebtar\' ad d-banen %s s useqdec n teneɣruft n usebter tamezwert n usentel-ik, neɣ fren seg tneɣrufin n yisebtar i d-yettusan s usentel-ik.','If you choose a group by mode, your events page will display events in groups of your chosen time range.'=>'Ma tferneḍ askar n ugraw, asebter n tidyanin-ik ad d-yesken tidyanin deg yegrawen n tarzagt n wakud i tferneḍ.','If you choose the Event post type whilst Events Manager is activated, you can also visit the <a href="%s">Events Manager settings page</a> for a few more options when displaying event information on your calendar.'=>'Ma tferneḍ anaw n tedyant mi ara yili Events Manager yermed, tzemreḍ ula ad terzuḍ <a href="%s">asebter n yiɣewwaren n Events Manager</a> i kra n textiṛiyin-nniḍen mi ara d-teskeneḍ talɣut n tedyant deg tafada-ik.','If you choose to cancel your event, after you save this event, no further bookings will be possible for this event.'=>'Ma tferneḍ ad tesfesxeḍ tadyant-ik, mi ara teskelseḍ tadyant-a, ulac tuṭṭfiwin-nniḍen ara yettwaqbalen i tedyant-a.','If you collect personal data, you may want to request their consent. The options below will automatically add checkboxes requesting this consent.'=>'Ma teklaseḍ isefka udmawanen, tzemreḍ ad tsuteḍ tuqqna-nsen. Textiṛiyin ddaw ad rnun s wudem awurman tankulin i usuter n tuqqna-a.','If you could spare a few minutes, we would appreciate it if you could please leave us a review.'=>'Ma tzemreḍ ad tefkeḍ kra n tesdidin, nḥemmel aṭas ma ara aɣ-teǧǧeḍ tamawt.','If you disable locations, bear in mind that you should remove your location page, shortcodes and related placeholders from your <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">formats</a>.'=>'Ma tsenseḍ idrar, ttu ad tekkseḍ asebter n wadrar, inegzumen d yismilen n wadig yeqqnen seg <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">imusal</a>-ik.','If you enable tips, this information will be shown, which can include HTML.'=>'Ma termdeḍ iwenniten, talɣut-a ad d-tettwaskan, tzemmer ad teṭṭef HTML.','If you extend or add more dates, the new recurrences will be added to your recurrence set without affecting previously created ones.'=>'Ma tebɣiḍ ad tgerrzeḍ neɣ ad ternuḍ izemzen, alugen imaynuten ad ttwarnun ɣer tmagit n walugen-ik war ma ffren wid yettwasnulfan uzwir.','If you extend or add more times, this will not affect previous timeslots.'=>'Ma tgerrzeḍ neɣ ternuḍ akuden-nniḍen, ayen-a ur yettwaḥsab ara ɣef tuzmilin n wakud n zik.','If you get a lot of pending bookings and you decide to allow more bookings than spaces allow, setting this to yes will allow you to override the event space limit when manually approving.'=>'Ma tesɛiḍ aṭas n tuṭṭfiwin yettṛajun u tebɣiḍ ad tesirgeḍ ugar n tuṭṭfiwin n wayen i yettusirgen s yidagen, aɣewwar-a s ih ad ak-yeǧǧ ad tzegreḍ talast n yidagen n tedyant mi ara teqbleḍ s ufus.','If you hare happy with the migration, you can dismiss this message and your old formatting options (i.e. this undo option) will be deleted.'=>'Ma yehwa-k usuffeɣ, tzemreḍ ad tessefsuḍ izen-a u tinefrunin-ik n umsal n zik (d tafrayt-a n usemmet) ad ttwakksent.','If you just want to deactivate the plugin, <a href="%s">go to your plugins page</a>.'=>'Ma tebɣiḍ kan ad tessenseḍ asiɣzef, <a href="%s">ddu ɣer usebter n yiseɣzaf-ik</a>.','If you modify the dates where recurrences will not occur on, any recurrences falling within these dates will be %s. New recurrences will be created if you remove unavailable dates which previously blocked recurrnce dates.'=>'Ma tsenfaleḍ izemzen anda alugen ur d-yettuɣal ara, yal alugen yellan deg yizemzen-agi ad yettwa%s. Alugen imaynuten ad ttwasnulfun ma tekkseḍ izemzen ur nelli ara i yeḥbesen izemzen n walugen zik.','If you prefer a ticket table like with multiple tickets, even for single ticket events, enable this.'=>'Ma tessnedmeḍ tafelwit n tkitin am wakken llant aṭas n tkitin, ula i tedyanin s tkit yiwen, rmed aya.','If you select a default country, that will be pre-selected when creating a new location.'=>'Ma tferneḍ tamurt tamezwert, ad tettwafren yakan mi ara tesnulfuḍ adrar amaynut.','If you shorten the date range or limit your recurrence dates, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be %s.'=>'Ma tneqseḍ tilisa n yizemzen neɣ tḥebseḍ izemzen n walugen, yal alugen yellan beṛṛa n tilisa tamaynut ad yettwa%s.','If you update this event data and save, it could get overwritten if you edit the repeating event template. To make it an independent, <a href="%s">detach it</a>.'=>'Ma tleqqmeḍ isefka n tedyant-a u teskelseḍ, zemren ad ttwaffren ma tẓergeḍ taneɣruft n tedyant i d-yettuɣalen. I wakken ad tt-tgeḍ d tuzzigt, <a href="%s">senṣel-it</a>.','If you use the %s <a href="%s">shortcode</a>, you can display a map of all your locations and events, the settings below will be used.'=>'Ma tesqedceḍ anegzum %s <a href="%s">anegzum</a>, tzemreḍ ad d-tesekneḍ tamidit n yidrar akk d tidyanin-ik, ad ttwasqedcen iɣewwaren n ddaw.','If you use the <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> <a href="%s">placeholder</a> when displaying individual event and location information, the settings below will be used.'=>'Ma tesqedceḍ <a href="%s">asmel n wadig</a> <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> mi ara d-tesekneḍ talɣut n tedyant neɣ n wadrar yiwen, ad ttwasqedcen iɣewwaren n ddaw.','If you want to edit general options for Events Manager, visit the main %s.'=>'Ma tebɣiḍ ad tẓergeḍ tixtiṛiyin timatutin n Events Manager, rzu %s agejdan.','If you would like every event booking confirmation email sent to an administrator write their email here (leave blank to not send an email).'=>'Ma tebɣiḍ ad yettwazen yal imayl n usentem n tuṭṭfa n tedyant i unedbal, aru imayl-ines da (eǧǧ-it d ilem ma ur tebɣiḍ ara ad yettwazen imayl).','If you would like to add extra classes to your body html tag when a single %s page is displayed, enter it here. May be useful or necessary if your theme requires special class names for specific templates.'=>'Ma tebɣiḍ ad ternuḍ iclasen niḍen ɣer tebzimt n tfekka n html-ik mi ara d-yettwaskan usebter n %s yiwen, serreḥ-iten da. Tezmer ad tili d tilemmast neɣ tuḥwaǧ ma yella usentel-ik yesra ismawen n teqrayin imaẓlayen i tneɣrufin yettwafernen.','If you would like to disable comments entirely, disable this, otherwise you can disable comments on each single %s. Note that %s with comments enabled will still be until you resave them.'=>'Ma tebɣiḍ ad tsenseḍ iwenniten s lekmal, sens aya, ma ulac tzemreḍ ad tsenseḍ iwenniten ɣef yal %s yiwen. Ɣur-k %s s yiwenniten yermden ad qqimen armi tt-tessekles daɣen.','If you would like to download a dev version, but just as a one-off, you can force a dev version check by clicking the button below. If there is one available, it should appear in your plugin updates page as a regular update.'=>'Ma tebɣiḍ ad tsaduḍ lqem n usnernu, maca yiwet n tikkelt kan, tzemreḍ ad tessirdeḍ asenqed n lqem n usnernu s usiti ɣef tqeffalt ukessar. Ma yella yiwen yewjed, ilaq ad d-yettban deg usebter n yileqqmen n usiɣzef am uleqqem amagnu.','If you would prefer all your locations to belong to your main blog, users in sub-sites will still be able to create locations, but the actual locations are created and reside in the main blog.'=>'Ma tebɣiḍ akk idrar-ik ad ilin ɣer ublug-ik agejdan, iseqdacen n yismal imaruzen ad ezmiren ad snulfun idrar, maca idrar usligen ttwasnulfan u qqimen deg ublug agejdan.','If you would prefer to hide this page, add %s to your wp-config.php file.'=>'Ma tebɣiḍ ad teffreḍ asebter-a, rnu %s ɣer ufaylu wp-config.php-ik.','If you\'re using the Google Maps, the more detail you provide, the more accurate Google can be at finding your location. If your address isn\'t being found, please <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>try it on maps.google.com</a> by adding all the fields below separated by commas.'=>'Ma tseqdaceḍ Google Maps, ma teffeḍ ugar n ifatusen, ma yezmer Google ad d-yaf adrar-ik s tidet akken iwata. Ma ur d-yettwaf ara wawal-ik, ma ulac aɣilif <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>ɛreḍ-it ɣef maps.google.com</a> s tmerna n wanda akk tigezmiyin ddaw yettwafrayen s yiwenniṭen.','Image'=>'Tugna','Image Dimensions'=>'Tisekta n tugna','Image input must be an attachment ID, URL, or object with source_url / content_base64 / file.'=>'Anekcum n tugna ilaq ad yili d ID n useɣwen, URL, neɣ taɣawsa s source_url / content_base64 / file.','Import'=>'Kcem','Import %1$s, %2$s'=>'Kcem %1$s, %2$s','Import Settings'=>'Kter iɣewwaren','Import a %s'=>'Kcem %s','Import and Migrate'=>'Asekcem d uneqqel','Import as'=>'Kcem am','Import as a list of dates'=>'Kcem am tabdart n yizemzen','Import events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, or copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from another events plugin. Either can be rolled back, and the original data is left untouched.'=>'Kcem tidyanin, idrar neɣ imsuddsen seg ufaylu CSV, neɣ neqqel tidyanin-ik, idrar, imsuddsen, tikitin d yimttekkiyen seg uzegrar nniḍen n tidyanin. Yal yiwen zemren ad ttwarren ɣer deffir, u isefka imezwura ur ttwaḍegren ara.','Import into Events Manager'=>'Kcem ɣer Events Manager','Import/Export Settings'=>'Kter/Sifeḍ iɣewwaren','Imported, with a note'=>'Yettwakcem, s tizmilt','Importing rows'=>'Asekcem n yizirigen','Imports'=>'Isekcamen','Imports events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, one row for each. A repeating event is one row too. Run it, check the result, and roll the import back if it is not what you wanted.'=>'Yekcem tidyanin, idrar neɣ imsuddsen seg ufaylu CSV, yiwen n yizirig i yal yiwen. Tadyant i d-yettuɣalen d yiwen n yizirig daɣen. Selkem-it, senqed agmuḍ, u err asekcem ɣer deffir ma yella mačči d ayen i tebɣiḍ.','In order to use attributes, you must define some in your templates, otherwise they\'ll never show. Go to Events > Settings > General to add attribute placeholders.'=>'Akken ad tesqedceḍ isulen, ilaq ad tesbeddeḍ kra deg tneɣrufin-ik, ma ulac ur d-ttbanen ara. Ddu ɣer Tidyanin > Iɣewwaren > Amatu akken ad ternuḍ iɣallen n yisulen.','In single ticket mode, users can only create one ticket per event (and will not see options to add more tickets).'=>'Deg uskar n tkit yiwen, iseqdacen zemren ad snulfun kan yiwet n tkit i yal tadyant (u ur walin ara tifranin n tmerna n tkitin nniḍen).','In the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>, you\'ll find various textboxes where you can edit how event information looks, such as for event and location lists. Using the placeholders below, you can choose what information should be displayed.'=>'Deg <a href=\'%s\'>usebter n yiɣewwaren</a>, ad tafeḍ kra n tebwaṭin n uḍris anda tzemreḍ ad tẓergeḍ amek ttbanen telɣut n tedyanin, am tebdarin n tedyanin d yidrar. S useqdec n yisemlen n wadig ddaw, tzemreḍ ad tfeṛneḍ talɣut ara d-tettwaskan.','In the boxes below, you are expected to write the page IDs. For multiple pages, use comma-separated values e.g. 1,2,3. Entering 0 means EVERY page, -1 means the home page.'=>'Deg tfekka n ddaw, ilaq ad tserreḍ ID n yisebtar. I waṭas n yisebtar, seqdec azalen yemgaraden s yiwenniten am 1,2,3. Anekcum n 0 yeεni YAL asebter, -1 yeεni asebter n unabaw.','In this case, a user can confirm their own booking even if the booking is pending.'=>'Deg tebdart-a, useqdac izmer ad isentem tuṭṭfa-ines ula ma tettṛaju.','Include %s'=>'Seddu %s','Include Countries'=>'Seddu tmura','Include all'=>'Sekcem akk','Include cancelled events?'=>'Rnu tidyanin yettwaḥbesen?','Include in WordPress Searches?'=>'Rnu deg unadi n WordPress?','Include on'=>'Rnu ɣef','Include only guest submissions'=>'Sekcem kan tuzzigin n yimdanen','Include only these %1$s IDs, for multiple values separate by commas such as %2$s.'=>'Seddu kan IDs n %1$s-a, i waṭas n yizalen beṛṛa-ten s tfeṛṛadin am %2$s.','Include pages where you use shortcode or PHP to display event submission forms.'=>'Rnu isebtar anda tesqedceḍ anegzum neɣ PHP i uskan n tmerkanin n uzzna n tedyant.','Include pages where you use shortcodes or widgets to display event search forms.'=>'Rnu isebtar anda tesqedceḍ inegzumen neɣ iwiǧiten i uskan n tmerkanin n unadi n tidyanin.','Include past events'=>'Rnu tidyanin ineggura','Included in %s'=>'Yekcem deg %s','Included with your %s'=>'Yekcem akked %s-inek','Includes hybrid events, which can also be attended physically.'=>'Yeddukkel tidyanin ahibrid, i izemren ad ttwattekkin daɣen s wudem afizik.','Incomplete Bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin ur nemmid ara','Individual Components'=>'Iferdisen imdukkal','Individual tickets with remaining spaces will not be available if total booking spaces reach this limit. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Tikitin ssefrunin s yidagen i d-yeqqimen ur ttwejdent ara ma yebda umḍan amatu n yidagen n tuṭṭfa yewweḍ ɣer talast-a. Eǧǧ-it d ilem ma ur tebɣiḍ ara talast.','Inherit your theme settings'=>'Iṭṭef iɣewwaren n usentel-ik','Initial lengths'=>'Teɣzi tamezwert','Inline'=>'Deg usebter','Insert the address of the notification sender.'=>'Sekcem tansa n umazan n tilɣa.','Insert the display name of the notification sender.'=>'Sekcem isem n uskan n umazan n tilɣa.','Insert the password to be used to access your SMTP server'=>'Sekcem awal n uɛeddi ara yettwasqedcen i unekcum ɣer uqeddac-ik SMTP','Insert the username to be used to access your SMTP server.'=>'Sekcem isem n useqdac ara yettwasqedcen i unekcum ɣer uqeddac-ik SMTP.','Install'=>'Sbedd','Installed'=>'Yettwasbedd','Installed, not active'=>'Yettwasbedd, ur yermid ara','Invalid Number'=>'Uṭṭun armeɣtu','Invalid file upload.'=>'Asali n ufaylu armeɣtu.','Invalid interval format for %s'=>'Amasal n tallalt armeɣtu i %s','Invalid request'=>'Asuter armeɣtu','Invalid source URL.'=>'URL n uɣbalu armeɣtu.','Involid token credentials, the folloiwng are missing: %s.'=>'Isefka n token d arameɣtu, ulac wid-a: %s.','Is consent required?'=>'Tuqqna tettwaḥewweǧ?','It looks like you have WPML enabled on your site. We advise you also install our extra <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a> plugin which helps the two work better together. <a href="%s">Dismiss message</a>'=>'Yettban d akken WPML yermed deg usmel-ik. Nettusmutr daɣen ad tsbeddeḍ asiɣzef-nneɣ amernu <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a> i ara yesdukkulen tamsalt n sin-nniḍen. <a href="%s">Ttu izen</a>','JavaScript Files'=>'Ifuyla JavaScript','Join'=>'Ddu','Join online'=>'Ddu deg internet','Keep The Events Calendar\'s web addresses for events, venues, organizers, categories and tags'=>'Eǧǧ tansiwin web n The Events Calendar i tidyanin, idrar, imsuddsen, taggayin d tibzimin','Keep your current settings, or individuall revert to default formats.'=>'Eǧǧ iɣewwaren-ik n tura, neɣ uɣal ɣer imasalen imezwura s yiwen.','Kilometers'=>'Kilumitren','Label'=>'Tabzimt','Labels'=>'Tibzimin','Language Booked'=>'Tutlayt n tuṭṭfa','Large'=>'Ameqran','Last %d Months'=>'%d n yigguren ineggura','Last Month'=>'Aggur yezrin','Last Name'=>'Isem n tmagit','Last Year'=>'Aseggas yezrin','Last checked via %1$s on %2$s.'=>'Aɛqeb aneggaru s %1$s deg %2$s.','Last page'=>'Asebter aneggaru','Last sync failed: %s'=>'Tamtawt taneggarut ur teddi ara: %s','Latitude'=>'Latitud','Learn More'=>'Issin ugar','Learn more'=>'Issin ugar','Leave blank for default archetype setting.'=>'Eǧǧ-it d ilem i useɣwen amezwer n uarketayp.','Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Eǧǧ-it d ilem ma ur tebɣiḍ ara talast.','Leave blank to use the built-in default for your site\'s language.'=>'Eǧǧ-it d ilem i useqdec n wayen yettwabnan i tutlayt n usmel-ik.','Leave blank to use the default format from Settings.'=>'Eǧǧ-it d ilem akken ad tesqedceḍ amasal amezwer seg yiɣewwaren.','Leave either blank for no upper/lower limit.'=>'Eǧǧ yiwen d ilem ma ur tebɣiḍ ara talast n uufella/n uddaw.','Leave this field empty'=>'Eǧǧ urti-a d ilem','License expired'=>'Turagt tekfa','License not activated'=>'Turagt ur tettwarmed ara','Licensed'=>'Yesɛa turagt','Limit JS file loading?'=>'Talast n usali n ufaylu JS?','Limit loading of our CSS files?'=>'Mḥed asali n ifuyla CSS-nneɣ?','Limits the number of events on each calendar day. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Tḥedded amḍan n tidyanin deg yal wass n tfada. Eǧǧ-it ilem ma ur tebɣiḍ ara talast.','Limits the number of future events shown (0 = unlimited).'=>'Tḥedded amḍan n tidyanin ara d-yusan i d-yettwaskanen (0 = war talast).','Line Graph'=>'Awonaf n yizirig','Link'=>'Aseɣwen','Link Text'=>'Aḍris n useɣwen','Link directly to event on day with single event?'=>'Arez ɣer tedyant s wudem uslig deg wass s yiwet n tedyant?','Link sub-site %s directly to sub-site?'=>'Qqen %s n usmel amaruz s wudem usrid ɣer usmel amaruz?','Link text used for link to user bookings.'=>'Aḍris n useɣwen i useɣwen ɣer tuṭṭfiwin n useqdac.','List'=>'Tabdart','List %s'=>'Tabdart n %s','List Limits'=>'Tilisa n tebdart','List bookings'=>'Tabdart n tuṭṭfiwin','List event tickets'=>'Tabdart n tikitin n tedyant','List events'=>'Tabdart n tedyanin','List events by date title'=>'Azwel n tebdart n tidyanin s uzemz','List footer format'=>'Amasal n uḍar n tebdart','List header format'=>'Amasal n uqerru n tebdart','List item footer format'=>'Amasal n uḍar n uferdis n tebdart','List item format'=>'Amasal n uferdis n tebdart','List item header format'=>'Amasal n uqerru n uferdis n tebdart','List location countries'=>'Tabdart n tmura n idrar','List location regions'=>'Tabdart n tmennaɣin n idrar','List location states'=>'Tabdart n waɣref n idrar','List location towns'=>'Tabdart n tegduda n idrar','List locations'=>'Tabdart n idrar','Load minified %s files?'=>'Rnu ifuyla %s yettwaẓẓren?','Load minified/compressed files, reducing the file size, load times and bandwidth usage on your site.'=>'Rnu ifuyla yettwaẓẓren/yettwaḍḍen, ayen ara ibeddel teɣzi n ufaylu, akud n usali d useqdec n tehri n tlisa deg usmel-ik.','Loading Map....'=>'Asali n tmeẓri....','Loading...'=>'Asali...','Loads our own JS file if no other dependencies are already loaded, which is still needed for many items generated by EM using JavaScript such as Calendars, Maps and Booking Forms/Buttons'=>'Isali afaylu JS-nneɣ ma ur ttwalin ara ttabaɛiyin nniḍen, ayen mazal yettwasran i waṭas n yiferdisen i d-yettwasnulfan sɣur EM s JavaScript am Tifadiwin, Tummidin d Tmerkanin/Tiqeffalin n tuṭṭfa','Location'=>'Adrar','Location ID.'=>'ID n udrar.','Location Image'=>'Tugna n udrar','Location Name'=>'Isem n udrar','Location Related Placeholders'=>'Isemlen n wadig yemṣadan d udrar','Location Submission Forms'=>'Iferkiyen n uzzen n idrar','Location Type'=>'Anaw n udrar','Location Types'=>'Anawen n yidrar','Location balloon format'=>'Amasal n tfeṭṭit n wadrar','Location coordinates'=>'Imsidal n wadrar','Location could not be deleted.'=>'Adrar ur yettwakkes ara.','Location could not be saved.'=>'Adrar ur yettwaklas ara.','Location data is invalid.'=>'Isefka n udrar ur ttwaqblen ara.','Location map and coordinates have been updated. Please re-save your location to update the map.'=>'Tkarḍa d yimsidag n udrar ttwaleqqmen. Ttxil sekles adrar-ik tikkelt-nniḍen i uleqqem n tkarḍa.','Location name'=>'Isem n udrar','Location name and address'=>'Isem d tansa n wadrar','Location not found'=>'Adrar ulac-it','Location not found, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Adrar ur yettwaf ara, ihi tugna yettwasliyen ur tettwasbadu ara d tugna tameẓlit-is.','Location not found.'=>'Adrar ur yettwaf ara.','Location pages'=>'Isebtar n wadrar','Locations'=>'Idrar','Locations imported from CSV files'=>'Idrar yettwakcemen seg yifuyla CSV','Locations list page'=>'Asebter n tebdart n yidrar','Locations list settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n tebdart n yidrar','Locations on main blog?'=>'Idrar deg ublug agejdan?','Locations submitted by guest users are not included, unless they are linked to events also submitted by them.'=>'Idrar yettwaznen sɣur yiseqdacen imdanen ur ttwaseknen ara, ala ma qqnen ɣer tedyanin yettwaznen ula d nutni sɣur-sen.','Log'=>'Aɣmis','Log In'=>'Kcem','Log in if you already have an account with us.'=>'Qqen ma tesɛiḍ yakan amiḍan yid-neɣ.','Logged In Users'=>'Iseqdacen yeqqnen','Longitude'=>'Longitud','Looking for the rest of the FullCalendar Options? They\'ve moved <a href="%s">here</a>, the options below are for overriding specific bits relevant to Events Manager.'=>'Tettnadiḍ ɣef tmeqrit n textiṛiyin n FullCalendar? Ddant <a href="%s">ɣer da</a>, textiṛiyin ddaw ddan i usemselsi n kra n tmeẓluyin ikulen Events Manager.','Lost your password?'=>'Tesruḥeḍ awal-ik(m) uffir?','Mail sending method'=>'Tarrayt n uzen n yimayl','Main Search Fields'=>'Urtiyen igejdanen n unadi','Main recurrence set %s are required.'=>'Ilaq ad yili %s n ugraw agejdan n yialugen.','Make this the default view.'=>'Err-it d askan amezwer.','Makes Events Manager translatable with WPML, including tickets, location addresses, booking forms and email templates. Supports recurring events and multisite. Requires WPML.'=>'Yerra Events Manager yezmer ad yettwasuqqel s WPML, ula d tikitin, tansiwin n wadrar, tisemrkanin n tuṭṭfa d tneɣruyin n yimaylen. Yessefrek tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen d multisite. Yesra WPML.','Manage %s Bookings'=>'Sefrek tuṭṭfiwin n %s','Manage Person\'s Booking'=>'Sefrek tuṭṭfa n umdan','Manage booking: %s'=>'Sefrek tuṭṭfa: %s','Manage bookings'=>'Sefrek tuṭṭfiwin','Manage bookings link text'=>'Aḍris n useɣwen n usefrek n tuṭṭfiwin','Manage events, bookings, locations, tickets and other related features.'=>'Sefrek tidyanin, tuṭṭfiwin, idrar, tikitin d timeẓluyin-nniḍen i yeqqnen.','Manage in your account'=>'Sefrek deg umiḍan-ik','Manage licenses'=>'Sefrek turagin','Manage my bookings'=>'Sefrek tuṭṭfiwin-iw','Many themes display extra meta information on post pages such as \'posted by\' or \'post date\' information, which may not be desired. Usually, page templates contain less clutter.'=>'Aṭas n yisental sskanen talɣut meta tamernant ɣef yisebtar n yimagraden am \'yettwaru sɣur\' neɣ \'azemz n umagrad\', ayen ur nebɣi ara yakan. Selon, tineɣrufin n yisebtar ɛadi.','Map'=>'Tamefla','Map Unavailable'=>'Tameẓri ulac-it','Maps'=>'Tummidin','Match the needed columns, then update the preview.'=>'Qqen tigejdiyin yettwasran, sakin leqqem taskant.','Max'=>'Afellay','Max events shown per calendar day (0 = no limit).'=>'Amḍan afellay n tedyanin yettwaskanen i yal ass n tfada (0 = ulac talast).','Max events shown per calendar day (0 = no limit; blank = site default).'=>'Amḍan afellay n tedyanin yettwaskanen i yal ass n tfada (0 = ulac talast; ilem = amezwer n usmel).','Maximum File Size'=>'Tiddi tafellayt n ufaylu','Maximum Files Per Upload'=>'Amḍan afellay n yifuyla i yal asali','Maximum Height (px)'=>'Teɣzi tafellayt (px)','Maximum Spaces Per Booking'=>'Amḍan afellay n yidagen i yal tuṭṭfa','Maximum Width (px)'=>'Tehri tafellayt (px)','Maximum number of upcoming timeslots to show on initial page load. Enter 0 to show all upcoming timeslots.'=>'Amḍan afellay n tallunin i d-iteddun ara d-yettwaskanen deg usali amezwaru n usebter. Sekcem 0 i uskan n akk tallunin i d-iteddun.','Maximum of %d files are allowed.'=>'Afellay n %d n ifuyla yettwasirgen.','Maximum size (bytes)'=>'Tiddi tafellayt (ibayten)','Maximum spaces per booking'=>'Amggaru n yidagen i yal tuṭṭfa','Maybe'=>'Ahat','Maybe Attending'=>'Ahat ad ttekkiɣ','Medium'=>'Alemmas','Metric'=>'Amesmir','Metrics'=>'Imesmiren','Migrate'=>'Neqqel','Migrate Formats'=>'Suffeɣ imasalen','Migrate from %s'=>'Neqqel seg %s','Migrate tickets, RSVPs and attendees'=>'Neqqel tikitin, RSVPs d yimttekkiyen','Migrate to Events Manager'=>'Neqqel ɣer Events Manager','Miles'=>'Mil','Min'=>'Adday','Min/Max'=>'Talqayt/Afellay','Minimum Height (px)'=>'Teɣzi tadbut (px)','Minimum Width (px)'=>'Tehri tadbut (px)','Minutes'=>'Tisdidin','Minutes before the event'=>'Tisdidin send tadyant','Missing fields: '=>'Urtiyen ixuṣṣen: ','Missing required field: %s'=>'Urti ilaqen ur yelli ara: %s','Mobile App Notifications'=>'Tilɣa n usnas aziraz','Modal'=>'Agdil','Modal Popup'=>'Asfaylu udhim','Modifications to %s can be applied to all recurrences and will overwrite any changes made to those individual %s recurrences.'=>'Ibeddilen n %s zemren ad ttwasnen ɣef yialugen meṛṛa u ad ffren ibeddilen i yellan deg yal alugen n %s.','Modifications to event tickets will cause all bookings to individual recurrences of this event to be deleted.'=>'Abeddel n tikitin n tedyant ad yeglu ɣer tukksa n tuṭṭfiwin meṛṛa n yialugen n tedyant-a.','Modifications to repeating events will be applied to all recurrences and will overwrite any changes made to those individual event recurrences.'=>'Ibeddilen n tedyanin i d-yettuɣalen ad ttwasnen ɣef yialugen meṛṛa u ad ffren ibeddilen i yellan deg yal alugen n tedyant.','Modified unavailable dates.'=>'Izemzen ur nelli ara yettwasnifel.','Modify Booking'=>'Snifel tuṭṭfa','Modify Recurring Event Tickets '=>'Snifel tikitin n tedyant i d-yettuɣalen ','Modify Unavailable Dates?'=>'Snifel izemzen ur nelli ara?','Modify what information is displayed in this booking table.'=>'Beddel talɣut ara d-yettwaskanen deg tfelwit-a n tuṭṭfiwin.','Month first: 03/04/2027 is March 4'=>'Ayyur d amezwaru: 03/04/2027 d March 4','Month format'=>'Amasal n wayyur','Monthly'=>'Yal ayyur','More Events message'=>'Izen n Ugar n tidyanin','More Info'=>'Ugar n talɣut','More information about migrating to v6 can be found %s.'=>'Ugar n telɣut ɣef usuffeɣ ɣer v6 tella %s.','Most of an event held at once (%)'=>'Aṭas n tedyant yettwaṭṭfen yiwet n tikkelt (%)','Moving from %s?'=>'Tettneqqleḍ seg %s?','Multi Line'=>'Yizirigen aṭas','Multi Site Options'=>'Tixtiṛiyin n yismal rewlent','MultiSite options have moved <a href="%s">here</a>. <a href="%s">Dismiss message</a>'=>'Tixtiṛiyin n ugar n yismal rewlent <a href="%s">dagi</a>. <a href="%s">Ttu izen</a>','Multiple Timeslots'=>'Tazmilin n wakud yeddren','Multiple dots'=>'Tinqiḍin aṭas','Multiple file uploads are not allowed'=>'Asali n waṭas n ifuyla ur yettwasirgen ara','Multisite Settings'=>'Iɣewwaren n waṭas n yismal','My %s'=>'%s-iw','My Bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin-iw','My Bookings messages'=>'Iznan n tuṭṭfiwin-iw','My Event Bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin-iw n tedyanin','My Events'=>'Tidyanin-iw','My Locations'=>'Idrar-iw','My Profile'=>'Alegdis-iw','My bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin-iw','My bookings page'=>'Asebter n tuṭṭfiwin-iw','N/A'=>'N/A','Name'=>'Isem','Name: %s'=>'Isem: %s','Near...'=>'Qrib ɣer...','Need event-specific cancellation settings or support for hours after an event started? This is included in our %s.'=>'Tebɣiḍ iɣewwaren n usefsex yuzzlen i tedyant neɣ tallalt i yisragen deffir ad tebdu tedyant? Aya yettwabda deg %s-nneɣ.','Needs Attention'=>'Yesra tamawt','New %s'=>'%s amaynut','New %s Name'=>'Isem n %s amaynut','New Archetype'=>'Archetype amaynut','New Event'=>'Tadyant tamaynut','New Event Category Name'=>'Isem n taggayt n tedyant tamaynut','New Event Tag Name'=>'Isem n tebzimt n tedyant tamaynut','New Location'=>'Adrar amaynut','New Repeating Event'=>'Tadyant i d-yettuɣalen tamaynut','New booking received'=>'Tuṭṭfa tamaynut tettwaqbel','New bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin timaynutin','New events'=>'Tidyanin timaynutin','New user registration on your blog %s:'=>'Aseqdac amaynut yeklasen deg u