de'=>'Askar n tuṭṭfa war useqdac','None'=>'Ulac','Not Attending'=>'Ur yettekki ara','Not Required'=>'Ur d-yelli ara','Not Supplied'=>'Ur d-yettwafk ara','Not a Group Event'=>'Mačči d tadyant n ugraw','Not approved, spaces full.'=>'Ur yettwaqbel ara, idagen yemmalen.','Not attending any events yet.'=>'Ur tettekkaḍ deg ula d yiwet n tedyant akka tura.','Not enough spaces'=>'Idagen ur ččiḍen ara','Not finished'=>'Ur yekfi ara','Not in sync with the provider'=>'Ur yemtawa ara d usmersu','Not started'=>'Ur yebdi ara','Note that assigning a %s page above will override this archive if the URLs collide (which is the default setting, and is recommended for maximum plugin compatibility). You can have both at the same time, but you must ensure that your page and %s slugs are different.'=>'Ɣur-k, asbadu n usebter n %s ufella ad isemgired aɣbar-a ma yella iseɣwan mgaraden (ayen d aɣewwar amezwer, yerna ittwasumer i umṣada afellay n usiɣzef). Tzemreḍ ad tesɛuḍ tifrat n sin deg yiwen, maca ilaq ad tḍemneḍ iberriḥen n usebter-ik d %s mgaraden.','Note that assigning a %s page above will override this archive if the URLs collide (which is the default settings, and is recommended for maximum plugin compatibility). You can have both at the same time, but you must ensure that your page and %s slugs are different.'=>'Ɣur-k, asbadu n usebter n %s ufella ad isemgired aɣbar-a ma yella iseɣwan mgaraden (ayen d iɣewwaren imezwura, yerna ittwasumer i umṣada afellay n usiɣzef). Tzemreḍ ad tesɛuḍ tifrat n sin deg yiwen, maca ilaq ad tḍemneḍ iberriḥen n usebter-ik d %s mgaraden.','Note: %s'=>'Awennit: %s','Notfication email?'=>'Imayl n tilɣa?','Nothing, migrate the tickets only'=>'Ulac, neqqel tikitin kan','Notification sender address'=>'Tansa n umazan n tilɣa','Notification sender name'=>'Isem n umazan n tilɣa','Notification types'=>'Anawen n tilɣa','Notify admin email(s)'=>'Selɣu imayl(en) n unedbal','Now there are #_BOOKEDSPACES spaces reserved, #_AVAILABLESPACES are still available.'=>'Tura llan #_BOOKEDSPACES idagen yettwaṭṭfen, #_AVAILABLESPACES ad ttwajden.','Number of events'=>'Amḍan n tedyanin','Number of locations'=>'Amḍan n yidrar','OAuth application information incomplete.'=>'Talɣut n usnas OAuth ur temmid ara.','On'=>'Di','On by default hides the link of every virtual event until the default time below. Off by default only hides the link of an event that is given a time of its own.'=>'Ma yermed s umezwer, aseɣwen n yal tadyant virtuel ad yettwaffer alamma d akud amezwer yellan sdaw. Ma yensa s umezwer, aseɣwen n tedyant i yettunefken akud-is kan ad yettwaffer.','Once a booking has been made, you can also allow a user to RSVP that booking, which confirms their intention of attending. This can be independent of the booking status itself.'=>'Mi ara tettwaxdem tuṭṭfa, tzemreḍ daɣen ad tsirgeḍ i useqdac ad d-yerr i tinnubga n tuṭṭfa-a, ayen ara yesbanen tuɣdi-ines n ttekki. Aya yezmer ad yili ur yettfeṛṛeq ara seg uddad n tuṭṭfa.','Once cancelled, you can allow susers to re-instate their booking, provided there are still enough spaces.'=>'Mi ara tettwasefsex, tzemreḍ ad tsirgeḍ iseqdacen ad uɣalen ad rzun tuṭṭfa-nsen, ma llan daɣen idagen ibedden.','Once you have entered valid API information, you will see a button below to connect your site to %s.'=>'Ticki tesekcmeḍ talɣut API tameɣtut, ad twaliḍ taqeffalt ukessar i uqqen n usmel-ik ɣer %s.','One Line'=>'Izirig yiwen','Online bookings are not available for this event.'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin n ssuq ur ttwajden ara i tedyant-agi.','Only %1$d space is left for %2$s.'=>'Yeqqim kan %1$d n wadig i %2$s.' . "\0" . 'Qqimen kan %1$d n yidagen i %2$s.','Only show events starting within a certain time limit on the events page. Default is future events with no end time limit.'=>'Sken kan tidyanin ibdan deg lawan yettwasbaḍen deg usebter n tidyanin. Amezwer d tidyanin n sdat war talast n wakud n taggara.','Only show this link to attendees with virtual access'=>'Sken aseɣwen-a kan i yimttekkiyen yesɛan anekcum virtuel','Only site admins see these changes.'=>'Ala inedbalen n usmel ara iwalin ibeddlen-agi.','Only the selected countries will be included in the country selection list. This takes precedence over excluded countries.'=>'Timura yettwafernen kan ad ttwarnunt ɣer tebdart n ufran n tmura. Ayagi yezwar tmura yettwagin.','Option value has been reverted. Please save your settings for it to take effect.'=>'Azal n textiyart yettuɣal. Ttxil sekles iɣewwaren-ik i wakken ad ṭṭfen.','Optional PHP date format for timeslot dates. Leave blank to use the default event date format. Example: %s'=>'Amasal afrayan n uzemz PHP i yizemzen n tallunin. Eǧǧ-it d ilem i useqdec n umasal amezwer n uzemz n tedyant. Amedya: %s','Optional PHP date format for timeslot times. Leave blank to use the default event time format. Example: %s'=>'Amasal afrayan n uzemz PHP i yikuden n tallunin. Eǧǧ-it d ilem i useqdec n umasal amezwer n wakud n tedyant. Amedya: %s','Options'=>'Tixtiṛiyin','Order'=>'Asmizwer','Order By'=>'Smizzwer s','Order Tickets By'=>'Smizwer tikitin s','Order by'=>'Smizzwer s','Order by %s'=>'Ssizdeg s %s','Order by end date, end time, then event name'=>'Smizzwer s uzemz n taggara, akud n taggara, d sakin isem n tedyant','Order by event name, then event start time'=>'Smizwer s yisem n tedyant, syin s wakud n usenker n tedyant','Order by event start time, then event name'=>'Smizwer s wakud n usenker n tedyant, syin s yisem n tedyant','Order by name'=>'Smizzwer s yisem','Order by name, end date, then end time'=>'Smizzwer s yisem, azemz n taggara, d sakin akud n taggara','Order by name, start date, then start time'=>'Smizzwer s yisem, azemz n tazwara, d sakin akud n tazwara','Order by start date, start time'=>'Smizzwer s uzemz n tazwara, akud n tazwara','Order by start date, start time, then event name'=>'Smizzwer s uzemz n tazwara, akud n tazwara, d sakin isem n tedyant','Order of the locations'=>'Asmizwer n yidrar','Organizer'=>'Amsuddes' . "\0" . 'Imsuddsen','Organizer name'=>'Isem n umsuddes','Organizer names'=>'Ismawen n yimsuddsen','Organizers'=>'Imsuddsen','Organizers are shared between events and hold contact details. Show them with #_EVENTORGANIZERS or #_EVENTORGANIZERSLIST.'=>'Imsuddsen ttwabḍan gar tidyanin u sɛan talɣut n unermes. Sken-iten s #_EVENTORGANIZERS neɣ #_EVENTORGANIZERSLIST.','Organizers imported from CSV files'=>'Imsuddsen yettwakcemen seg yifuyla CSV','Orphaned events may show on your event lists but not point to real event pages, and can be deleted.'=>'Tidyanin igujilen zemrent ad d-banent deg tebdarin n tidyanin maca ur uzzlent ara ɣer yisebtar n tidyanin ibanen, daɣen zemrent ad ttwakksent.','Other'=>'Wayeḍ','Our CSS file will be EXCLUDED on all of these pages. Takes precedence over inclusion rules.'=>'Afaylu CSS-nneɣ ad yettwakkes ɣef yisebtar-a akk. Yezwar ilugan n tmerna.','Our CSS file will only be INCLUDED on all of these pages.'=>'Afaylu CSS-nneɣ ad yettwarnu kan ɣef yisebtar-a akk.','Our theme has multiple CSS variables that can be overriden easily. The options below could be overriden just as easily via one line of CSS in your %s settings area, for example %s'=>'Asentel-nneɣ sɛa aṭas n yimessuyen CSS i izmiren ad ttwasemgirden s wudem fessus. Tixtiṛiyin n ddaw zemrent ad ttwasemgirden s wudem fessus s yiwen n yizirig n CSS deg tgezmi n yiɣewwaren n %s, amedya %s','Output format (advanced)'=>'Amasal n tuffɣa (anaẓi)','Override Default Formats?'=>'Beddel imusal imezwer?','Override Defaults'=>'Beddel ayen yellan s wudem amezwer','Override Excerpts with Formats?'=>'Beddel tussiften s yimusal?','Override calendar on events page?'=>'Semselsi tafada deg usebter n tedyanin?','Override calendar shortcode?'=>'Semselsi anegzum n tafada?','Override with Formats?'=>'Semgired s yimusal?','Overrides the default calendar shortcode. You can also use [events_fullcalendar] instead.'=>'Yesemsalsay anegzum amezwer n tafada. Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tesqedceḍ [events_fullcalendar].','Owner'=>'Bab','PDF tickets and invoices'=>'Tikitin PDF d tfakturin','PHP mail function'=>'Tawuri n PHP mail','Page heading'=>'Azwel n usebter','Pages'=>'Isebtar','Pages using TEC shortcodes or blocks'=>'Isebtar i yesseqdacen tangalin neɣ iḥedran TEC','Pardon the interruption... we hope you\'re enjoying Events Manager, and if so, we\'d really appreciate a positive review on the wordpress.org repository!'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif i usewḥel... netwali tḥemmleḍ Events Manager, ma yella akken, nḥemmel aṭas ma ara d-teǧǧeḍ tamawt tazreg ɣef uḍebsi n wordpress.org!','Parent %s'=>'%s amarraw','Parent %s:'=>'%s amarraw:','Parent Event'=>'Tadyant tamarrawt','Parent Event Categories'=>'Taggayin n tedyant timarrawin','Parent Event Category:'=>'Taggayt n tedyant tamarrawt:','Parent Event Tag:'=>'Tabzimt n tedyant tamarrawt:','Parent Event Tags'=>'Tibzimin n tedyant timarrawin','Parent Location'=>'Adrar amarraw','Parent Repeating Event'=>'Tadyant tamarrawt i d-yettuɣalen','Password'=>'Awal uffir','Password Lost and Found'=>'Tiririt n wawal n uɛeddi','Past'=>'Yettwasemmed','Past And Present Bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin yezrin d tid n tura','Past Events'=>'Tidyanin iɛeddan','Past events'=>'Tidyanin ineggura','Pause'=>'Seḥbes','Paused'=>'Yettwaseḥbes','Payment Information'=>'Talɣut n usewweṛ','Payment and Confirmation'=>'Asewweṛ akked usentem','Payments with PayPal, Stripe, Square, Authorize.net or offline'=>'Ṭṭafar s PayPal, Stripe, Square, Authorize.net neɣ war internet','Pending'=>'Yegguni','Pending Spaces'=>'Idagen yegguni','Pending and Approved'=>'Yegguni u yettwaqbel','Pending booking email'=>'Imayl n tuṭṭfa yegguni','Pending reschedule via primary recurrence.'=>'Beddel asnas yettraǧu s alugen amenzu.','Pending reschedule.'=>'Beddel asnas yettraǧu.','Pending review'=>'Yegguni asenqed','Performance Optimization'=>'Aswir n tmellit','Permalink Slug'=>'Aberriḥ n useɣwen ameɣlal','Permalink Slugs'=>'Iberriḥen n usɣen','Permalink slug must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, hyphens and forward slashes.'=>'Aberriḥ n useɣwen ameɣlal ilaq ad yesɛu kan isekkilen imecḍaḍen, imḍanen, iferruyen akked tiyaḍ n sdat.','Permanently deletes an Events Manager booking.'=>'Yekkes i lebda tuṭṭfa n Events Manager.','Personal Details'=>'Ifatusen udmawanen','Personal details have successfully been modified.'=>'Talɣut tudmawant tettwabeddel s lǧehd.','Phone'=>'Tilifun','Phone Number'=>'Uṭṭun n tilifun','Phone Numbers'=>'Uṭṭunen n tilifun','Phone number'=>'Uṭṭun n tilifun','Phone numbers can be used for further contact for both those that make bookings and submit events. We offer an advanced international-compatible phone input field with multiple options which standardize and ensure valid/consistent international phone numbers are provided by your users.'=>'Uṭṭunen n tilifun zemren ad ttwasqedcen i unermes ugar i wid ixeddmen tuṭṭfiwin d wid yuzzanen tidyanin. Nefk-ak-d urti n unekcum n uṭṭun n tilifun anaẓi yemṣada d umaḍal s textiṛiyin aṭas yessewḥalen yerna ttwaqqnen d uṭṭunen n tilifun imaḍalen ttwafkan sɣur iseqdacen-ik.','Physical'=>'Fizik','Physical Locations'=>'Idrar ifizikiyen','Physical Spaces'=>'Idagen ifizikiyen','Physical Venue'=>'Adrar afizik','Pie Chart'=>'Awonaf n tgust','Pills'=>'Tibeḍḍa','Pixelite'=>'Pixelite','Placeholders for customizing event pages'=>'Isemlen n wadig i usagen n isebtar n tedyanin','Placeholders: %1$s and %2$s plus the usual booking placeholders.'=>'Ismilen n wadig: %1$s d %2$s, rnu ismilen n wadig n tuṭṭfa yettwasqedcen.','Please <a href="%s">Log In</a> to view your bookings.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif <a href="%s">qqen</a> akken ad twaliḍ tuṭṭfiwin-ik.','Please add a User ID.'=>'Ttxil-k rnu ID n useqdac.','Please check the communications consent box so we can contact you if necessary.'=>'Ɣer-k cebbeḍ tankult n uqbal n yinermisen akken ad ak-nnermes ma yelha.','Please check the consent box so we can collect and store your submitted information.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif, cukk tankult n tuqqna i wakken ad nekles u nḥrez talɣut i d-tuzneḍ.','Please choose a virtual platform for this event.'=>'Ttxil-k fren aɣawwaḍ virtuel i tedyant-a.','Please confirm that you wish to withdraw from the following booking. This step submits your declaration of withdrawal.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif sentem belli tebɣiḍ ad teffɣeḍ seg tuṭṭfa-a. Aya ad yazen tazmilt-ik n uffeɣ.','Please enter a valid URL for this event location.'=>'Ttxil sekcem URL ameɣtu i udrar n tedyant-a.','Please enter a valid URL.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif, sekcem URL ameɣtu.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif, sekcem tansa n yimayl tameɣtut.','Please enter a valid phone number.'=>'Ttxil sekcem uṭṭun n tilifun ameɣtu.','Please enter a valid ticket price e.g. 10.50 (no currency signs)'=>'Ttxil sekcem azal n tikit ameɣtu, amedya 10.50 (war ineṭṭalen n idrimen)','Please enter dates and times for your first recurrence pattern in the recurrence section.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif, sekcem izemzen d yakudan n udlif amezwaru n walugen deg tigezmi n walugen.','Please enter your Location ID, or leave blank for no location.'=>'Ttxil-k kcem ID n wadrar, neɣ eǧǧ-it d ilem ma ulac adrar.','Please enter your Location ID.'=>'Ttxil-k kcem ID n wadrar.','Please fill in all required fields correctly.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif ččar akk urtiyen yettwaḥsen akken iwata.','Please provide a dashicons class, url to a png/svg file, or leave blank for default menu icon.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif efk talɣa dashicons, URL ɣer ufaylu png/svg, neɣ eǧǧ-it d ilem i tignit n umuɣ tamezwert.','Please provide a valid phone number.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif, sekcem uṭṭun n tilifun ameɣtu.','Please provide some link text for this event location URL.'=>'Ttxil efk aḍris n useɣwen i URL n udrar n tedyant-a.','Please select a valid location.'=>'Ttxil fren adrar ameɣtu.','Please select at least one space to proceed with your booking.'=>'Fren ma yella yiwen n wadig ara tt-id-teṭṭfeḍ akken ad tkemmleḍ tuṭṭfa-inek.','Please specify what days of the week this event should occur on.'=>'Ttxil sbadu ussan n ddurt ara teḍru deg-sen tedyant-a.','Please supply a valid email format.'=>'Ttxil sekcem amasal n imayl ameɣtu.','Please update your network and when you\'re happy with the changes you can also finalize the migration by deleting unecessary data in the %s page.'=>'Ɣer-k leqqem uzeṭṭa-ik u mi ara tḍemneḍ isenfaren, tzemreḍ daɣen ad tfakkeḍ amutti s tukksa n yisefka ur nelli ara d ilaqen deg usebter %s.','Please upload a valid txt file containing Events Manager import settings.'=>'Ma ulac aɣilif sali afaylu txt ameɣtu i yesɛan iɣewwaren n ukter n Events Manager.','Please visit the %s to see migration options.'=>'Ṛzu %s akken ad twaliḍ tifrat n tmigration.','Please wait while the booking is being submitted.'=>'Ttxil ṛǧu almi d-tettwazen tuṭṭfa.','Plural'=>'Aget','Plural version of the Custom Post Type (CPT) name, used internally.'=>'Lqem n uget n yisem n Custom Post Type (CPT), yettwaseqdec seg ukessar.','Plural version of the Custom Post Type name, used internally.'=>'Lqem n uget n yisem n Custom Post Type, yettwaseqdec seg ukessar.','Plural version of the Type Key, used internally. For example, workshop would be workshops.'=>'Lqem n uget n tsarut n unaw, yettwaseqdec seg ukessar. Amedya, workshop ad yili d workshops.','Popular %s'=>'%s imeẓwiyen','Popular Event Categories'=>'Taggayin n tedyant imeẓwiyen','Popular Event Tags'=>'Tibzimin n tedyant imeẓwiyen','Post Classes'=>'Iclasen n umagrad','Postcode'=>'Tangalt n tpusta','Preparing'=>'Ihegga','Prevent unnecessary loading of JavaScript files on pages where they are not needed.'=>'Ḥbes asali war tilawt n ifuyla JavaScript deg yisebtar anda ur ttwasran ara.','Preview Formats'=>'Timuɣliwin n yimusal','Preview Start Times'=>'Tamuɣli n yizemzen n tazwara','Preview mode is enabled. Only site admins will see the difference, our new default formats will be used instead of your current formats. You can continue to edit/save this settings page without overwriting saved settings.'=>'Askar n tmuɣli yermed. Ala inedbalen n usmel ara iwalin amgired, imasalen-nneɣ imaynuten imezwura ad ttwasqedcen deg wadeg n yimasalen-ik n tura. Tzemreḍ ad tkemmleḍ ad tẓergeḍ/teklseḍ asebter-a n yiɣewwaren war ma tmessuḍ iɣewwaren yettwakelsen.','Previous Period'=>'Tawala tuzwirt','Previous Year'=>'Aseggas yezrin','Previous page'=>'Asebter yezrin','Price'=>'Azal','Pricing'=>'Ssuma','Privacy Consent'=>'Tuqqna n tbaḍnit','Privacy Policy and Consent'=>'Tasertit tabaḍnit d tuqqna','Pro Add-On'=>'Asiɣzef Pro','Pro installs alongside the free Events Manager plugin. Every license includes one year of updates and Pro support.'=>'Pro yettwasbadu ɣer tama n uzegrar Events Manager n baṭel. Yal turagt tesɛa useggas n yileqqmen d tallalt n Pro.','Processing ...'=>'Asenfar ...','Profile'=>'Amaɣnu','Progress'=>'Tikli','Provide one of `id`, `source_url`, `content_base64`, or a multipart `file` upload.'=>'Fk yiwen seg `id`, `source_url`, `content_base64`, neɣ asali n `file` multipart.','Published'=>'Yettwasuffeɣ','Published Event'=>'Tadyant yeffɣen','Push notifications for the <a href="%s">mobile app</a>. When enabled, registered devices receive real-time pushes for bookings and events on this site, and the app exposes per-type notification preferences to the user.'=>'Tilɣa n uḥezzeb i <a href="%s">usnas aziraz</a>. Mi ara yettwarmed, allalen yettwaklasen ad d-awin tilɣa n tuffɣa n tuṭṭfiwin d tidyanin n usmel-a, yerna usnas ad yesken tixtiṛiyin n tilɣa i yal anaw i useqdac.','QR code check-in from your phone'=>'Anekcum s tangalt QR seg tilifun-ik','Quantity'=>'Taqeffalt','RSS'=>'RSS','RSS Scope'=>'Azrag n RSS','RSS description format'=>'Amasal n usnummel n RSS','RSS limit'=>'Talast n RSS','RSS main description'=>'Asnummel agejdan n RSS','RSS main title'=>'Azwel agejdan n RSS','RSS title format'=>'Amasal n uzwel n RSS','RSVP'=>'Tiririt ɣef tinnubga','RSVP - %s'=>'RSVP - %s','RSVP Modifications'=>'Ibeddilen n tinnubga','RSVP Status'=>'Addad n RSVP','RSVP Syncing'=>'Amtawi n tinnubga','Re-Check Updates'=>'Ɛiwed asenqed n ileqqmen','Re-Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'Tadyant yettwazen i tikkelt-nniḍen tettṛaju taqbalt','Re-order.'=>'Ɛiwed asmizwer.','Read more on our blog'=>'Ɣer ugar deg ablug-nneɣ','Read our announcement'=>'Ɣer ulɣu-nneɣ','Read-only abilities for retrieving Events Manager events, locations, bookings, categories, and tags.'=>'Tizemrin n tɣuri kan i uḍfar n tedyanin, idrar, tuṭṭfiwin, taggayin d tibzimin n Events Manager.','Reason (optional)'=>'Awal (d axetṛan)','Received on: %s'=>'Yettwaqbel ass n: %s','Received: %s'=>'Yettwaqbel: %s','Recent Bookings'=>'Tuṭṭfiwin n melmi kan','Recent Events Manager updates have made security improvements to how events are output, specifically with Shortcodes. The result is that some shortcode created prior to these updates will be displayed as raw/escaped HTML rather than content.'=>'Ileqman n melmi kan n Events Manager rnan ameslay n taɣellist i wamek ara d-ttwasuffɣent tedyanin, s wudem uzzig s yinegzumen. Ayen i d-yekkan d akken kra n yinegzumen yettwasnulfan send ileqman-agi ad ttwaskanen d HTML ameslay/yettwaqqnen deg wadig n ugbur.','Reconnect'=>'Qqen tikkelt-nniḍen','Recurrence %s'=>'Alugen %s','Recurrence %s cannot start after they end.'=>'Alugen %s ur zmiren ara ad bdun seld ukken ad fakken.','Recurrence Interval'=>'Tazrawt n walugen','Recurrences'=>'Alugen','Recurrences last all day.'=>'Alugen ad ṭṭfen ass akken.','Recurrences that currently take place within new unavailable dates will be %s'=>'Alugen i d-yettuɣalen akka tura deg yizemzen ur nelli ara imaynuten ad ttwa%s','Recurrences will end on:'=>'Alugen ad yettwali ass n:','Recurrences will span between:'=>'Alugen ad iṭṭef gar:','Recurrences will start from:'=>'Alugen ad ibdu seg:','Recurring'=>'I d-yettuɣalen','Recurring %s'=>'%s i d-yettuɣalen','Recurring Event'=>'Tadyant i d-yettuɣalen','Recurring Events'=>'Tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen','Recurring Events Picker'=>'Afran n tedyanin i d-yettuɣalen','Recurring events (Pro)'=>'Tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen (Pro)','Recurring events allow you to create one event page with recurring dates on the same page. Recurrences have their own bookings assigned to them, but can be linked with shared tickets.'=>'Tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen ttaǧǧan ad tesnulfuḍ yiwen n usebter n tedyant s yizemzen i d-yettuɣalen deg yiwen n usebter. Alugen yal yiwen sɛa tuṭṭfiwin-is, maca zemrent ad ttwaqqnent s tikitin yemtawin.','Recurring events have a picker in order to load the right booking form, choose your picker style for your booking forms.'=>'Tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen sɛant afran i wakken ad d-yettwasali tserkant n tuṭṭfa taqbalt, fren aɣanib n ufran i tseddast n tuṭṭfa-ik.','Redirect any other old addresses, such as single dates of recurring events, series pages and calendar views, once The Events Calendar is deactivated'=>'Ssemmed tansiwin nniḍen n zik, am yizemzen yettwafernen n tedyanin i d-yettuɣalen, isebtar n taggayt d tmuɣliwin n tfada, mi ara tettwasens The Events Calendar','Refresh'=>'Smiren','Region'=>'Tamnaḍt','Region:'=>'Tamnaḍt:','Registration Email Templates'=>'Tineɣrufin n yimaylen n usekles','Registration Information'=>'Talɣut n usekles','Registration email'=>'Imayl n usekles','Registration email subject'=>'Asentel n yimayl n usekles','Reject'=>'Agi','Rejected'=>'Yettwagi','Rejected booking email'=>'Imayl n tuṭṭfa yettwagin','Remember Me'=>'Cfu fell-i','Remember and hide checkbox'=>'Cukk u ffer tankult','Remember and show checkbox'=>'Cukk u sken tankult','Remember filtering options'=>'Ḥrez tixtiyin n usizdeg','Remember these settings'=>'Ḥrez iɣewwaren-a','Remembering Consent'=>'Asmekti n tuqqna','Remove'=>'Kkes','Remove Image'=>'Kkes tugna','Remove Orphaned Events'=>'Kkes tidyanin igujilen','Remove or reorder columns below.'=>'Kkes neɣ ales asuddes n ijga ukessar.','Remove this recurrence.'=>'Kkes alugen-a.','Remove this ticket booking'=>'Kkes tuṭṭfa-agi n tikit','Rename %s?'=>'Beddel isem n %s?','Renew license'=>'Ɛiwed turagt','Renew or upgrade'=>'Ɛiwed neɣ sali','Repeat a number of times'=>'Ɛiwed tikkal','Repeat interval "%s" is not a whole number of 1 or more.'=>'Afrag n tɛiwdt "%s" mačči d amḍan ummid n 1 neɣ ugar.','Repeat interval (every 1, 2, 3 ...)'=>'Afrag n tɛiwdt (yal 1, 2, 3 ...)','Repeat on day of the month (1 to 31, or last)'=>'Ɛiwed deg wass n wayyur (1 ɣer 31, neɣ last)','Repeat on these dates'=>'Ɛiwed deg yizemzen-a','Repeat on week of the month (first to fourth, or last)'=>'Ɛiwed deg dduṛt n wayyur (first ɣer fourth, neɣ last)','Repeat on weekdays'=>'Ɛiwed deg wussan n dduṛt','Repeat rules Events Manager does not have'=>'Ilugan n tɛiwdt i ur yesɛi ara Events Manager','Repeat until (date)'=>'Ɛiwed alamma (azemz)','Repeat value "%s" is not understood. Use daily, weekly, monthly or yearly.'=>'Azal n tɛiwdt "%s" ur yettwaɛqel ara. Seqdec daily, weekly, monthly neɣ yearly.','Repeated events are similar to recurrences, but each event is independent of each other with its own page on your site and entirely separate bookings. You can mass-edit the recurrences by editing your repeating event.'=>'Tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen mgaradent d alugen, maca yal tadyant tzeddig seg tayeḍ s usebter-is ɣef usmel-ik d tuṭṭfiwin yemgaraden akk. Tzemreḍ ad tẓergeḍ alugen s lekmal s usnifel n tedyant-ik i d-yettuɣalen.','Repeating'=>'I d-yettuɣalen','Repeating %s'=>'%s i d-yettuɣalen','Repeating Event'=>'Tadyant i d-yettuɣalen','Repeating Events'=>'Tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen','Repeating Events Template'=>'Taneɣruft n tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen','Repeats'=>'Yettɛawad','Repeats (daily, weekly, monthly or yearly)'=>'Yettɛawad (daily, weekly, monthly neɣ yearly)','Replace TEC shortcodes and blocks in posts and pages with Events Manager equivalents'=>'Beddel tingalin d yiḥedran TEC deg yiznan d yisebtar s wid n Events Manager','Require locations for events?'=>'Sua adrar i tedyanin?','Required'=>'Yettwasra','Required?'=>'Ilaq?','Reschedule'=>'Beddel asnas','Reschedule %s Times?'=>'Beddel asnas n yizemzen n %s?','Reschedule Events'=>'Beddel asnas n tidyanin','Reschedule Recurrences?'=>'Beddel asnas n walugen?','Resend Email'=>'Ṛuḥ i yimayl tikkelt-nniḍen','Reserved unconfirmed spaces?'=>'Ḥrez idagen ur yettwasentem ara?','Reset'=>'Wennez','Reset Event Timezones'=>'Wennez tamnaḍt tasragant n tidyanin','Reset Events Manager'=>'Err Events Manager ɣer wazal amezwaru','Reset Timezones'=>'Wennez tamnaḍt tasragant','Reset this form to create a location or search again.'=>'Wennez tiferkit-a akken ad tesnulfuḍ adrar neɣ ad tnadiḍ i tikkelt-nniḍen.','Reset to default value?'=>'Ales ɣer azal amezwer?','Resheduled recurrences that fall outside new pattern will be %s'=>'Alugen yettwabeddlen i yellan beṛṛa n udlif amaynut ad ttwa%s','Responsive'=>'Yettwafrurzen','Responsive Behaviour'=>'Tikli n uḍfar n tehri','Restrict to'=>'Gzem ɣer','Restrict uploads to a specific type of file. Leave as "Any Type" to allow all.'=>'Gdel asali ɣer anaw n ufaylu uzzigen. Eǧǧ-it d "Anaw ula d yiwen" akken ad teǧǧeḍ akk.','Result'=>'Agmuḍ','Results per Page'=>'Igmaḍ i yal asebter','Resume'=>'Kemmel','Resume Previous Attempt (All Blogs)'=>'Kemmel aɛiwed yezrin (Akk iblugen)','Retrieves Events Manager %s.'=>'Yettawi-d %s n Events Manager.','Retrieves a filtered collection of Events Manager events.'=>'Yettawi-d tagrumma yettwasizdegen n tedyanin n Events Manager.','Retrieves a filtered collection of Events Manager locations.'=>'Yettawi-d tagrumma yettwasizdegen n idrar n Events Manager.','Retrieves booking availability, spaces, and ticket availability for one event.'=>'Yettawi-d tuɣdest n tuṭṭfa, idagen d tuɣdest n tikitin i yiwet n tedyant.','Retrieves bookings visible to the current user.'=>'Yettawi-d tuṭṭfiwin i d-yettwalin i useqdac amiran.','Retrieves one Events Manager %s by ID.'=>'Yettawi-d yiwen n %s n Events Manager s ID.','Retrieves one Events Manager event by ID.'=>'Yettawi-d yiwet n tedyant n Events Manager s ID.','Retrieves one Events Manager location by ID.'=>'Yettawi-d yiwen n udrar n Events Manager s ID.','Retrieves one Events Manager ticket by ID.'=>'Yettawi-d yiwet n tikit n Events Manager s ID.','Retrieves one booking by ID if visible to the current user.'=>'Yettawi-d yiwet n tuṭṭfa s ID ma yella tettwali i useqdac amiran.','Retrieves tickets for one Events Manager event.'=>'Yettawi-d tikitin n yiwet n tedyant n Events Manager.','Returns countries with their ISO-3166 alpha-2 code and translated display name. By default returns the full ISO list — useful for populating a country picker. Pass `only_available: true` to narrow the result to countries that have at least one stored location row.'=>'Yettawi-d tamura s tengalt-is ISO-3166 alpha-2 d yisem-is yettwasuqqlen. S wudem amezwer yettawi-d tabdart ISO temmed, ayen yelhan i usnermes n ufran n tmura. Fk `only_available: true` i wakken ad tekkseḍ kra n tmura ur sɛint ula d yiwen n adrar yettwaklasen.','Returns the distinct list of region names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` to narrow results to one country.'=>'Yettawi-d tabdart n yesmawen n tmennaɣin yellan deg idrar n Events Manager. Fk `country` i wakken ad tesḥettmeḍ igmaḍ ɣer yiwet n tmurt.','Returns the distinct list of state/province names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` and/or `region` to narrow results.'=>'Yettawi-d tabdart n yesmawen n yiɣerfan/tmennaɣin yellan deg idrar n Events Manager. Fk `country` d/neɣ `region` i wakken ad tesḥettmeḍ igmaḍ.','Returns the distinct list of town/city names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country`, `region`, and/or `state` to narrow results.'=>'Yettawi-d tabdart n yesmawen n taddart/tmdint yellan deg idrar n Events Manager. Fk `country`, `region`, d/neɣ `state` i wakken ad tesḥettmeḍ igmaḍ.','Returns the exact fields, payload locations, payment options, and a ready-to-submit example payload needed to create a booking for one event. Call this before create-booking.'=>'Yettawi-d urtiyen ilaqen, ideg ttwarzen, textiṛiyin n usewweṛ, d umedya n yisefka yewjden i uzzenz i wakken ad d-tesnulfuḍ tuṭṭfa i yiwet n tedyant. Siwel-it send create-booking.','Revert to viewing your previously saved fromats.'=>'Uɣal ɣer wawal n yimasalen-ik yettwakelsen uzwir.','Revoked'=>'Yettwasefsex','Right of Withdrawal (EU)'=>'Azref n usuɣal ɣer deffir (EU)','Rings'=>'Tiyiwin','Roll back'=>'Err ɣer deffir','Rollback'=>'Tuɣalin ɣer deffir','Rolled back'=>'Yettwarr ɣer deffir','Row'=>'Izirig','Rows imported'=>'Izirigen yettwakcemen','Rows skipped'=>'Izirigen yettwazgalen','Run again (sync changes)'=>'Ɛiwed tikkelt-nniḍen (mtawi ibeddilen)','Running…'=>'Iteddu…','SMTP Encryption'=>'Awgelhen SMTP','SMTP authentication is often needed. If you use Gmail, make sure to set this parameter to Yes'=>'Asesteb SMTP yesra s waṭas. Ma tesseqdaceḍ Gmail, ṭṭef deg yiman-ik ad tferneḍ "Ih" i uɣewwar-agi','SMTP password'=>'Awal n uɛeddi SMTP','SMTP username'=>'Isem n useqdac SMTP','Sale Averages'=>'Imegzuyen n tisatin','Sales'=>'Tisatin','Same as <em>Date Format</em>, but this is used for the datepickers used by Events Manager.'=>'Am <em>Amasal n uzemz</em>, maca wagi yettwaseqdac i yimefranen n yizemzen yettwaseqdacen sɣur Events Manager.','Same concept as the body classes option, but some themes also use the <code>post_class()</code> function within page content to differentiate styling between post types.'=>'D tikti n textiṛt n iclasen n tfekka, maca kra n yisental sqedcen daɣen tawuri <code>post_class()</code> deg ugbur n usebter i wakken ad gem aɣanib gar anawen n yimagraden.','Sanitize shortcode content?'=>'Sfeḍ agbur n unegzum?','Save'=>'Sekles','Save %d%%'=>'Ḥrez %d%%','Save Changes'=>'Sekles asnifel','Save Settings'=>'Sekles iɣewwaren','Save Ticket'=>'Sekles tikit','Save imported events and locations as'=>'Sekles tidyanin d idrar yettwakcemen am','Save your settings for this to take effect!'=>'Sekles iɣewwaren-ik i wakken ad ddun!','Saved, but the featured image could not be attached: %s. To fix it: call upload-media (use content_base64 if the source blocks server-side fetches, e.g. Unsplash), then either pass featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location on that same upload-media call, or pass the returned attachment id as featured_image to update-event / update-location.'=>'Yekles, maca tugna tameẓlit ur tettwarez ara: %s. I wakken ad tessefhmeḍ: siwel upload-media (seqdec content_base64 ma yella aɣbalu yessewḥel tuɣalin seg uqeddac, amedya Unsplash), sakin fk featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location deg yiwen n usiwel n upload-media, neɣ fk ID n useɣwen i d-yuɣalen d featured_image i update-event / update-location.','Scope'=>'Azrag','Scope of the locations'=>'Azrag n yidrar','Search'=>'Nadi','Search %s'=>'Nadi %s','Search %s...'=>'Nadi %s...','Search Event Categories'=>'Nadi taggayin n tedyant','Search Event Tags'=>'Nadi tibzimin n tedyant','Search Events'=>'Nadi tidyanin','Search Filter Label'=>'Tabzimt n sti n unadi','Search Form'=>'Tiferkit n unadi','Search Forms'=>'Tiferkitin n unadi','Search Locations'=>'Nadi idrar','Search Repeating Events'=>'Nadi tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen','Search Results View Type'=>'Anaw n uskan n yigmaḍ n unadi','Search bookings'=>'Nadi tuṭṭfiwin','Search button text'=>'Aḍris n tqeffalt n unadi','Search form will be pre-selected with this country.'=>'Tiferkit n unadi ad tettwafren yakan s tmurt-a.','Search forms'=>'Tiferkitin n unadi','Searching...'=>'Anadi...','See All'=>'Wali akk','See original translation.'=>'Wali asuqqel aneṣli.','Select Location'=>'Fren adrar','Select a Timezone to reset all your blog events to.'=>'Fren tamnaḍt tasragant ara d-yettuɣalen akk tidyanin n iblugen-ik.','Select a blog and click the button next to it to clean up that specific blog. You must clean up one blog at a time.'=>'Fren ablug u sit ɣef tqeffalt yellan zdat-s i uselkem n wablug-nni kan. Ilaq ad tselkmeḍ yiwen n wablug yal tikkelt.','Select a blog...'=>'Fren ablug...','Select a date'=>'Fren azemz','Select a group you admin to attach this event to it. Note that all other admins of that group can modify the booking.'=>'Fren agraw i tettwaliḍ d anedbal-is akken ad tesresreḍ tadyant-agi ɣer-s. Ɣur-k: akk inedbalen-nniḍen n ugraw-nni zemren ad snifelen tuṭṭfa.','Select a time'=>'Fren akud','Select date range'=>'Fren azrar n yizemzen','Select dates'=>'Fren izemzen','Select number of spaces'=>'Fren amḍan n yidagen','Select the booking you wish to withdraw from.'=>'Fren tuṭṭfa ideg tebɣiḍ ad teffɣeḍ.','Select the editor type you\'d like to use for submitting content in your dashboard.'=>'Fren anaw n umaẓrag i tebɣiḍ ad tesqedceḍ i tuzzna n ugbur deg tfelwit-ik.','Select the method to send email notification.'=>'Fren tarrayt n uzen n tilɣa s yimayl.','Select the options below and export all the records you have currently filtered (all pages) into a spreadsheet format.'=>'Fren tixtiyin ukessar u sifeḍ akk tikkal i tesstiḍ tura (isebtar merra) ɣer umasal n umbellez.','Select the view types a user can select to display on the default search form, you can override this selection using the %s argument in shortcodes and PHP functions.'=>'Fren ineɣmisen n tmuɣli i izemren useqdac ad d-yeskeb deg tfelwit n unadi tamezwert, tzemreḍ ad tbeddleḍ afran-a s useqdec n wanaw %s deg yinegzumen akked tmahilin PHP.','Select which archetypes this site will use and choose a default type.'=>'Fren acu n Archetypes ara yesseqdec usmel-a u fren anaw amezwer.','Select yes to allow bookings and tickets for events.'=>'Fren ih i wakken ad tesirgeḍ tuṭṭfiwin d tikitin i tidyanin.','Select yes to disable Events Manager from enabling thumbnails (some themes may already have this enabled, which we cannot be turned off here).'=>'Fren ih i wakken ad tesnesḍ Events Manager ɣef usermed n tugniwin timecṭuḥin (kra n isental yezmer ad tt-yermed yakan, ur nezmir ara ad tt-nesens da).','Select yes to enable the attributes feature'=>'Fren ih i wakken ad tesremdeḍ timeẓluyt n yiraten','Select yes to enable the category features'=>'Fren ih i wakken ad tesremdeḍ timeẓluyin n taggayin','Select yes to enable the tag features'=>'Fren ih i wakken ad tesremdeḍ timeẓluyin n tibzimin','Select yes to select location from a drop-down menu; location selection will be faster, but you will lose the ability to insert locations with events'=>'Fren ih i wakken ad tferneḍ adrar seg wumuɣ ara d-yettwaneccen; afran n wadrar ad yili d arurad, maca ad tesruḥeḍ tazmert n tgara n yidrar d tedyanin','Sell event tickets through your WooCommerce cart and checkout, with bookings kept in sync with orders, and take payment with any gateway WooCommerce supports. Sold separately on Woo.com and not included in Pro Plus.'=>'Zenz tikitin n tedyanin s tkeddabt d usenqes n WooCommerce, s tuṭṭfiwin yemtawan d tladnin, u ṭṭef axellaṣ s yal tabburt yettwasefraken sɣur WooCommerce. Yettwazenz weḥd-s deg Woo.com u ur yettwaddukkel ara deg Pro Plus.','Send Email'=>'Azen imayl','Send HTML Emails?'=>'Azen imaylen n HTML?','Send cancelled booking email?'=>'Azen imayl n tuṭṭfa yettwaḥbesen?','Sends a general email to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled, which is customized in your %s setings.'=>'Yuzen imayl amatu i yal tuṭṭfa yettwasentemen neɣ yegguni n tedyant yettwaḥbesen, yettwasagen deg yiɣewwaren n %s.','Sent to the consumer as the legally-required acknowledgment of receipt. It records the withdrawal statement and the exact date and time of receipt, and confirms receipt only — not the validity of the withdrawal.'=>'Yettwazen i umsaway am tuqbalt n wawway i d-yessuter umaru. Yeskelles tamselt n usuɣal d wass akked wakud ameɣtu n wawway, u yessentem kan wawway, mačči ameɣtu n usuɣal.','Separate %s with commas'=>'Ferreq %s s tfesyin','Separate Range Inputs?'=>'Ferrek tabwaḍt n yimaren?','Separate event categories with commas'=>'Bḍu taggayin n tedyant s tefrayin','Separate event tags with commas'=>'Bḍu tibzimin n tedyant s tefrayin','Series pass, paid with booking #%d'=>'Tikit n taggayt, yettwaxelṣen s tuṭṭfa #%d','Server API Credentials'=>'Inekcumen API n uqeddac','Set booking status'=>'Sbadu addad n tuṭṭfa','Setting this to no will allow you to submit events without locations. You can use the <code>{no_location}...{/no_location}</code> or <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> conditional placeholder to selectively display location information.'=>'Ma tefkaḍ ala, ad tizmireḍ ad tazneḍ tidyanin war idrar. Tzemreḍ ad tesqedceḍ asmel n wadig n tegrawt <code>{no_location}...{/no_location}</code> neɣ <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> i wakken ad d-tesekneḍ talɣut n wadrar s wudem ufrin.','Setting this to yes will also make your images crop efficiently with the %s feature in the %s plugin.'=>'Asermed n waya ad yeǧǧ daɣen tugniwin-ik ad ttwanǧren s wudem usnerni s timeẓluyt %s deg usiɣzef %s.','Setting this to yes will make all events save in the main site event tables (EM must also be activated). This allows you to share events across different blogs, such as showing events in your network whilst allowing users to display and manage their events within their own blog. Bear in mind that activating this will mean old events created on the sub-blogs will not be accessible anymore, and if you switch back they will be but new events created during global events mode will only remain on the main site.'=>'Ma tferneḍ "Ih" akk tidyanin ad ttwaklasent deg tfelwiyin tigejdanin n usmel agejdan (EM ilaq daɣen ad yermed). Aya ad k-yeǧǧ ad tbeṭṭuḍ tidyanin gar iblugen yemgaraden, am tmeskant n tidyanin deg uẓeṭṭa-ik mi ara teǧǧeḍ iseqdacen ad skanen u ad sefrken tidyanin-nsen deg ublug-nsen. Ṭṭef deg yiman-ik belli armed n waya ad yeǧǧ tidyanin iliyen yettwasnulfan deg iblugen imaynuten ur ttwaččuren ara, u ma tuɣaleḍ ad ttwaččuren maca tidyanin timaynutin yettwasnulfan deg uskar amatu ad qimen kan deg usmel agejdan.','Setting this to yes will make categories display as a page rather than an archive.'=>'Ma tebdeḍ ayen-a ɣer "ih", taggayin ad ttwaskanent d asebter, mačči d tarcivt.','Settings'=>'Iɣewwaren','Settings > Emails'=>'Iɣewwaren > Imaylen','Settings Page'=>'Asebter n yiɣewwaren','Settings have been reset back to default. Your events, locations and categories have not been modified.'=>'Iɣewwaren uɣalen ɣer wazalen imezwura. Tidyanin, idrar d taggayin-ik ur ttwabeddlen ara.','Settings imported.'=>'Iɣewwaren ttwakterren.','Shortcode HTML Entity Decoding'=>'Tukksa n tangalt n tebdert HTML n yinegzumen','Shortcodes and blocks'=>'Tangalin d yiḥedran','Shorten the calendar headings containing the days of the week, use 0 for the full name.'=>'Sekcer izwal n tfada yesɛan ussan n tlalit, seqdec 0 i yisem ummid.','Show'=>'Sken','Show "all events" link at bottom'=>'Sken aseɣwen n "akk tidyanin" deg uksar','Show Advanced Options'=>'Sken tinefrunin tinaẓiyin','Show Advanced Search'=>'Sken anadi anaẓi','Show Flags'=>'Sken ibenṭaren','Show Long Events?'=>'Sken tidyanin ineɣzaf?','Show Search'=>'Sken anadi','Show Selected Dialcode'=>'Sken tangalt n usiwel yettwafernen','Show all events link at bottom?'=>'Sken aseɣwen n "akk tidyanin" deg uksar?','Show categories?'=>'Sken taggayin?','Show countries?'=>'Sken tamura?','Show date range?'=>'Sken azrag n yizemzen?','Show dates in timeslots?'=>'Sken azemz deg tallunin?','Show distance options?'=>'Sken tixtiṛiyin n tanekra?','Show events search?'=>'Sken anadi n tidyanin?','Show footer link?'=>'Sken aseɣwen deg uḍar n usebter?','Show form again?'=>'Sken tamerkant daɣen?','Show fully booked timeslots?'=>'Sken tallunin tummidin?','Show geolocation search?'=>'Sken anadi s wadig?','Show hide/show trigger?'=>'Sken tarmit n usekfal/n uskan?','Show label'=>'Tabzimt n uskan','Show list on day with single event?'=>'Sken tabdart deg wass s yiwet n tedyant?','Show locations search?'=>'Sken anadi n yidrar?','Show long events'=>'Sken tidyanin ibeṭṭanen','Show main search bar?'=>'Sken afeggag n unadi amenzay?','Show member-only tickets?'=>'Sken tikitin n yiɛeggalen kan?','Show multiple tickets if logged out?'=>'Sken aṭas n tkitin ma yeffeɣ?','Show number of locations'=>'Sken amḍan n yidrar','Show regions?'=>'Sken tamnaḍin?','Show search filters on page load'=>'Sken imsizdigen n unadi mi ara yettusali usebter','Show some love?'=>'Sken ayefki?','Show sorting icon?'=>'Sken tignit n usmizwer?','Show spaces left?'=>'Sken idagen i d-yeqqimen?','Show states?'=>'Sken iberdan?','Show tags?'=>'Sken tibzimin?','Show text search?'=>'Sken anadi n uḍris?','Show the flag of the selected country code and in the country selection list of the phone input field.'=>'Sken abenṭar n tmurt yettwafernen akked deg tebdart n ufran n tmura n urti n uṭṭun n tilifun.','Show the join link publicly, for example on the event page and in calendar feeds'=>'Sken aseɣwen n uttekki s wudem azayez, am deg usebter n tedyant u deg yimuttayen n tafada','Show the sorting icon to change the ordering of search results.'=>'Sken tignit n usmizwer i wakken ad tbeddleḍ amizwer n yigmaḍ n unadi.','Show ticket table in single ticket mode?'=>'Sken tafelwit n tkitin deg uskar n tkit yiwen?','Show towns/cities?'=>'Sken timdinin/tiɣermin?','Show unavailable tickets?'=>'Sken tikitin ur yewjid ara?','Show upcoming timeslots on the initial booking form load before a visitor chooses a calendar date.'=>'Sken tallunin i d-iteddun deg usali amezwaru n tserkant n tuṭṭfa send ad yefren umerza azemz deg tefada.','Show upcoming timeslots?'=>'Sken tallunin i d-iteddun?','Show virtual events filter?'=>'Sken imsizdeg n tidyanin virtuel?','Show/Hide Filters'=>'Sken/Ffer imsizdigen','Shown in place of the link until then. %s is replaced with the number of minutes.'=>'Yettwaskan deg wadeg n useɣwen alamma d lweqt-nni. %s yettwasemmed s umḍan n tisdidin.','Shows events, posts or other post types in an AJAX month, week or day calendar that visitors can filter by category or tag. Events Manager integrates with it automatically.'=>'Yesken tidyanin, iznan neɣ anaw nniḍen n yizen deg tfada AJAX n wayyur, dduṛt neɣ ass i izemren yimsuɣ ad ten-zizdeg s taggayt neɣ tabzimt. Events Manager yeddukkel yid-s s wudem awurman.','Sign In'=>'Tuqqna','Sign Up'=>'Kcem','Similar to label but used in instances when referring to one single %s type.'=>'Am tebzimt maca yettwaseqdec mi ara yettwabder yiwen n unaw n %s.','Since the event is recurring, you must specify an event end date greater than the start date.'=>'Axaṭer tadyant d tin i d-yettuɣalen, ilaq ad tferneḍ azemz n ufakki n tedyant yettɛeddan azemz n tazwara.','Single'=>'Asuf','Single %s Format'=>'Amasal n %s yiwen','Single %s Page'=>'Asebter n %s asuf','Single %s page format'=>'Amasal n usebter n %s asuf','Single %s title format'=>'Amasal n uzwel n %s asuf','Single Location/Event Map Format'=>'Amasal n tmidit n wadrar/n tedyant yiwen','Single dot'=>'Tanqiḍt yeddan','Single ticket mode?'=>'Askar n tkit tamaynut?','Site Categories'=>'Taggayin n usmel','Site admins will be allowed to rename the base event and location %s on their individual sites.'=>'Inedbalen n usmel ad ttwasirgen ad beddlen isem n tedyant n taffa akked n %s n udig deg yismal-nsen.','Skip rows already on this site: events with the same name and start, locations with the same name'=>'Zgel izirigen yellan yakan deg usmel-a: tidyanin s yisem d tazwara yemṣadan, idrar s yisem yemṣadan','Skip the row'=>'Zgel izirig','Skipped'=>'Yettwazgel','Slug'=>'Aberriḥ','Slugs'=>'Iberriḥen','Small'=>'Amecṭuḥ','Small Calendar'=>'Tafada tameẓẓyant','Sold Out'=>'Yemmed','Some WordPress themes don\'t follow best practices when generating navigation menus, and so the automatic title rewriting feature may cause problems, if your menus aren\'t working correctly on the event pages, try setting this to \'Yes\', and provide an appropriate HTML title format below.'=>'Kra n yisental n WordPress ur ḍefren ara tikti ineggura mi ara snulfun imuɣen n tunigin, ihi tazmert n uɛiwed n uzwel awurman tezmer ad d-tesnulfu uguren, ma yella imuɣen-ik ur xeddmen ara akken ilaq deg yisebtar n tidyanin, ɛreḍ ad tesbaḍeḍ \'Ih\', yerna fk amasal n uzwel HTML yemṣada ddaw.','Something went wrong saving your %s to the index table. Please inform a site administrator about this.'=>'Yella wayen ur nteddu ara deg usekles n %s-ik ɣer tfelwit n umatar. Ttxil mel-it i unedbal n usmel.','Something went wrong with the recurrence update...'=>'Yella wayen ur nteddu ara deg uleqqem n ualugen...','Sorting'=>'Asmizwer','Sorting Order'=>'Asmizwer n usmizwer','Spaces'=>'Idagen','Spaces confirmed'=>'Idagen yettusentmen','Split by timeslots?'=>'Ferrek s tzemmar n wakud?','Spreadsheet'=>'Imbellez','Stack By'=>'Segmi s','Stacked metaboxes'=>'Tmeṭṭiwin yettwarsen','Standard'=>'Lexṣas','Standard Ticket'=>'Tikit Lexṣas','Start'=>'Bdu','Start Date'=>'Azemz n tazwara','Start Time'=>'Akud n tazwara','Start comparison date'=>'Azemz n usenna n usmifer','Start date'=>'Azemz n tazwara','Start import'=>'Bdu asekcem','Start migration'=>'Bdu aneqqel','Start time'=>'Akud n tazwara','Start time is required.'=>'Akud n tazwara ilaq.','Start/End'=>'Tazwara/Taggara','Started'=>'Yebda','State'=>'Tawilayt','State or province'=>'Tawilayt neɣ taɣiwant','State/County'=>'Tamnaḍt/Tamurt','State/County:'=>'Tamurt/Tamnaḍt:','Statistic Averages/Totals'=>'Imesṭaḍen/Asemday n tugna','Status'=>'Addad','Status reason'=>'Ssebba n waddad','Status: %s'=>'Addad: %s','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager by subscribing to our newsletter!'=>'Ṭṭef ɣer yimeẓla imaynuten, tisemmadin d tiknayin ɣef Events Manager s ujerred ɣer unaẓrag-nneɣ!','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager!'=>'Ṭṭef ɣer yimeẓla imaynuten, tisemmadin d tiknayin ɣef Events Manager!','Step 1 button'=>'Taqeffalt n ukraḍ 1','Stopped on an error'=>'Yeḥbes ɣef tuccḍa','Styling Options'=>'Textiṛiyin n uɣanib','Sub Total'=>'Amatu aneggaru','Submit %s'=>'Azen %s','Submit Booking'=>'Azen tuṭṭfa','Submit Changes'=>'Azen ibeddilen','Submit button text'=>'Aḍris n tqeffalt n tuzna','Submit button text (payment)'=>'Aḍris n tqeffalt n tuzna (asewweṛ)','Submit button text (processing)'=>'Aḍris n tqeffalt n tuzna (aseddu)','Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'Tadyant yettwazen tettṛaju taqbalt','Subscribe'=>'Jerred','Subscribe Now'=>'Jerred tura','Subscribe to Our Newsletter'=>'Jerred ɣer unaẓrag-nneɣ','Subscribe to our newsletter to receive exclusive content, early access to new features, and helpful event management tips directly to your inbox.'=>'Jerred ɣer unaẓrag-nneɣ akken ad d-teṭṭfeḍ agbur uslig, anekcum uzwir ɣer yimeẓla imaynuten akked tisemmadin n usefrek n tedyanin ɣer tbewwaḍt-ik.','Subsite Archetype Mode'=>'Askar n Archetype n yismal imaynuten','Subsites choose from network list'=>'Ismal imaynuten ad fren seg wumuɣ n uẓeṭṭa','Subtotals will exclude taxes and display taxes separately.'=>'Igzulen ad ffren iserreḥen u ad skanen iserreḥen s tama.','Success Message'=>'Izen n tmerna yekfan','Successful booking'=>'Tuṭṭfa i yedda','Successful pending booking'=>'Tuṭṭfa yettṛajun i yedda','Successfully Updated Message'=>'Izen n uleqqem yedda','Successfully deleted all timeranges.'=>'Tinzagin n wakud meṛṛa ttwakksent akken iwata.','Successfully saved %d timeranges.'=>'Yettwasklas %d n tnezgin n wakud akken iwata.','Successfully saved %s'=>'%s yettwasklas akken iwata','Successfully updated %s'=>'%s yettwaleqqem akken iwata','Super Advanced Mode'=>'Askar anaẓi aṭas','Surcharges (After Taxes)'=>'Tizrigin tuftin (ticki iserreḥ)','Surcharges Before Taxes'=>'Tizrigin tuftin send iserreḥ','Tabbed metaboxes'=>'Iccaren n tmeṭṭiwin','Tag'=>'Tabzimt','Tag Related Placeholders'=>'Isemlen n wadig yemṣadan d tabzimt','Tag pages'=>'Isebtar n tebzimt','Tags'=>'Tibzimin','Tags dropdown label'=>'Tabzimt n tebdart n tibzimin i d-yeccuren','Tags list page'=>'Asebter n tebdart n tibzimin','Take bookings and payments on your own site, through your own payment gateway account, with no commission taken.'=>'Ṭṭef tuṭṭfiwin d yixellaṣen deg usmel-ik, s umiḍan-ik n tbaburt n uxellaṣ, war tagarit.','Tax'=>'Aserreḥ','Tax Rate'=>'Afeṛṛun n userreḥ','Taxes'=>'Iserraḥen','Taxes included'=>'Aserreḥ yettwabdar','Taxonomy not found.'=>'Tamessartut ur tettwaf ara.','Term could not be deleted.'=>'Awal ur yettwakkes ara.','Term name is required.'=>'Isem n wawal yettwaḥewweǧ.','Term not found.'=>'Awal ur yettwaf ara.','Test Email Settings'=>'Sekyed iɣewwaren n yimayl','Text shown in place of the link until then'=>'Aḍris yettwaskan deg wadeg n useɣwen alamma d lweqt-nni','Text with link to calendar day page with all events for that day if there are more events than the limit above, leave blank for no link as the day number is also a link.'=>'Aḍris s useɣwen ɣer usebter n wass n tfada s meṛṛa tidyanin n wass-a ma yella llant ugar n tidyanin n talast n nnig, eǧǧ-it ilem ma ur tebɣiḍ ara aseɣwen imi uṭṭun n wass d aseɣwen daɣen.','That is not a CSV file. In your spreadsheet program, save or export the sheet as CSV first.'=>'Wagi mačči d afaylu CSV. Deg wahil-ik n imbellez, sekles neɣ sifeḍ tecrit am CSV send.','That was tried a moment ago. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'Ittwaɛreḍ yakan. Ṛǧu tasdidt u ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen.','The %s account that hosts this event is no longer connected. Reconnect it or choose another account for the event.'=>'Amiḍan %s i yuddsen tadyant-a ur yeqqen ara akka tura. Qqen-it tikkelt-nniḍen neɣ fren amiḍan nniḍen i tedyant.','The Events Calendar is still active. It doesn\'t need to be: Events Manager reads its data directly, so you can deactivate it and its add-ons first. Once migrated, Events Manager uses the same web addresses, so the two plugins compete for them until The Events Calendar is deactivated. Your Events Calendar data is not changed either way.'=>'The Events Calendar mazal yermed. Ur d-yettusra ara: Events Manager yeɣṛa isefka-ines srid, ihi tzemreḍ ad tsenseḍ it d isnernan-is send. Mbaɛd aneqqel, Events Manager yesqedcen tansiwin web-nni kan, ihi izegrar-agi sin ad ttemcabin fell-asent alamma tettwasens The Events Calendar. Isefka n Events Calendar ur ttwabeddalen ara akken i ak-yehwa.','The SMTP host. Usually it corresponds to \'localhost\'. If you use Gmail, set this value to \'tls://smtp.gmail.com:587\'.'=>'Asneftaya SMTP. S wudem amatu yemṣada d \'localhost\'. Ma tesseqdaceḍ Gmail, rnu azal-agi \'tls://smtp.gmail.com:587\'.','The add-on list can be refreshed once a day. Please try again tomorrow.'=>'Tabdart n yisnernan tezmer ad tettwasmiren yiwet n tikkelt deg wass. Ttxil-k ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen azekka.','The advanced search can be styled in a section-based format, with expandable sections, or directly inline with static headings. If you want headings for some sections and not others, choose Headings and leave specific section heading labels blank in settings further down.'=>'Unadi anaẓi izmer ad yettwasagen s umasal i d-yesɛan tigezmiwin, s tigezmiwin ara d-yettwasfejjen, neɣ s wudem uslig s yizwal iqqimen. Ma tebɣiḍ izwal i kra n tigezmiwin u ur tebɣiḍ ara i tid-nniḍen, fren Inixfan u eǧǧ tibzimin n yizwal n tegzemt ilmen deg yiɣewwaren ddaw.','The bundled OAuth library is not loaded, so the AI / MCP setup screen is unavailable.'=>'Tamkarḍit OAuth yettwasnernen ur tettwasali ara, ihi agdil n usbadu n AI / MCP ur yewjid ara.','The calendar headings uses abbreviated weekdays'=>'Izwal n tfada seqdacen ussan n tlalit yettwamecṭuḥen','The country'=>'Tamurt','The country "%s" is not recognized and was left empty.'=>'Tamurt "%s" ur tettwasen ara u tettwaǧǧa d ilem.','The date "%s" in the list of dates is not understood.'=>'Azemz "%s" deg tebdart n yizemzen ur yettwaɛqel ara.','The day of the month "%s" is not understood. Use 1 to 31, or last.'=>'Ass n wayyur "%s" ur yettwaɛqel ara. Seqdec 1 ɣer 31, neɣ last.','The default minimum width, in pixels, that each grid item can shrink to fit on one line.'=>'Tehri taserdasant tamezwert, s ipiksilen, ara izemren yal aferdis n yiẓiki ad d-yetṭef akken ad yeḍfer deg yiwen n yizirig.','The default value is blank so that the booking submission button appears just below the %s section.'=>'Azal amezwer d ilem akken tqeffalt n tuzna n tuṭṭfa ad d-tban ddaw tegzimt n %s.','The description of the event that will appear in the calendar.'=>'Aglam n tedyant ara d-yettbanen deg tfada.','The email "%s" is not an email address and was left out.'=>'Imayl "%s" mačči d tansa n yimayl u yettwazgel.','The end date "%s" is not understood.'=>'Azemz n taggara "%s" ur yettwaɛqel ara.','The end is before the start.'=>'Taggara d send tazwara.','The end time "%s" is not understood.'=>'Akud n taggara "%s" ur yettwaɛqel ara.','The event name. Example: Birthday party'=>'Isem n tedyant. Amedya: Tameɣra n usnulfu','The featured image was left out: %s'=>'Tugna tafellayt tettwazgel: %s','The file content does not match its file extension.'=>'Agbur n ufaylu ur yemṣada ara d usiɣzef-is.','The file could not be read.'=>'Afaylu ur yezmir ara ad yettwaɣer.','The file did not upload. Choose a CSV file and try again.'=>'Afaylu ur yettwazen ara. Fren afaylu CSV u ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen.','The file does not appear to be a valid Microsoft Office document.'=>'Afaylu-agi ur d-yettban ara d isemli Microsoft Office ameɣtu.','The file does not appear to be a valid PDF.'=>'Afaylu-agi ur d-yettban ara d PDF ameɣtu.','The file has no column named "%s".'=>'Afaylu ur yesɛi ara tagejdit s yisem "%s".','The file is empty.'=>'Afaylu d ilem.','The file is too big! Maximum allowed size: '=>'Afaylu meqqer aṭas! Tiddi tafellayt yettusirgen: ','The file needs a first row of column names and at least one row below it.'=>'Afaylu yesra izirig amezwaru n yismawen n tigejdiyin d yiwen n yizirig neɣ ugar daw-s.','The first row holds the column names. On the next screen you match each column to a field and see how the first rows will import, before anything is saved. A file made for the CSV importer of The Events Calendar works as it is.'=>'Izirig amezwaru yesɛa ismawen n tigejdiyin. Deg ugdil i d-iteddun, tqqnem yal tagejdit ɣer uferdis, u twaliḍ amek ara kecmen izirigen imezwura, send ad yettwaskles kra. Afaylu i yettwaxdem i uskcam CSV n The Events Calendar iteddu akken yella.','The following blog timezones could not be successfully reset:'=>'Tamnaḍt tasragant n yiblugen-agi ur tezmir ara ad tettwarr ɣer wazal amezwaru:','The following booking is %s :'=>'Tuṭṭfa-agi d %s :','The following options will re-enable this behaviour. If you notice escaped content (raw HTML) displayed on your site, you can enable these temporarily whilst you fix the underlying issue.'=>'Tixtiṛiyin-agi ad rnent ales tikli-agi. Ma twalaḍ agbur yettwaqqnen (HTML ameslay) yettwaskan deg usmel-ik, tzemreḍ ad tent-termdeḍ s wudem aneggaru lawan ara tesseɣtiḍ ugur iɣef yebna.','The format of a single %s in a list.'=>'Amasal n yiwen n %s deg tebdart.','The format of a single %s page title.'=>'Amasal n uzwel n usebter n %s asuf.','The format of a single %s page.'=>'Amasal n usebter n %s yiwen.','The format of a single category page title.'=>'Amasal n uzwel n usebter n taggayt yiwen.','The format of a single tag page title.'=>'Amasal n uzwel n usebter n tebzimt yiwen.','The format of any events in a list.'=>'Amasal n yal tadyant deg tebdart.','The format of each event when displayed in the full calendar.'=>'Amasal n yal tadyant mi ara d-tettwaskan deg tfada ummid.','The format of the description of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'Amasal n usnummel n yal aferdis deg usuddem RSS n tidyanin.','The format of the events the list inserted in the category page through the %s element.'=>'Amasal n tidyanin n tebdart i yettwaγran deg usebter n taggayt s uferdis %s.','The format of the events the list inserted in the location page through the %s element.'=>'Amasal n tidyanin n tebdart i yettwaγran deg usebter n yidrar s uferdis %s.','The format of the events the list inserted in the tag page through the <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> element.'=>'Amasal n tidyanin n tebdart i yettwaγran deg usebter n tebzimt s uferdis <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> d <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code>.','The format of the month/year header of the calendar.'=>'Amasal n uqeṛṛu n wayyur/n useggas n tfada.','The format of the next upcoming event in this %s.'=>'Amasal n tedyant i d-iteddun deg %s-a.','The format of the text appearing in the balloon describing the location.'=>'Amasal n uḍris i d-yettbanen deg tfeṭṭit i d-isnummel adrar.','The format of the title of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'Amasal n uzwel n yal aferdis deg usuddem RSS n tidyanin.','The format used to display %s content on single pages or elsewhere on your site.'=>'Amasal yettwaseqdacen i uskan n ugbur n %s ɣef yisebtar isufen neɣ deg wudem-nniḍen deg usmel-ik.','The image is too big! Maximum allowed dimensions: '=>'Tugna meqqer aṭas! Tisekta ineggura i yettwasirgen: ','The image is too small! Minimum allowed dimensions: '=>'Tugna meẓẓi aṭas! Tisekta tiddatin timecṭuḥin i yettwasirgen: ','The image uploaded successfully but was not set as a featured image: %s The attachment ID is in this response — pass it to update-event/update-location `featured_image` once the target is editable.'=>'Tugna tuli s lǧehd maca ur tettwasbadu ara d tugna tameẓlit: %s ID n useɣwen yella deg tririt-a, fk-it i `featured_image` n update-event/update-location ticki aniccan yezmer ad yettwaẓreg.','The input field is an example of our phone number input field. Play with the settings below and the it will update automatically to show you a preview.'=>'Urti n unekcum-a d amedya n urti n uṭṭun n tilifun-nneɣ. Qqel s yiɣewwaren n ddaw, ad yettwaleqqem s wudem awurman i wakken ad ak-d-yesken tamuɣli.','The language used to make this booking was %s'=>'Tutlayt i d-yettwaseqdec i tuṭṭfa-agi d %s','The largest share of an event\'s spaces, as a percentage, that all visitors\' holds together can take at once, so nobody can hold a whole event. Once it is reached, visitors can still book the remaining spaces but they are not held for them. Enter 100 for no limit.'=>'Aṭas n yidagen n tedyant, s tmeẓri, i izemren ad ṭṭfen akk imsuɣal ɣef tikkelt, akken ur yezmir ula d yiwen ad yeḥbes tadyant meṛṛa. Mi ara yewweḍ, imsuɣal zemren ad ṭṭfen idagen i d-yeqqimen maca ur ttwaḥebsen ara fell-asen. Sekcem 100 ma tebɣiḍ ulac talast.','The last date the event can fall on.'=>'Azemz aneggaru anda tezmer ad d-tedwel tadyant.','The latitude and longitude are not a pair of coordinates and were left out.'=>'Latitud d longitud mačči d tayuga n imsegdalen u ttwazgalen.','The link will be shown %s minutes before the event starts.'=>'Aseɣwen ad d-yettban %s tisdidin send ad tebdu tadyant.','The location "%1$s" could not be created: %2$s'=>'Adrar "%1$s" ur yettwarna ara: %2$s','The location "%s" was not on this site, so it was created with its name only. Add its address, or import a locations file first.'=>'Adrar "%s" ur yella ara deg usmel-a, ihi yettwarna s yisem-is kan. Rnu tansa-ines, neɣ kcem afaylu n idrar send.','The location address'=>'Tansa n udrar','The location information that will appear in the calendar.'=>'Talɣut n wadig ara d-yettbanen deg tfada.','The location town'=>'Tamdint n udrar','The main description of your RSS events feed.'=>'Asnummel agejdan n usuddem RSS n tidyanin-ik.','The main title of your RSS events feed.'=>'Azwel agejdan n usuddem RSS n tidyanin-ik.','The maximum allowed size for images uploaded, in bytes'=>'Tiddi tafellayt yettusirgen i tugniwin yettwasalayen, s ibayten','The maximum height an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Teɣzi tafellayt i izemren ad tesɛu tugna yettwasalayen. Tugniwin timeqranin ad ttwagent. Eǧǧ-it d ilem akken ad tsirgeḍ yal tiddi.','The maximum number of files a user can upload at once. Leave blank for unlimited.'=>'Amḍan afellay n yifuyla i izemren useqdac ad yesali ɣef yiwet n tikkelt. Eǧǧ-it d ilem i war talast.','The maximum size in bytes per uploaded file.'=>'Tiddi tafellayt s ibayten i yal afaylu yettwasalayen.','The maximum width an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Tehri tafellayt i izemren ad tesɛu tugna yettwasalayen. Tugniwin timeqranin ad ttwagent. Eǧǧ-it d ilem akken ad tsirgeḍ yal tiddi.','The message displayed when no %s are available.'=>'Izen ara d-yettwaskanen mi ara ilin ulac %s yellan.','The message displayed when no events are available.'=>'Izen ara d-yettwaskanen mi ara ilin ulac tidyanin yellan.','The message to be displayed in the list generated by %s when no events are available.'=>'Izen ara d-yettwaskanen deg tebdart i d-yettwarna s %s mi ara ulac tidyanin.','The message to be displayed in the list generated by <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> when no events are available.'=>'Izen ara d-yettwaskanen deg tebdart i d-yettwarna s <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> d <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> mi ara ulac tidyanin.','The minimum height an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Teɣzi tadbut i izemren ad tesɛu tugna yettwasalayen. Tugniwin timecṭuḥin ad ttwagent. Eǧǧ-it d ilem akken ad tsirgeḍ yal tiddi.','The minimum width an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Tehri tadbut i izemren ad tesɛu tugna yettwasalayen. Tugniwin timecṭuḥin ad ttwagent. Eǧǧ-it d ilem akken ad tsirgeḍ yal tiddi.','The name is empty.'=>'Isem d ilem.','The name of the location'=>'Isem n udrar','The number of times to repeat, "%s", is not a whole number of 1 or more.'=>'Amḍan n tikkal n tɛiwdt, "%s", mačči d amḍan ummid n 1 neɣ ugar.','The numerical units shown to those searching by distance. Use comma-separated numbers, such as "25,50,100".'=>'Iferdisen n wuṭṭunen i d-yettwaskanen i wid i ixeddmen anadi s tanekra. Seqdec uṭṭunen yettwabeṛṛen s tfeṛṛadin, am "25,50,100".','The option below allows you to disable user accounts, yet you will still see the supplied personal information for each booking.'=>'Afran ukessar ad ak-yeǧǧ ad tsenseḍ ikaunten n yiseqdacen, maca ad twaliḍ talɣut tudmawant i yettwafkan i yal tuṭṭfa.','The options below are applied to the %s placeholders.'=>'Tixtiṛiyin n ddaw ttwaseqdacent ɣef yismilen n wadig %s.','The page containing the %s shortcode. Create a page with that shortcode and select it here.'=>'Asebter yesɛan anegzum %s. Snulfu asebter s unegzum-nni u fren-it dagi.','The port through which you e-mail notifications will be sent. Make sure the firewall doesn\'t block this port'=>'Tawwurt anda ara ttwaznen tilɣa-ik n yimayl. Ɛass ur tettwagdel ara tawwurt-agi sɣur ugdal n tmes','The provider rate limit was reached, so this will be retried shortly.'=>'Talast n usuter n usmersu tewweḍ, ihi ad yettɛawad qrib.','The repeat rule and the extra dates were combined into a list of %d dates.'=>'Alugen n tɛiwdt d yizemzen yernan ttwasdukklen d tebdart n %d n yizemzen.','The repeat rule gives more than %d dates.'=>'Alugen n tɛiwdt yettak ugar n %d n yizemzen.','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date, so the event has no dates yet.'=>'Alugen n tɛiwdt ur d-yettak ara izemzen gar uzemz n tazwara d wazemz n tɛiwdt, ihi tadyant ur tesɛi ara izemzen akka tura.','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date.'=>'Alugen n tɛiwdt ur d-yettak ara izemzen gar uzemz n tazwara d wazemz n tɛiwdt.','The repeat-until date "%s" is not understood.'=>'Azemz n tɛiwdt "%s" ur yettwaɛqel ara.','The repeat-until date is before the start date.'=>'Azemz n tɛiwdt d send azemz n tazwara.','The repeating event has been converted into a recurring event.'=>'Tadyant i d-yettuɣalen tettwabeddel ɣer tedyant i d-yettuɣalen.','The repeating events have been converted into recurring events.'=>'Tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen ttwabeddlent ɣer tidyanin i d-yettuɣalen.','The right-of-withdrawal feature is currently disabled in Events Manager settings.'=>'Tamahilt n yizref n usuɣal ɣer deffir tensa tura deg yiɣewwaren n Events Manager.','The selected country code will also show the dialcode, such as +1 for the US.'=>'Tangalt n tmurt yettwafernen ad d-teskan daɣen tangalt n usiwel, am +1 i USA.','The selected country will be chosen by default if auto-detect is disabled, additionally any numbers submitted whilst Phone Numbers were disabled will be considered as belonging to this country and reformatted accordingly when used for communication or display purposes.'=>'Tamurt yettwafernen ad tettwafren s wudem amezwer ma yella usnirem awurman yensa, yerna uṭṭunen yettwazen mi ara yensa Uṭṭunen n tilifun ad ttwaḥsben d wid n tmurt-a yerna ad ttwasmelsen s wudem i wakken ad ttwasqedcen i unermes neɣ askan.','The setting above is new, due to our new calendar display options. Your previous format was %s'=>'Aɣewwar nnig d amaynut, imi ihi tixtiṛiyin-nneɣ timaynutin n uskan n tfada. Amasal-ik n zik yella d %s','The settings below are used when using the %s placeholder'=>'Iɣewwaren n ddaw ttwasqedcen mi ara tesqedceḍ asmel n wadig %s','The start date "%s" is not understood.'=>'Azemz n tazwara "%s" ur yettwaɛqel ara.','The start date is empty.'=>'Azemz n tazwara d ilem.','The start time "%s" is not understood.'=>'Akud n tazwara "%s" ur yettwaɛqel ara.','The statutory cooling-off period is 14 days. Late submissions are still accepted and flagged for your review rather than silently rejected.'=>'Tanzagt taḍrisant n tuɣalin d 14 n wussan. Tuzna ara d-yernun s uneggaru mazal ttwaqbalent u ttwacudden i usenqed-ik, ur ttwagent ara s wudem uffir.','The text shown when a booking is being submitted, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'Aḍris i d-yettwaskan mi ara tettwazen tuṭṭfa, %s ad yettwasmelsi s umatu n ulaq.','The text shown when a booking is not free, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'Aḍris i d-yettwaskan mi ara tili tuṭṭfa ur telli ara d tilelli, %s ad yettwasmelsi s umatu n ulaq.','The text used by the submit button. To use an image instead, enter the full url starting with %s or %s.'=>'Aḍris i yettwaseqdec seg tqeffalt n tuzna. I useqdec n tugna deg wadeg-is, sekcem URL ummid ibdan s %s neɣ %s.','The ticket %s is no longer available.'=>'Tikit %s ur tewjid ara ugar.','The time zone "%s" is not recognized. Use a name such as America/New_York or an offset such as UTC+2.'=>'Tamnaḍt n wakud "%s" ur tettwasen ara. Seqdec isem am America/New_York neɣ afrag am UTC+2.','The tip text that is shown for the advanced search trigger.'=>'Aḍris n tallelt i d-yettwaskanen i tarmit n unadi anaẓi.','The title that will appear in the calendar.'=>'Azwel ara d-yettbanen deg tfada.','The unique name (singular) used to identify %s in the database. Use lowercase alphanumeric characters, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Isem asuf asuf i yettwaseqdec i usesfer n %s deg uzadur n isefka. Seqdec kan isekkilen yettwabdaren, imḍanen, ijerriden akked yijerriden n ukessar.','The uploaded file is no longer on the server. Upload it again.'=>'Afaylu yettwasalayen ulac-it ɣer uqeddac. Sali-t tikkelt-nniḍen.','The uploads folder is not writable.'=>'Akaram n yifuyla yettwaznen ur yezmir ara ad yettwaru deg-s.','The virtual location for this event is not ready yet. Please try again shortly.'=>'Adrar virtuel n tedyant-a ur yewjid ara akka tura. Ttxil-k ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen qrib.','The website "%s" is not a web address and was left out.'=>'Asmel "%s" mačči d tansa web u yettwazgel.','The week of the month "%s" is not understood. Use first, second, third, fourth or last.'=>'Dduṛt n wayyur "%s" ur tettwaɛqel ara. Seqdec first, second, third, fourth neɣ last.','The weekday "%s" is not understood.'=>'Ass n dduṛt "%s" ur yettwaɛqel ara.','Theme Templates'=>'Tineɣrufin n usentel','There are not enough physical spaces left for this booking.'=>'Ulac idagen ifizikiyen i d-yeqqimen i tuṭṭfa-a.','There are not enough virtual spaces left for this booking.'=>'Ulac idagen virtuel i d-yeqqimen i tuṭṭfa-a.','There is a newer version of Events Manager Pro which is recommended for this current version of Events Manager as new features have been added. Please go to the plugin website and download the latest update.'=>'Llan lqem amaynut n Events Manager Pro i yettusumren i lqem-agi n Events Manager acku timeẓluyin timaynutin ttwarnant. Ddu ɣer usmel n usiɣzef u sader aleqqem aneggaru.','There was a problem adding custom fields to your recurring events.'=>'Yella wugur deg tmerna n yurtiyen yugnen i tedyanin-ik i d-yettuɣalen.','There was a problem adding tickets to your recurrences.'=>'Yella wugur deg tmerna n tikitin i yialugen-ik.','There was a problem creating a user account, please contact a website administrator.'=>'Tella tuccḍa deg timerna n umiḍan n useqdac, nermes anedbal n usmel.','There was a problem deleting bookings for the event.'=>'Yella wugur deg tukksa n tuṭṭfiwin n tedyant.','There was a problem deleting the timerange.'=>'Yella wugur deg tukksa n tenzagt n wakud.','There was a problem saving the booking.'=>'Tella tuccḍa deg usekles n tuṭṭfa.','There was a problem saving the event timeslots to the database. Please contact an administrator if the issue persists.'=>'Yella wugur deg usekles n yikudan n tedyant ɣer uzadur n isefka. Ttxil nermes anedbal ma yella wugur yettkemmil.','There was a problem saving the recurring events.'=>'Yella wugur deg usekles n tedyanin i d-yettuɣalen.','There was a problem saving the ticket booking.'=>'Yella wugur deg usekles n tuṭṭfa n tikit.','There was a problem saving the ticket.'=>'Yella wugur deg usekles n tikit.','There was a problem saving the timerange.'=>'Yella wugur deg usekles n tenzagt n wakud.','There was a problem updating tickets to your recurrences.'=>'Yella wugur deg uleqqem n tikitin n yialugen-ik.','There was an error connecting to %s: %s'=>'Teḍra-d tuccḍa deg uqqen ɣer %s: %s','There was an error upgrading your site, please try again or contact support.'=>'Tella tuccḍa deg uleqqem n usmel-ik, ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen neɣ nermes tallelt.','There was an error uploading the image.'=>'Tella tuccḍa deg usali n tugna.','There was an error whilst migrating your times to our new timezone-aware formats. Below is a list of errors:'=>'Tella tuccḍa deg tmigration n yakuden-ik ɣer imasal-nneɣ n tmennaḍt tasragant. Ha-t-an wuguren:','There were some errors saving your location.'=>'Llant kra n tuccḍiwin deg usekles n udrar-ik.','There were some issues whilst disconnecting from your %s account(s) :'=>'Llant kra n wuguren deg tuffɣa seg umiḍan(en) %s-ik :','These can be overridden when using shortcode or template tags.'=>'Tixtiṛiyin-a zemrent ad ttwasemgirdent mi ara tesqedceḍ anegzum neɣ tibzimin n tneɣruft.','These countries will be excluded from the country selection list.'=>'Timura-a ad ttwakkesent seg tebdart n ufran n tmura.','These formats can be used on %s pages or on other areas of your site displaying an %s.'=>'Imusal-a zemren ad ttwaseqdacen ɣef yisebtar n %s neɣ deg yiḥricen-nniḍen n usmel-ik ara d-yeskanen %s.','These formats can be used when WordPress automatically displays %s excerpts on your site and %s is enabled in your %s settings tab.'=>'Imusal-a zemren ad ttwaseqdacen mi ara d-yeskan WordPress s wudem awurman tussiften n %s deg usmel-ik u %s yermed deg yiccer n yiɣewwaren n %s.','These formats will be used on your events page. This will also be used if you do not provide specified formats in other event lists, like in shortcodes.'=>'Imusal-a ad ttwaseqdacen deg usebter n tidyanin-ik. Ad ttwaseqdacen daɣen ma yella ur d-teǧǧiḍ ara imusal yettwabdeen deg tebdarin-nniḍen n tidyanin, am deg yinegzumen.','These headings appear above sections of the booking form. Leave blank for no heading.'=>'Izwal-a ad d-banen nnig tgezmiyin n tserkant n tuṭṭfa. Eǧǧ-it d ilem ma ur tebɣiḍ ara azwel.','These options are the defaults applied to lists being showing in Grouped List view mode and can be overriden in individual lists using shortcodes, blocks, widgets etc.'=>'Textiṛiyin-a d wid yettwasnen s wudem amezwer i tebdarin ara d-ibanen deg uskar n tmuɣli n tebdart yettwagrawen u zemrent ad ttwabeddlent deg tebdarin yemgaraden s yinegzumen, iḥedran, iwiǧiten atg.','These options have security implications and are intended for transition! For more information, please see our %s.'=>'Tixtiṛiyin-agi sɛant imsebrid n taɣellist u d tid n usenfali! I ugar n telɣut, ma ulac aɣilif wali %s-nneɣ.','These pages allow you to provide an event management interface outside the admin area on whatever page you want on your website. Bear in mind that this is overridden by BuddyPress if activated.'=>'Isebtar-a ak-d-fken ad tesbeddeḍ agrudem n usefrek n tidyanin berra n tallunt n usefrek, deg yal asebter i tebɣiḍ deg usmel-ik. Cukk ɣer wayen yettwasemselsi s BuddyPress ma yella yermed.','These spaces cannot be held for you right now, but you can still book them while they are available.'=>'Idagen-a ur zmiren ara ad ttwaḥebsen fell-ak akka tura, maca tzemreḍ ad ten-tṭṭfeḍ ticki ttwajerrden.','This %s has timeslots, you are viewing'=>'%s-agi yesɛa tazmilin n wakud, tettwaliḍ','This %s was submitted by a guest. You will find their details in the <em>Anonymous Submitter Info</em> box'=>'%s-a yettwazen sɣur anebgi. Ad tafeḍ ifatusen-is deg tnaka n <em>Talɣut n umazan warisem</em>','This CPT name is already used by an existing WordPress post type. Please choose another name.'=>'Isem CPT-a yettwaseqdec yakan sɣur anaw n yimagraden n WordPress yellan. Ma ulac aɣilif fren isem nniḍen.','This Month'=>'Aggur-agi','This Year'=>'Aseggas-agi','This accepts %s and %s placeholders.'=>'Aya yeqbel isemlen n wadig %s d %s.','This accepts %s placeholders.'=>'Aya yeqbel isemlen n wadig %s.','This accepts %s, %s and %s placeholders.'=>'Aya yeqbel isemlen n wadig %s, %s d %s.','This action aill be applied to every attendee belonging to the selected %s. Do you want to continue?'=>'Tigawt-a ad tettwasebded ɣef yal amttekki i yellan %s yettwafernen. Tebɣiḍ ad tkemmleḍ?','This action will be applied to the entire booking the %s belongs to. Do you want to continue?'=>'Tigawt-a ad tettwasebded ɣef tuṭṭfa meṛṛa i yellan %s. Tebɣiḍ ad tkemmleḍ?','This action will be applied to the entire booking the selected %s belong to. Do you want to continue?'=>'Tigawt-a ad tettwasebded ɣef tuṭṭfa meṛṛa i yellan %s yettwafernen. Tebɣiḍ ad tkemmleḍ?','This booking form has expired, please reload the page and try again.'=>'Tamserkant n tuṭṭfa-agi tevda, ales asali n usebter ɣer tikkelt-nniḍen.','This booking has already been submitted, please check your email for its confirmation.'=>'Tuṭṭfa-a tettwazen yakan, ttxil wali imayl-ik i usentem-is.','This booking has already been submitted.'=>'Tuṭṭfa-agi tettwazen yakan.','This button text would be shown for a free booking'=>'Aḍris n tqeffalt-a ad d-yettwaskan i tuṭṭfa ilelli','This cannot be undone.'=>'Ur tezmir ara ad tettwasefsex.','This confirms receipt of your declaration only. We will review it and contact you regarding any refund due.'=>'Ayen-a yessentem kan anekcum n tezmilt-ik. Ad nɛiwed tamuɣli-s u ad nnermes yidem-ik ɣef kra n usuɣal n tedrimt yellan.','This content will appear just above your code for the %s list format below. Default is blank'=>'Agbur-a ad d-yettban kan nnig tengalt-ik n umasal n tebdart n %s ddaw. Amezwer yella d ilem','This content will appear just above your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'Agbur-a ad d-yettban kan nnig tengalt-ik n umasal amezwer n tebdart n tidyanin. Amezwer yella d ilem','This content will appear just below your code for the %s list format above. Default is blank'=>'Agbur-a ad d-yettban kan ddaw tengalt-ik n umasal n tebdart n %s nnig. Amezwer yella d ilem','This content will appear just below your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'Agbur-a ad d-yettban kan ddaw tengalt-ik n umasal amezwer n tebdart n tidyanin. Amezwer yella d ilem','This disables user registrations for bookings.'=>'Aya yessens asekles n yiseqdacen i tuṭṭfiwin.','This email already exists in our system, please log in to register to proceed with your booking.'=>'Imayl-agi yella yakan deg unagraw-nneɣ, qqen akken ad tkemmleḍ tuṭṭfa-inek.','This event has been cancelled.'=>'Tadyant-agi tettwaḥbes.','This event has ended and can no longer be joined.'=>'Tadyant-a tekfa u ur tezmir ara ad tettwaddu s wudem.','This event has no virtual location to join.'=>'Tadyant-a ur tesɛi ara adrar virtuel ara ddun.','This event has validation errors and cannot be published until they are fixed:'=>'Tadyant-a tesɛa tuccḍiwin n usentem u ur tezmir ara ad d-teffeɣ alamma ttwasefsent:','This event is fully booked.'=>'Tadyant-agi tummel.','This event is not available or has been cancelled'=>'Tadyant-a ur tewjid ara neɣ tettwafsex','This event is not available or has been cancelled.'=>'Tadyant-agi ur tewjid ara neɣ tettwaḥbes.','This event is not open for joining yet.'=>'Tadyant-a ur teldi ara i uttekki akka tura.','This event spans every day between the beginning and end date, with start/end times applying to each day.'=>'Tadyant-agi ad tekcem ass kan gar yizemzen n tazwara d taggara, akud n tazwara/taggara ad yettwasemres i yal ass.','This file holds'=>'Afaylu-a yesɛa','This is a %s event.'=>'Ta d tadyant %s.','This is a %s recurrence of %s.'=>'Wagi d alugen %s n %s.','This is a recurring %s. You can find all %s on this page, or click on individual %s to view recurrence-specific bookings.'=>'Wagi d %s i d-yettuɣalen. Tzemreḍ ad tafeḍ akk %s deg usebter-agi, neɣ ssed ɣef yal yiwen n %s akken ad twaliḍ tuṭṭfiwin yemṣadan d lalugen.','This is a translated event, therefore your time, location and booking information is handled by your original event translation.'=>'Tadyant-agi tettwasuqqel, ihi akud, adrar d talɣut n tuṭṭfa-inek ttwaḥeṛen s usuqqel aneṣli n tedyant.','This is a translated location, so address information is handled by your original location translation. You can provide translations for certain fields which will override the original translation.'=>'Adrar-agi yettwasuqqel, ihi talɣut n tansa tettwaḥeṛ s usuqqel aneṣli n wadrar. Tzemreḍ ad d-tefkeḍ tisuqqilin i kra n wuguren ara yeffren asuqqel aneṣli.','This is also the default setting for responsive calendars without a fixed size.'=>'Wagi daɣen d aɣewwar amezwer i tfadiwin yettwafrurzen war tiddi yebdden.','This is for advanced users, you should know what you\'re doing here or things will not work properly. For more information on how these options work see our <a href="%s" target="_blank">optimization recommendations</a>'=>'Ayagi i yiseqdacen n anaẓi, ilaq ad tezwareḍ ayen txeddmeḍ da neɣ ur teddu ara akken ilaq. I wugar n telɣut ɣef wamek ara ddun textiṛiyin-a, wali <a href="%s" target="_blank">tinfaliyin-nneɣ n usnerni</a>','This is not a required step to enable any extra functionality, and therefore is not urgent. Only until you are happy with the upgrade and are confident you don\'t need to downgrade, finalize your upgrade by deleting and discontinuing these fields.'=>'Aya mačči d tamawt tilawt i wakken ad tteddu kra n tmeẓluyin-nniḍen, daɣen ur yerr ara tuffɣa. Ala mi ara tembwal s uleqqem u tettkellxeḍ ur tḥwaǧeḍ ara ad tuɣaleḍ ɣer deffir, fak aleqqem s tukksa d usefsex n urtiyen-agi.','This is only applicable when %s is not active.'=>'Aya ixeddem kan mi ara yili %s ur yurmid ara.','This is only used when showing events from other blogs.'=>'Aya yettwaseqdac kan mi ara d-ttwaskanent tidyanin seg yiblugen-nniḍen.','This is sent when a person\'s booking is confirmed. This will be sent automatically if approvals are required and the booking is approved. If approvals are disabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'Ad yettwazen mi ara tettusentem tuṭṭfa n yiwen. Ad yettwazen s wudem awurman ma yella ilaq usentem u tuṭṭfa tettwaqbel. Ma yella usentem yensa, ad yettwazen mi ara yazen useqdac tuṭṭfa-ines i tikkelt tamezwarut.','This is sent when a person\'s booking is pending. If approvals are enabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'Ad yettwazen mi ara tegguni tuṭṭfa n yiwen. Ma yella usentem yermed, ad yettwazen mi ara yazen useqdac tuṭṭfa-ines i tikkelt tamezwarut.','This is specific to bookings made by the user, not bookings that may have been made to events they own.'=>'Aya yeqqen ɣer tuṭṭfiwin i gen useqdac kan, mačči tuṭṭfiwin i yezmer ad ttwagent i tedyanin i yesɛa.','This is the definite date after which bookings will be closed for this event, regardless of individual ticket settings above. Default value will be the event start date.'=>'D azemz imaynut ideg ara ttwamdent tuṭṭfiwin n tedyant-agi, ur yettwaḥsab ara yiɣewwaren n tikitin ufrin yellan ddaw. Azal amezwer ad yili d azemz n tazwara n tedyant.','This is your primary recurrence, other recurring %s will use these advanced settings as their default settings if left blank.'=>'Ta d alugen-ik amenzu, %s-nniḍen i d-yettuɣalen ad seqdacen iɣewwaren-agi inaẓiyen d iɣewwaren-nsen imezwura ma ur ttwafen ara.','This join link is not valid. Please use the link from your booking confirmation.'=>'Aseɣwen n uttekki-a ur yelhi ara. Ttxil-k seqdec aseɣwen seg usentem n tuṭṭfa-inek.','This link is invalid or has expired. Please request a new one.'=>'Aseɣwen-a d armeɣtu neɣ yekfa. Ttxil suter amaynut.','This month'=>'Aggur-a','This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'Aẓeṭṭa-agi yebḍa tagrumma n tfelwiyin n tedyanin d tuṭṭfiwin, ihi tukksa seg usmel-agi ad tekkes i lebda tidyanin d tuṭṭfiwin n yal asmel n uẓeṭṭa. Kkes seg %s deg ubdil.','This only setting only matters if you selected \'Yes\' to above. You will notice the events page titles aren\'t being rewritten, and you have a new title underneath the default page name. This is where you control the HTML of this title. Make sure you keep the #_PAGETITLE placeholder here, as that\'s what is rewritten by events manager. To control what\'s rewritten in this title, see settings further down for page titles.'=>'Iɣewwaren-a ttwaseqdacen kan ma tferneḍ \'Ih\' ufella. Ad twaliḍ belli izwal n yisebtar n tidyanin ur ttwaεiwden ara, yerna tesɛiḍ azwel amaynut ddaw isem amezwer n usebter. Da ara tḥekmeḍ deg HTML n uzwel-a. Ḍmen ad teǧǧeḍ asmel n wadig #_PAGETITLE da, acku d ayen i d-ittwaεiwden sɣur Events Manager. I wakken ad tḥekmeḍ deg ayen i yettwaεiwden deg uzwel-a, wali iɣewwaren ddaw i yizwal n yisebtar.','This option allows you to select the default category when adding an event.'=>'Tixtiṛt-a ad ak-teǧǧ ad tferneḍ taggayt tamezwert mi ara tarneḍ tadyant.','This option allows you to select the default location when adding an event.'=>'Tixtiṛt-a ad ak-teǧǧ ad tferneḍ adrar amezwer mi ara tarneḍ tadyant.','This option allows you to select which page to use as an events page. If you do not select an events page, to display event lists you can enable event archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'Tixtiṛt-a ad ak-teǧǧ ad tferneḍ asebter ara yettwaseqdacen d asebter n tidyanin. Ma ur tferneḍ ara asebter n tidyanin, i wakken ad d-tesekneḍ tibdarin n tidyanin tzemreḍ ad tesremdeḍ iɣbaren n tidyanin neɣ ad tesqedceḍ inegzumen d/neɣ tibzimin n tneɣruft.','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page.'=>'Tafrayt-a ad ak-teǧǧ ad tferneḍ anta asebter ara yettwasqedcen d asebter n %s.','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page. If you do not select a %s page, to display lists you can enable archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'Tixtiṛt-a ad ak-teǧǧ ad tferneḍ asebter ara yettwaseqdacen d asebter n %s. Ma ur tferneḍ ara asebter n %s, i wakken ad d-tesekneḍ tibdarin tzemreḍ ad tesremdeḍ iɣbaren neɣ ad tesqedceḍ inegzumen d/neɣ tibzimin n tneɣruft.','This options allows to display the full-sized calendar on the events page, instead of the default list.'=>'Tixtiṛt-a ad ak-teǧǧ ad d-tesekneḍ tafada s teɣzi tuɣridt deg usebter n tidyanin, deg wadeg n tebdart tamezwert.','This page corresponds to the <strong>Events Manager</strong> %s page. Its content will be overridden by Events Manager, although if you include the word CONTENTS (exactly in capitals) and surround it with other text, only CONTENTS will be overwritten. If you want to change the way your events look, go to the <a href=\'%s\'>settings</a> page. '=>'Asebter-agi yemṣada d usebter %s n <strong>Events Manager</strong>. Agbur-is ad yettusemselsi sɣur Events Manager, maca ma tkecmeḍ awal CONTENTS (s isekkilen imeqranen) tzedmeḍ-it s uḍris nniḍen, ad yettusemselsi kan CONTENTS. Ma tebɣiḍ ad tbeddleḍ amek ttbanen tedyanin-ik, ddu ɣer usebter n <a href=\'%s\'>yiɣewwaren</a>. ','This page is where people that have made bookings for an event can go and view their previous bookings.'=>'Deg usebter-a, wid yellan sɣur-sen tuṭṭfiwin i tedyant, zemren ad walin tuṭṭfiwin-nsen yezrin.','This section allows you to configure parts of this plugin that will improve performance on your site and increase page speeds by reducing extra files from being unnecessarily included on pages as well as reducing server loads where possible. This only applies to pages outside the admin area.'=>'Tigezmi-a ad ak-teǧǧ ad tseɣwreḍ tazmilt n usiɣzef-a ara yesnernin atwal ɣef usmel-ik d usenqes n tezyiwin n yisebtar s wakken ur ttwarnan ara ifuyla yettwaseqdacen war tilawt ɣer yisebtar, akked tmessisit n ujerred n uqeddac anda tella tezmert. Ayagi yettwaseqdac kan ɣef yisebtar berra n tmennaṭ n unedbal.','This setting was not changed.'=>'Aseɣwer-agi ur yettwabeddel ara.','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a fixed-size %s calendar.'=>'Aɣewwar-a ad yettwaseqdac ma tferneḍ ad d-tskeneḍ s wudem uslig tafada n %s s tiddi yebdden.','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a size %s calendar.'=>'Aɣewwar-a ad yettwaseqdac ma tferneḍ ad d-tskeneḍ s wudem uslig tafada n tiddi %s.','This setting will not apply to bookings using payment gateways, see individual gateways for approval settings.'=>'Aɣewwar-a ur ittuseqdac ara i tuṭṭfiwin yettwaseqdacen tiwwura n usewweṛ, wali tiwwura n usewweṛ yal yiwet i yiɣewwaren n uqbal.','This site is activated under a license that has expired. Deactivate it from your licenses page, then activate it again here and choose your %s license.'=>'Asmel-a yettwarmed s turagt i yekfan. Sens-it seg usebter n turagin-ik, sakin rmed-it dagi tikkelt-nniḍen u fren turagt-ik %s.','This text will be shown only if the default (free) button is not an image.'=>'Aḍris-a ad d-yettwaskan kan ma tqeffalt tamezwert (tilelli) ur d tugna ara.','This ticket is the child of a recurring event ticket. Values can be overriden for this recurrence. Blank text values will default to the parent ticket value, checkboxes like this %s will inherit parent ticket values.'=>'Tikit-agi d aqrur n tikit n tedyant i d-yettuɣalen. Azalen zemren ad ttwabeddlen i uttar-agi. Azalen n uḍris ilmen ad ṭṭfen azal n tikit tamarrawt, tinkulin am %s ad ṛzent azalen n tikit tamarrawt.','This uses a slightly different format to the others on here, for a list of characters to use, visit the <a href="%s">reference page</a>'=>'Aya yesseqdac amasal yemgaraden cwiṭ ɣef wid n da, i tebdart n yisekkilen ara tesseqdceḍ, rzu <a href="%s">asebter n uḥawal</a>','This week'=>'Dduṛt-a','This will be sent automatically when a booking is rejected. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'Ad yettwazen s wudem awurman mi ara tettwagi tuṭṭfa. Ur yelli ara yesɛa azal ma yella tuṭṭfiwin ur ttilin ara ilaq usentem.','This will be sent to event admins when a booking is rejected.'=>'Ad yettwazen i yindbalen n tedyant mi ara tettwagi tuṭṭfa.','This will be sent to the person when they first submit their booking. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'Ad yettwazen i umdan mi ara yazen tuṭṭfa-ines i tikkelt tamezwarut. Ur yelli ara yesɛa azal ma yella tuṭṭfiwin ur ttilin ara ilaq usentem.','This will be sent when a user cancels their booking.'=>'Ad yettwazen mi ara isemmet useqdac tuṭṭfa-ines.','This will be used in admin menus and other areas identifying the type of %s you are working with.'=>'Aya ad yettwaseqdec deg yumuɣen n unedbal akked tmura nniḍen ara d-yesbanen anaw n %s i tkeddiḍ.','This will control how many %s are shown on one list by default.'=>'Aya ad iqqen acḥal n %s ara d-yettwaskanen deg yiwet n tebdart s wudem amezwer.','This will control how many events are shown on one list by default.'=>'Ayagi ad iḥkem deg waṭas n tidyanin ara d-yettwaskanen deg tebdart yiwen s wudem amezwer.','This will delete all event recurrence posts/pages, and unify them into one URL. Any 404 pages resulting from these will automatically 302-redirect to the recurring event (which will be a new URL).'=>'Aya ad yekkes akk iznan/isebtar n lalugen n tedyanin, ad ten-yesdukkel ɣer URL yiwen. Yal asebter 404 i d-yettalin seg-sen ad yettwabruri s 302 ɣer tedyant i d-yettuɣalen (ara yili d URL amaynut).','Thousands Separator'=>'Anabraz n walluyen','Thumbnails'=>'Tugniwin timecṭuḥin','Ticket'=>'Tikit','Ticket %s has a higher minimum spaces requirement than the maximum spaces allowed.'=>'Tikit %s tesɛa tazmert ɣer idagen drus yugar afellay n yidagen yettwasirgen.','Ticket Capacity'=>'Tazmert n tikit','Ticket Description'=>'Asnummel n tikit','Ticket ID'=>'Id n tikit','Ticket ID.'=>'ID n tikit.','Ticket Name'=>'Isem n tikit','Ticket Name (Ascending)'=>'Isem n tkit (S walluy)','Ticket Name (Descending)'=>'Isem n tkit (S usider)','Ticket Options'=>'Tinefrunin n tikitin','Ticket Price'=>'Azal n tikit','Ticket Price (Ascending)'=>'Ssuma n tkit (S walluy)','Ticket Price (Descending)'=>'Ssuma n tkit (S usider)','Ticket Spaces'=>'Idagen n tikit','Ticket Total'=>'Amatu n tikit','Ticket Type'=>'Anaw n tikit','Ticket UUID'=>'UUID n tikit','Ticket booking created'=>'Tuṭṭfa n tikit tettwasnulfa','Ticket could not be deleted.'=>'Tikit ur tettwakkes ara.','Ticket could not be saved.'=>'Tikit ur tettwaklas ara.','Ticket created'=>'Tikit tettwasnulfa','Ticket for %s'=>'Tikit i %s','Ticket not found.'=>'Tikit ur tettwaf ara.','Tickets'=>'Tikitin','Tickets / Booking'=>'Tikitin / Tuṭṭfa','Tickets and RSVPs'=>'Tikitin d RSVPs','Tickets with bookings cannot be deleted.'=>'Tikitin yesɛan tuṭṭfiwin ur zemrent ara ad ttwakksent.','Tickets within recurrences that already have bookings WILL NOT be deleted, the ticket will be deactivated instead to prevent further bookings.'=>'Tikitin deg yialugen i yesɛan yakan tuṭṭfiwin ur ttwakksent ARA, tikit ad tettwasens deg umkan-nni i wakken ur ttwaṭṭfent ara tuṭṭfiwin-nniḍen.','Tickets within recurrences without any bookings will be deleted.'=>'Tikitin deg yialugen war tuṭṭfiwin ad ttwakksent.','Time Format'=>'Amasal n usrag','Time Separator'=>'Anabraz n wakud','Time zone'=>'Tamnaḍt n wakud','Timerange'=>'Tanzagt n wakud','Timeranges cannot overlap with each other.'=>'Tinzagin n wakud ur ilaq ara ad tkeččment gar-asent.','Times'=>'Akuden','Timeslot date format'=>'Amasal n uzemz n tallunt','Timeslot time format'=>'Amasal n wakud n tallunt','Timeslots'=>'Tallunin','Timeslots require %s and has been disabled automatically to prevent undesired results.'=>'Tallunt n wakud tesra %s yerna tensa s wudem awurman i wakken ad tinig igmaḍ ur nettwali ara.','Timezone'=>'Tamnaḍt tasragant','Title'=>'Azwel','To help with the transition, we\'re providing you with a Preview mode you can activate below, which will temporarily use our new formatting options only for you to see (other site visitors will see your site as usual). If you\'re happy with the changes, you can switch over completely, or revert individual formats within these settings pages.'=>'I wakken ad ak-nɛawen deg unadi, nettak-ak-d askar n tmuɣli i tzemreḍ ad tsermdeḍ ddaw, ara yesqedcen s wakud kan tinefrunin-nneɣ n umasal timaynutin i kečč kan (inebgawen-nniḍen ad walin asmel-ik am zik). Ma tuɣaleḍ ur tebɣiḍ ara ibeddlen, tzemreḍ ad tbeddleḍ akk neɣ ad tuɣaleḍ ɣer yimasalen s yiwen deg usebter-a n yiɣewwaren.','To manage the whole set, <a href="%s">edit the repeating event template</a>.'=>'I wakken ad tmegreḍ agraw meṛṛa, <a href="%s">ẓreg taneɣruft n tedyant i d-yettuɣalen</a>.','To update your network blogs with the latest Events Manager automatically, click the update button below.'=>'I wakken ad tleqqmeḍ iblugen n uẓeṭṭa-ik s Events Manager aneggaru s wudem awurman, ssed ɣef tqeffalt n uleqqem ddaw.','To view your bookings, please visit %s after logging in.'=>'Akken ad twaliḍ tuṭṭfiwin-ik, rzu %s mi ara teqqneḍ.','Today'=>'Ass-agi','Today\'s events'=>'Tidyanin n ass-agi','Tomorrow\'s events'=>'Tidyanin n tfawt','Tooltip'=>'Tallelt','Total'=>'Amatu','Total Bookings'=>'Asemday n tuṭṭfiwin','Total Price'=>'Azal ameqqran','Total Sales'=>'Asemday n tisatin','Total Spaces'=>'Asemday n yidagen','Total Tickets'=>'Asemday n tikitin','Town'=>'Taddart','Translated Event Information'=>'Talɣut n tedyant yettwasuqqlen','Translated Location Information'=>'Talɣut n wadrar yettwasuqqlen','Try again'=>'Ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen','Trying to perform an illegal action.'=>'Tettɛerrḍeḍ ad tgeḍ tigawt tarmeɣtut.','URL'=>'URL','URLs'=>'URLs','Uh Oh! For some reason WordPress could not create an events page for you (or you just deleted it). Not to worry though, all you have to do is create an empty page, name it whatever you want, and select it as your events page in your <a href="%s">settings page</a>. Sorry for the extra step! If you know what you are doing, you may have done this on purpose, if so <a href="%s">ignore this message</a>'=>'Ayuh! Ɣef kra n wassebba WordPress ur izmir ara ad yesnulfu asebter n tedyanin i kečč (neɣ tekkseḍ-it). Ur tettaggad ara, ur tesriḍ ara ṭṭfeṛ aya: snulfu asebter ilem, rnu-yas isem i tebɣiḍ, tfeṛneḍ-it d asebter n tedyanin deg <a href="%s">usebter n yiɣewwaren</a>. Suref-aɣ ɣef ugar n tarrayt! Ma tessneḍ ayen txeddmeḍ, ahat txedmeḍ-it s lmeqsud, ma yella akka <a href="%s">ttu izen-agi</a>','Unapprove'=>'Agi','Unauthorized Access'=>'Anekcum ur yettwasirgen ara','Unavailable Dates'=>'Izemzen ur nelli ara','Unconfirm'=>'Kkes asentem','Unconfirmed'=>'Ur yettusentem ara','Undo'=>'Semmet','Undo Changes'=>'Semmet ibeddlen','Undo Migration'=>'Semmet asuffeɣ','Uninstall'=>'Kkes asbeddi','Uninstall Events Manager'=>'Kkes asbeddi n Events Manager','Uninstall and Deactivate'=>'Kkes asbeddi u ssens','Uninstall/Reset'=>'Kkes asbeddi/Wennez','Unknown migration source.'=>'Aɣbalu n uneqqel ur yettwasen ara.','Unless overriden with the %s parameter in shortcode or PHP arguments, the calendar will by default split events by timeslot if on the same day or show one event for the day which includes the whole range of timeslots.'=>'Ma yella ur yettwabeddel ara s uɣewwar %s deg unegzum neɣ deg yimeskilen n PHP, tafada ad teferrek tidyanin s tzemmar n wakud s wudem amezwer ma llint deg yiwen n wass, neɣ ad d-teskan yiwet n tedyant i wass ara yesɛun akk tazrawt n tzemmar n wakud.','Unless speficied with the %s parameter, the calendar will by default remain the chosen size regardless of calendar width. Responsive calendar size will adjust from small to large according to the calendar width on screen.'=>'Ma yella ur yettwasbadu ara s uɣewwar %s, tafada ad teqqim s wudem amezwer deg tiddi i d-yettwafernen ugar n tehri n tfada. Tiddi n tfada yettwafrurzen ad tettwafren seg tmeẓẓyant ɣer tmeqqrant almend n tehri n tfada ɣef ugdil.','Unrecognized file format, could not match file MIME type according to file extension.'=>'Amasal n ufaylu ur yettwassen ara, ur izmir ara ad yemṣada anaw MIME n ufaylu d usiɣzef-is.','Unrecognized image format, corrupted or non-present image EXIF header data.'=>'Amasal n tugna ur yettwassen ara, isefka n uqerru EXIF n tugna n ṛṛay neɣ ulac-it.','Up to %d%% off'=>'Alamma d %d%% n usenqes','Upcoming'=>'Ittasen','Upcoming %s'=>'%s ara d-yasen','Upcoming Events'=>'Tidyanin ara d-yasen','Upcoming timeslot limit'=>'Talast n tallunin i d-iteddun','Update %s'=>'Leqqem %s','Update 7.3.7 also includes improvements to the block (Gutenberg) editor. Check out our %s for the details.'=>'Aleqqem 7.3.7 yegber daɣen ismenyifen i umaẓrag n yiḥedran (Gutenberg). Wali %s i wugar n talɣut.','Update Blogs'=>'Leqqem iblugen','Update Event Category'=>'Leqqem taggayt n tedyant','Update Event Tag'=>'Leqqem tabzimt n tedyant','Update Network'=>'Leqqem aẓeṭṭa','Update booking'=>'Leqqem tuṭṭfa','Update event'=>'Leqqem tadyant','Update location'=>'Leqqem adrar','Update preview'=>'Leqqem taskant','Update process has finished.'=>'Ajerred n uleqqem yekfa.','Update ticket'=>'Leqqem tikit','Update your address information above to generate a preciese map location.'=>'Leqqem talɣut n tansa-ik nnig akken ad tesnulfuḍ adrar n tmeẓri yelhan.','Updated'=>'Yettwaleqqem','Updates an Events Manager %s.'=>'Yesleqqem %s n Events Manager.','Updates an Events Manager booking. The payment gateway cannot be changed after the booking is made: sending a different gateway is rejected, and resending the current one is ignored.'=>'Yesleqqem tuṭṭfa n Events Manager. Tawwurt n usewweṛ ur tettwabeddel ara mi ara tettwag tuṭṭfa: tawwurt yemgaraden tettwagi, tin yellan tettwanfel.','Updates an Events Manager event.'=>'Yesleqqem tadyant n Events Manager.','Updates an Events Manager location.'=>'Yesleqqem adrar n Events Manager.','Updates an Events Manager ticket.'=>'Yesleqqem tikit n Events Manager.','Updates and support until %s'=>'Ileqqmen d tallalt alamma d %s','Upgrade to %s'=>'Sali ɣer %s','Upgrade to %s for more options!'=>'Leqqem ɣer %s i wugar n textiṛiyin!','Upload Limits'=>'Tilisa n usali','Upload a file'=>'Sali afaylu','Upload a file first.'=>'Sali afaylu send.','Upload and match columns'=>'Sali u qqen tigejdiyin','Upload media'=>'Sili amidya','Upload the zip under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'Sali afaylu zip deg Izegrar > Rnu azegrar amaynut, sakin rmed turagt-ik seg yiɣewwaren-is.','Upload/change picture'=>'Sili/Beddel tugna','Uploaded file type not allowed. Permitted file types are: %s'=>'Anaw n ufaylu yettwasulen ur yettwasirig ara. Anawen yettwasirgen d: %s','Uploads'=>'Ifuyla yettwaznen','Uploads an image (or other media) to the WordPress media library and returns its attachment ID. Accepts a `source_url` to sideload a public image, base64-encoded bytes via `content_base64` + `filename`, or an existing `id` to look up an existing attachment. If a public URL blocks server-side fetches (e.g. Unsplash) use `content_base64` instead. To make the upload an event/location featured image in one call, pass `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`; otherwise pass the returned ID as `featured_image` to update-event / update-location, or as `image` to update-category / update-tag. (Note: `post_id` only files the attachment under a post in the library — it does NOT set the featured image.)'=>'Yessali tugna (neɣ amidya-nniḍen) ɣer Tamkarḍit n imidyaten n WordPress u yettawi-d ID n useɣwen-is. Yeqbel `source_url` i usali n tugna tazayezt, ibayten yettwarmeden s base64 s `content_base64` + `filename`, neɣ `id` yellan i wakken ad d-yettwali useɣwen yellan. Ma yella useɣwen azayez yessewḥel tuɣalin seg uqeddac (amedya Unsplash) seqdec `content_base64`. I wakken ad tgeḍ asali d tugna tameẓlit n tedyant/adrar s yiwen n usiwel, fk `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`; neɣ fk ID i d-yuɣalen d `featured_image` i update-event / update-location, neɣ d `image` i update-category / update-tag. (Tamawt: `post_id` ala yerra aseɣwen ddaw n umagrad deg tkarḍit, ur yesbedd ara tugna tameẓlit.)','Use 24h Format?'=>'Seqdec amasal n 24 n yisragen?','Use Defaults'=>'Seqdec ayen yellan s wudem amezwer','Use SMTP authentication?'=>'Seqdec asesteb SMTP?','Use Visual Editor?'=>'Seqdec amaẓrag ameẓran?','Use abbreviations, e.g. Friday = Fri. Useful for certain languages where abbreviations differ from full names.'=>'Seqdec ismecṭuḥen, am Sem = Sem. Yesɛa azal i kra n tutlayin anda ismecṭuḥen ttemgaradent d yismawen ummiden.','Use dropdown for locations?'=>'Seqdec umuɣ i yidrar?','Use international format starting with `+` and a country code, e.g. `+447400123456`.'=>'Seqdec amasal alemmas yebdan s `+` d tengalt n tmurt, amedya `+447400123456`.','Use the UI builder below to create and manage additional event types (archetypes).'=>'Seqdec imsebded ukessar i wakken ad tesnulfuḍ u ad tesedbleḍ inawen nniḍen n tidyanin (archetypes).','Use the buttons below to uninstall Events Manager completely from your system or reset Events Manager to original settings and keep your event data.'=>'Seqdec tiqeffalin ukessar i wakken ad tekkseḍ Events Manager akken iwata seg unagraw-ik neɣ ad twennzeḍ Events Manager ɣer yiɣewwaren imezwura u ad teǧǧeḍ isefka n tedyanin-ik.','Used if an excerpt has been defined.'=>'Yettwaseqdac ma yella tettwasbadu yiwen n tussift.','Used if an excerpt has not been defined.'=>'Yettwaseqdac ma yella ur tettwasbadu ara tussift.','Used to format each event in a list when previewing a single date in a modal popup.'=>'Yettwaseqdac i umasal n yal tadyant deg tebdart mi ara tettwaskan tmuɣli n yiwen n wass deg usfaylu udhim.','Used to show a single event when preview mode is set to %s.'=>'Yettwaseqdac i uskan n yiwet n tedyant mi ara yili uskar n tmuɣli yebdd ɣef %s.','User Capabilities'=>'Tizemmar n useqdac','User Fields'=>'Urtiyen n useqdac','User can book'=>'Useqdac izmer ad yeṭṭef','User can create and edit %s'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad yesnulfu u ad yeẓreg %s','User can delete %s categories and tags.'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad yekkes taggayin d tibzimin n %s.','User can delete other users %s'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad yekkes %s n yiseqdacen nniḍen','User can delete their own %s'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad yekkes %s-is','User can edit %s categories and tags.'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad yeẓreg taggayin d tibzimin n %s.','User can edit other users %s'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad yeẓreg %s n yiseqdacen nniḍen','User can manage other users individual bookings and event booking settings.'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad isefrek tuṭṭfiwin ibanen n yiseqdacen nniḍen d yiɣewwaren n tuṭṭfa n tedyant.','User can upload images along with their events and locations.'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad isali tugniwin akked tedyanin-is d yidrar-is.','User can use and manage bookings with their events.'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad iseqdec u ad isefrek tuṭṭfiwin d tedyanin-is.','User can use other user locations for their events.'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad iseqdec idrar n yiseqdacen nniḍen i tedyanin-is.','User can view private %s'=>'Aseqdac yezmer ad iwali %s uffiren','User must log in'=>'Useqdac ilaq ad iqqen','Username'=>'Isem n umseqdac','Username: %s'=>'Isem n useqdac: %s','Users can manage bookings for their events on this page.'=>'Iseqdacen zemren ad sefrken tuṭṭfiwin n tedyanin-nsen deg usebter-a.','Users can now use the WordPress editor for easy HTML entry in the submission form.'=>'Iseqdacen zemren tura ad sqedcen amaẓrag n WordPress i usekcem fessus n HTML deg tmerkant n uzzna.','Users can publish %s and skip any admin approval'=>'Iseqdacen zemren ad suffɣen %s u ad ǧǧen asentem n unedbal','Users can view their bookings for other events on this page.'=>'Iseqdacen zemren ad walin tuṭṭfiwin-nsen n tedyanin-nniḍen deg usebter-a.','Users can view, add and edit their %s on this page.'=>'Iseqdacen zemren ad walin, ad rnun d ad ẓergen %s-nsen deg usebter-a.','Users will be able to create additional custom event post types on their own sub-sites.'=>'Iseqdacen ad zemren ad snulfun ugar n yinawen udmawanen n yimagraden n tidyanin deg yismal-nsen imaynuten.','Users with accounts (which would be created by other means when this mode is enabled) will still be able to log in and make bookings linked to their account as normal.'=>'Iseqdacen yesɛan ikaunten (ara yettwasnulfun s wayen nniḍen mi ara yermed uskar-a) ad zemren ad qqnen u ad ṭṭfen tuṭṭfiwin yebdan ɣer ukaunt-nsen am zik.','Users with the relevant permissions can manage their own events and bookings to these events on the following pages.'=>'Iseqdacen yesɛan turagin ilaqen zemren ad sefrken tidyanin-nsen d tuṭṭfiwin n tedyanin-agi deg isebtar-a ddaw.','Value'=>'Azal','Venue capacity, shared by all tickets that include physical access. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Tazmert n wadrar, yettwabḍan gar akk tikitin yesɛan anekcum afizik. Eǧǧ-it d ilem ma ulac talast.','Venues'=>'Idrar','View'=>'Wali','View %s'=>'Wali %s','View As'=>'Wali am','View Bookings'=>'Wali tuṭṭfiwin','View Event'=>'Wali tadyant','View Event Bookings'=>'Wali tuṭṭfiwin n tedyant','View Location'=>'Sken-d ideg','View Range'=>'Sken azrar','View Timeslot'=>'Wali tazmilt n wakud','View Types'=>'Ineɣmisen n tmuɣli','View all posts in %s'=>'Wali akk imagraden deg %s','View event details'=>'Wali talɣut n tedyant','View license'=>'Wali turagt','View/Edit Event'=>'Wali/Ẓreg tadyant','Viewing a general WordPress taxonomy page such as %s will show a list of events just like it would regular posts for a regular category or tag. Below you can edit things such as the order events are displayed, or completely override the archive look with our formats feature.'=>'Askan n usebter amatu n tmessartut n WordPress am %s ad d-yesken tabdart n tidyanin am wakken ara d-yesken imagraden iyettwassnen i taggayt neɣ tabzimt. Ddaw tzemreḍ ad tẓregeḍ ayen am usmizwer n uskan n tidyanin, neɣ ad tsemselsiḍ akk udem n tarcivt s tmeẓluyt n yimusal-nneɣ.','Views'=>'Timuɣliwin','Virtual'=>'Virtuel','Virtual Events'=>'Tidyanin virtuel','Virtual Locations'=>'Idrar virtuel','Virtual Platform'=>'Aɣawwaḍ virtuel','Virtual Spaces'=>'Idagen virtuel','Virtual Venue'=>'Adrar virtuel','Virtual and Hybrid Events'=>'Tidyanin virtuel d wid ahibrid','Virtual capacity, shared by all tickets that include virtual access. Leave blank for no limit, or the limit of your virtual platform if it has one.'=>'Tazmert virtuel, yettwabḍan gar akk tikitin yesɛan anekcum virtuel. Eǧǧ-it d ilem ma ulac talast, neɣ talast n uɣawwaḍ-ik virtuel ma yesɛa.','Virtual events only'=>'Tidyanin virtuel kan','WARNING : Restrict your API key to prevent unauthorized use and quota theft. See our %s page for more information.'=>'ALƔU : Gbu tasarut API-inek i wakken ad tmenɛeḍ aseqdec arurad d tuffra n teɣwayt. I wugar n telɣut, wali asebter %s.','WARNING! This cannot be undone and will overwrite all event timezones, you may want to back up your database first!'=>'ALƔU! Aya ur yezmir ara ad yettwasefsex u ad yessuffeɣ tamnaḍt tasragant n akk tidyanin, ahat ilaq ad tsekleseḍ azadur-ik n isefka send!','WARNING! You will delete ALL recurrences of this event, including booking history associated with any event in this recurrence. To keep booking information, go to the relevant single event and save it to detach it from this recurrence series.'=>'ALƔU! Ad tekkseḍ TIDYANIN MEṚṚA n tedyant-agi i d-yettuɣalen, s umezruy n tuṭṭfiwin yeqqnen ɣer yal tadyant deg uttar-agi. Akken ad teǧǧeḍ talɣut n tuṭṭfa, ddu ɣer tedyant yettwabdan sakin sekles-it akken ad tt-tsenṣleḍ seg useddu-agi.','WARNING: This action cannot be undone.'=>'ALƔU: Tigawt-agi ur tezmir ara ad tettwasefsex.','WARNING: This is a %s.'=>'Alɣu: Wagi d %s.','WARNING: This is a event belonging to the group "%s". Other group admins can also modify this event.'=>'Alɣu: Wagi d tadyant n ugraw "%s". Inedbalen-nniḍen n ugraw zemren daɣen ad beddlen tadyant-a.','WARNING: This is a recurrence in a set of repeating events.'=>'Alɣu: Wagi d alugen deg yiwen n ugraw n tedyanin i d-yettuɣalen.','WP FullCalendar'=>'WP FullCalendar','WPML Compatibility'=>'Amṣada d WPML','Waiting to sync with the provider.'=>'Yettraju amtawa d usmersu.','Waitlist'=>'Tabdart n uḥraz','Waitlist Approved'=>'Tabdart n uḥraz yettwaqbel','Waitlist Expired'=>'Tabdart n uḥraz tfuk','Want to use the block editor? You can now enable this on your %s page.'=>'Tebɣiḍ ad tesqedceḍ amaẓrag n yiḥedran? Tzemreḍ ad t-tremdeḍ tura deg usebter %s.','Warning!'=>'Alɣu!','Warning: Changing the CPT name can have wider implications and may affect any other plugins that specifically work with this custom post type name. Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'Alɣu: Abeddel n yisem CPT yezmer ad yesɛu tasukkitt ɣef yiseɣzaf nniḍen ixeddmen s yisem-a n Custom Post Type. Tebɣiḍ ad tkemmleḍ s tidet?','Warning: Changing these values may result in exposing previously hidden information to all users.'=>'Alɣu: Abeddel n yizalen-agi yezmer ad d-yesken talɣut yettwaffren zik i yiseqdacen merra.','We are going to use %s for searching.'=>'Ad nseqdec %s i unadi.','We collect and store information you submit to us about events (and corresponding locations) you would like to publish on our site.'=>'Nelqeḍ u nḥerz talɣut i aɣ-tuzneḍ ɣef tedyanin (d yidrar yemṣadan) i tebɣiḍ ad tessuffɣeḍ deg usmel-nneɣ.','We collect and store information you submit to us when making a booking, for the purpose of reserving your requested spaces at our event and maintaining a record of attendance.'=>'Nelqeḍ u nḥerz talɣut i aɣ-tuzneḍ mi ara txeddmeḍ tuṭṭfa, i wakken ad nesḥerz idagen i d-tsutreḍ deg tedyant-nneɣ u ad neḥrez aɣmis n tmeddurt.','We could not find a booking matching that reference and email address. Please check both and try again.'=>'Ur nufi ara tuṭṭfa yemṣadda d tbadut-a d tansa-a n yimayl. Ttxil sefqed tid-nniḍen u ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen.','We could not find any active bookings for your email address.'=>'Ur nufi ara tuṭṭfiwin urmiden i tansa-ik n yimayl.','We could not verify that booking. Please start again.'=>'Ur nezmir ara ad nessenqed tuṭṭfa-nni. Ttxil ales seg tazwara.','We impose some theme styling rules which help normalize the look of Events Manager accross themes and overrides general theming. This is limited to our components but will prevent your theme from taking over things like fonts, font-sizes, form structures etc. You can also disable strict styling for individual components below.'=>'Nessemlil kra n yilugan n uɣanib n usentel ara yeɛawnen ad smegren udem n Events Manager deg yisental yerna ad ssemgirden aɣanib amatu. Ayagi yettwamḥad ɣer yiferdisen-nneɣ yerna ad yeḥbes asentel-ik ad yeṭṭef ayen am tsefsiyin, tiddi n tsefsit, yimasalen n tmerkanin d wayen-nniḍen. Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tesnseḍ aɣanib uḥerfan i yiferdisen yemgaraden ddaw.','We may use cookies to temporarily store information about a booking in progress as well as any error/confirmation messages whilst submitting or managing your events and locations.'=>'Ahat nesseqdac inagan n tuqqna i usekles aɣelnaw n telɣut ɣef tuṭṭfa i iteddun akked yiznan n tuccḍa/n usentem lawan n uzen neɣ n usefrek n tedyanin d yidrar-ik.','We recommend enabling this feature, as all numbers are stored in the international standard %s. Even if you require national numbers from one country, to ensure compatibility with all phone-related features, otherwise a simple text field is provided for phone input.'=>'Nettwala ad tesremdeḍ timeẓluyt-a, acku akk uṭṭunen ttwaskelsen s uzelmaḍ amaḍal %s. Ula ma tesriḍ uṭṭunen n tmurt yiwet, i wakken ad yemṣada yid-s akk timeẓluyin n tilifun, ma ulac ad d-yettwafk urti n uḍris aḍerfan i unekcum n uṭṭun.','We recommend leaving this on unless you are experiencing issues configuring your email.'=>'Nettusmutr ad teǧǧeḍ aya yermed ala ma tlaqeḍ uguren deg uswel n yimayl-ik.','We recommend you back up your database! Once the upgrade is finalized, you cannot downgrade to an earlier version of the plugin. This cannot be undone.'=>'Nṣeḥ-ak ad tgeḍ anɣal n uzadur-ik n isefka! Akken ara yefk aleqqem, ur tezmireḍ ara ad tuɣaleḍ ɣer lqem azzayez n usiɣzef. Aya ur yettwasefsax ara.','We strongly recommend you check out our %s before disabling any styling here, in most cases you can make profound changes with a few line of CSS or PHP'=>'Nettwala ad twaliḍ %s uqbel ad tesnseḍ aɣanib dagi, deg waṭas n tmeṭṭiwin tzemreḍ ad txedmeḍ isenfal imeqqranen s kra n yizirigen n CSS neɣ PHP','We strongly suggest you back up your database before proceding with this action, it cannot be undone otherwise!'=>'Nessumer ad tsekleseḍ azadur-ik n isefka send ad tkemmleḍ armud-a, ur yezmir ara ad yettwasefsex ma ulac!','We use Google services to generate maps and provide autocompletion when searching for events by location, which may collect data via your browser in accordance to Google\'s <a href="%s">privacy policy</a>.'=>'Nesseqdac imeẓla n Google akken ad d-nsnulfu tummilin u ad nefk asmekti awurman mi ara nnadi tidyanin s wadig, ayen izemren ad d-yelqeḍ isefka s yiminig-ik s ttwali n <a href="%s">tsertit n tbaḍnit</a> n Google.','We will attempt to detect the location of the user based on their browser timezone and auto-select the corresponding country accordingly.'=>'Ad nɛerreḍ ad nafeṛ adig n useqdac almend n tmennaḍt-is tasragant n yiminig, sakin ad nefren tamurt iwumi tettwarna s wudem awurman.','We\'re always making improvements, adding features and fixing bugs between releases. We incrementally make these changes in between updates and make it available as a development version. You can download these manually, but we\'ve made it easy for you. <strong>Warning:</strong> Development versions are not always fully tested before release, use wisely!'=>'Nettxeddem tamusni yal tikkelt, nerennu timeẓluyin u nṣeggem tuccḍiwin gar ileqqmen. Ur nettargu ara ad nessufeɣ lqem amaynut yal tikkelt, nessuffeɣ-d ibeddilen-a deg lqem n usnernu. Tzemreḍ ad tsaduḍ-iten s ufus, maca nesḥawel ad nesshel ayen akk. <strong>Alɣu:</strong> Lqemmen n usnernu ur ttwasekyen ara yal tikkelt akken ilaq send ad ffɣen, seqdec-iten s leqrar!','Website'=>'Asmel','Week %d'=>'Dduṛt %d','Weekly'=>'Yal dduṛt','Welcome to Events Manager v6! This latest update includes some major UI improvements, which requires you to update your formats.'=>'Anṣuf ɣer Events Manager v6! Aleqqem aneggaru-agi yegber isnifal ameqqran n UI, ilaq ad tleqqmeḍ imasal-ik.','What the file holds'=>'Ayen yesɛa ufaylu','When'=>'Melmi','When Events Manager displays lists of events the default behavior is ordering by start date in ascending order. To change this, modify the values above.'=>'Mi ara d-yeskan Events Manager tibdarin n tidyanin, tikli tamezwert d asmizwer s uzemz n usenker s walluy. I wakken ad tbeddleḍ aya, beddel azalen nnig.','When a booking cannot be made due to an error when filling the form. Below this, there will be a dynamic list of errors.'=>'Mi ara ur tezmir ara ad tettwaxdem tuṭṭfa ɣef lǧal n tuccḍa deg uččar n tseddast. Ukessar n waya, ad d-yili umuɣ amussan n tuccḍiwin.','When a booking cannot be made due to lack of spaces.'=>'Mi ara ur tezmir ara ad tettwaxdem tuṭṭfa ɣef lǧal n tallest n idagen.','When a booking is made by a user, a feedback message is shown depending on the result, which can be customized below.'=>'Mi ara txedmeḍ tuṭṭfa, izen n tmuɣli ad d-yettwaskan almend n yigmaḍ, ayen ara tzemreḍ ad t-tsagneḍ ukessar.','When a booking is registered and confirmed.'=>'Mi ara tettwakles tuṭṭfa u tettwasentem.','When a booking is registered but pending.'=>'Mi ara tettwakles tuṭṭfa maca tettṛaju.','When a guest tries to book using an email registered with a user account.'=>'Mi ara yeɛreḍ umerza ad yeṭṭef s yimayl yettwaklesen s ukaunt n useqdac.','When a guest user makes a booking for the first time in Events Manager, a new user account is created for them and they are sent their credentials in a separate email, which can be modified below.'=>'Mi ara yexdem yiwen n useqdac anewway tuṭṭfa i tikkelt tamezwarut deg Events Manager, ad yettwasnulfu yiwen n umiḍan amaynut i yiman-is u ad d-yettwazen yisefka-ines n tuqqna deg yimayl yemgaraden, i izemren ad yettwabeddel ddaw.','When a user cancels their booking, this message will be displayed confirming the cancellation.'=>'Mi ara yesemmet useqdac tuṭṭfa-ines, izen-a ad d-yettwaskan i usentem n usefsex.','When a user chooses to cancel a booking, this warning is displayed for them to confirm.'=>'Mi ara yefren useqdac ad yesemmet tuṭṭfa, alɣu-a ad d-yettwaskan i usentem.','When a user modifies a previously published event, it will be put back into pending review status and will not be published until you re-approve it.'=>'Mi ara ibeddel useqdac tadyant yettwasuffɣen yakan, ad tuɣal ɣer waddad n uɣuri yegguni u ur ad tettwasuffeɣ ara alamma tqebleḍ-itt tikkelt-nniḍen.','When a user must log in before making a booking.'=>'Mi ara yeḥwaǧ useqdac ad iqqen send ad yeṭṭef.','When a user submits their event, you can display a new event form again.'=>'Mi ara yazen aseqdac tadyant-is, tzemreḍ ad d-tesekneḍ tamerkant n tedyant tamaynut daɣen.','When an event is cancelled, a general email is sent to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled.'=>'Mi ara tettwaḥbes tedyant, ad yettwazen yiwen n yimayl amatu i meṛṛa tuṭṭfiwin yettusentmen akked yegguninen n tedyant yettwaḥbesen.','When creating a new event, this timezone will be applied by default.'=>'Mi ara tesnulfuḍ tadyant tamaynut, tamnaḍt tasragant-a ad tettwasnes s wudem amezwer.','When creating events, would you like your times to be shown in 24 hour format?'=>'Mi ara tesnulfuḍ tidyanin, tebɣiḍ ad d-banen yisragen-ik deg umasal n 24 n yisragen?','When displaying embedded maps for a location, choose what information Google will use to generate a map from, each producing varying results.'=>'Mi ara d-teskeneḍ tummidin yettwaseddun i wadrar, fren talɣut ara yesqedc Google i usnulfu n tmidit, yal yiwen ad d-yefk igmaḍ yemgaraden.','When displaying global %s on the main site you have the option of users viewing the %s details on the main site or being directed to the sub-site.'=>'Mi ara d-tskeneḍ %s tamatut deg usmel agejdan, tzemreḍ ad tferneḍ ma ur d-ttwalin iseqdacen ifatusen n %s deg usmel agejdan neɣ ad ttwasiwlen ɣer usmel amaruz.','When displaying ticket prices and booking totals, include the tax automatically?'=>'Mi ara d-yettwaskan ssuma n tkitin akked umatu n tuṭṭfiwin, seddu aserreḥ s wudem awurman?','When enabled, phone number fields will include special international (or national) formatting and validation.'=>'Mi ara yettwarmed, urtiyen n uṭṭun n tilifun ad d-awin amasal n umaḍal (neɣ n tmurt) d usentem uzzigen.','When enabled, the mobile app can register devices and receive push notifications. Turning this off stops all outgoing pushes and hides the notification options in the app for this site.'=>'Mi ara yettwarmed, usnas aziraz izmer ad yekles allalen yerna ad yeṭṭef tilɣa n uḥezzeb. Asensi-ines ad iḥbes akk tilɣa i d-yettwazzin yerna ad yeffer textiṛiyin n tilɣa deg usnas i usmel-a.','When enabled, users can custom-order their tickets using drag and drop. If enabled, saved ordering supercedes the default ticket ordering below.'=>'Ma yella yermed, iseqdacen zemren ad smizwren tikitin-nsen s usuter u tuneɣ. Ma yermed, umizwer yettwaklesen ad yeṭṭef amizwer amezwer n tkitin ukessar.','When listing categories, this order is applied.'=>'Mi ara d-nesken taggayin, amizwer-a ad yettwaseqdec.','When listing event archives for a %s, this order is applied.'=>'Mi ara d-nesken tarcivin n tidyanin i %s, amizwer-a ad yettwaseqdec.','When listing tags, this order is applied.'=>'Mi ara d-nesken tibzimin, amizwer-a ad yettwaseqdec.','When no tickets are selected, this text will appear in place of a booking summary, prompting users to select a ticket.'=>'Mi ara ur ttwafernent ara tikitin, aḍris-a ad d-yettban deg wadeg n ugzul n tuṭṭfa, i usuter n yiseqdacen ad fren tikit.','When selecting tickets on a booking form, the price will dynamically be broken down in a summary before the booking confirmation button.'=>'Mi ara tefren tikitin deg tserkant n tuṭṭfa, ssuma ad tettwasdukkel s wudem aknamay deg ugzul send tqeffalt n usentem n tuṭṭfa.','When submitting events, you can choose to use a single date picker for start/end dates, or separate fields for each date.'=>'Mi ara tazneḍ tidyanin, tzemreḍ ad tferneḍ ad tesseqdceḍ yiwen n umefran n uzemz i yizemzen n usenker/n taggara, neɣ urtiyen yemgaraden i yal uzemz.','When the booking is cancelled, the cancellation status email can also be sent independently of a general event cancellation notification.'=>'Mi ara tettwaḥbes tuṭṭfa, imayl n waddad n weḥbas zemren ad ttwazen daɣen s wudem ussid ɣef tilɣa tamatut n weḥbas n tedyant.','When the size of the %s is less than %s, the search fields and buttons in the main bar can either remain on one line and resize accordingly, or break into multiple lines. If you want to keep all your search terms options, multiple lines will look better as they will look squashed on smaller screens and provide a worse search exprience. You can also hide individual search fields in settings further down to reduce screen clutter as the search from shrinks.'=>'Mi ara yili useɣzan n %s ddaw %s, urtiyen n unadi akked tqeffalin deg tfelwit tagejdant zemrent ad qqimen deg yiwen n yizirig u ad beddlent teɣzi-nsent akken iwata, neɣ ad ttwaferqent ɣer waṭas n yizirigen. Ma tebɣiḍ ad teǧǧeḍ akk tixtiṛiyin n yimyagen n unadi, yizirigen aṭas ad d-banen yif acku ur ttban ara ttwaqeḍḍen ɣef yiskanen imecṭuḥen u ad ǧǧen tirmit n unadi igerrzen. Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tferreṛeḍ urtiyen n unadi yemgaraden deg yiɣewwaren ddaw i wakken ad tfeggeḍ lḥir n ugdil mi ara ihuzz unadi.','When the size of the %s is less than %s, this field can be hidden on the main search form to save viewing space. You can still enable this field to show in advanced search settings.'=>'Mi ara yili useɣzan n %s ddaw %s, urti-a tezmer ad tettwaffer ɣef tfelwit tagejdant n unadi i wakken ad d-yeqqim ugar n ugdil n tmuɣli. Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tremdeḍ urti-a i wakken ad d-tban deg yiɣewwaren n unadi anaẓi.','When you save this %s, all recurrences of this set will be deleted. Would you like to proceed?'=>'Mi ara teskelseḍ %s-a, yialugen meṛṛa n ugraw-a ad ttwakksen. Tebɣiḍ ad tkemmleḍ?','Where'=>'Anda','Whether this ticket lets attendees attend physically, virtually, or both, on a hybrid event.'=>'Yeqqar ma tikit-a tettak i yimttekkiyen ad ttekkin s wudem afizik, virtuel, neɣ sin, deg tedyant ahibrid.','Why'=>'Acuɣer','Will be imported'=>'Ad yettwakcem','Will be skipped'=>'Ad yettwazgel','With the %s placeholder, the below texts will be used.'=>'S usentel n wadig %s, iḍrisen ukessar ad ttwaseqdacen.','Withdrawal page'=>'Asebter n usuɣal','Withdrawal period (days)'=>'Tanzagt n usuɣal (ussan)','Withdrawal policy / instructions'=>'Tasertit / iwellihen n usuɣal','Withdrawal received for booking #%d'=>'Usuɣal yettwaqbel i tuṭṭfa #%d','Within'=>'Deg','Within the network admin area, only network-specific settings will be exported or imported. For individual site settings please visit the relevant site within your network.'=>'Deg temnaḍt n unedbal n uẓeṭṭa, ala iɣewwaren yuzzlen i uẓeṭṭa i ara yettwasifḍen neɣ yettwakteren. I yiɣewwaren n yal asmel, ma ulac aɣilif rzu asmel i yellan deg uẓeṭṭa-nnek.','WooCommerce sold separately on Woo.com'=>'WooCommerce yettwazenz weḥd-s deg Woo.com','WooCommerce ticket orders become'=>'Ikalasen n tikitin WooCommerce ttuɣalen d','WordPress %s Archives'=>'Iɣbaren n %s n WordPress','Work it out from the file'=>'Sefru-t seg ufaylu','Would you like to allow users to submit bookings anonymously? If so, you can use the new [event_form] shortcode or <code>em_event_form()</code> template tag with this enabled.'=>'Tebɣiḍ ad tesirgeḍ iseqdacen ad azznen tuṭṭfiwin s wudem warisem? Ma yella, tzemreḍ ad tesqedceḍ anegzum amaynut [event_form] neɣ tahilt n tneɣruft <code>em_event_form()</code> s usermed-a.','Yearly'=>'S useggas','Yes'=>'Ih','Yesterday'=>'Iḍelli','You <strong>must</strong> have assigned a %s page in your <a href="%s">main blog settings</a> for this to work.'=>'<strong>Ilaq</strong> ad tesbeddeḍ asebter %s deg <a href="%s">yiɣewwaren n ublug agejdan</a> akken ad iwwet wagi.','You already have booked a seat at this event.'=>'Tuṭṭfeḍ yakan adig deg tedyant-agi.','You are adding unavailable dates.'=>'Tettarnuḍ izemzen ur nelli ara.','You are currently attending this event.'=>'Tettekkaḍ deg tedyant-agi tura.','You are currently viewing options for an archetype. These can override the default options with the follwoing available options.'=>'Tura tettwaliḍ tixtiṛiyin n umedya amezwaru. Wigi zemrent ad semselsint tixtiṛiyin timezwura s tixtiṛiyin-agi yellan.','You are currently viewing your public page, this is what other users will see.'=>'Aql-ak twalaḍ asebter-ik azayez, wagi i d-ttwalin iseqdacen-nniḍen.','You are in Events Manager debug mode. To turn debug mode off, go to the <a href="%s">settings</a> page.'=>'Aql-ak deg uskar n usewḥel n Events Manager. Akken ad tensiḍ askar n usewḥel, ddu ɣer usebter n <a href="%s">yiɣewwaren</a>.','You are successfully connected to the following %s account:'=>'Teqqneḍ akken iwata ɣer umiḍan-a n %s:' . "\0" . 'Teqqneḍ akken iwata ɣer yimiḍanen-a n %s:','You are switching location type, if you update this event your event previous location data will be deleted.'=>'Aql-ak tbeddleḍ anaw n udrar, ma tleqqmeḍ tadyant-agi, isefka n udrar uzwir n tedyant-ik ad ttwakksen.','You are trying to book a non-existent ticket for this event.'=>'Tettwaliḍ ad tṭṭfeḍ tikit ur nelli ara i tedyant-a.','You are viewing individual recurrences of %s.'=>'Tettwaliḍ yialugen yal yiwen n %s.','You can add private notes below for internal reference that only event managers will see.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad ternuḍ iwenniten uslig ddaw i useqdec uffir, ala imsefrak n tedyanin i ten-yettwalin.','You can add styles to your maps to give them a unique look. Build one using the %s or choose from the many free templates on %s paste the generated JSON code here.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad ternuḍ iɣunab ɣer tummidin-ik i wakken ad ssemgirdent. Snulfu-d yiwen s useqdec n %s neɣ fren seg tneɣrufin ilelliyen aṭas ɣef %s sakin senṭeḍ da tangalt JSON i d-yettwasnulfan.','You can allow different location types which can be assigned to an event. For more information see our %s.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tesirgeḍ anawen yemgaraden n yidrar ara yettwarnun ɣer tedyant. I wugar n telqayt, wali %s.','You can allow users to publicly submit events on your blog by using the %s shortcode, and enabling anonymous submissions below.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tesirgeḍ iseqdacen ad zzenzen tidyanin s wudem azayez deg ublug-ik s useqdec n unegzum %s, akked usermed n uzzna warisem ddaw.','You can also %s into a single recurring event.'=>'Tzemreḍ daɣen %s ɣer yiwet n tedyant i d-yettuɣalen.','You can also add event attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_ATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on event pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'Tzemreḍ daɣen ad ternuḍ iraten n tedyant da, yiwen deg yal izirig s wumasal-a <code>#_ATT{key}</code>. Ur d-ttbanen ara deg isebtar n tedyant ma ur tgerrḍ ara deg tneɣruft nniḍen n ddaw, maca tzemreḍ ad tebɣuḍ ad teskelseḍ talɣut tamernant ɣef tedyant i yimeẓlayen nniḍen. <a href=\'%s\'>Ugar n telɣut ɣef yismilen n wadig.</a>','You can also add location attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_LATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on location pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'Tzemreḍ daɣen ad ternuḍ iraten n wadrar da, yiwen deg yal izirig s wumasal-a <code>#_LATT{key}</code>. Ur d-ttbanen ara deg isebtar n yidrar ma ur tgerrḍ ara deg tneɣruft nniḍen n ddaw, maca tzemreḍ ad tebɣuḍ ad teskelseḍ talɣut tamernant ɣef tedyant i yimeẓlayen nniḍen. <a href=\'%s\'>Ugar n telɣut ɣef yismilen n wadig.</a>','You can also request specific consent from your users to be contacted via supplied communication options (Email, Phone, SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, Telegram etc.), this can be separate to your privacy policy, given that this relates to consenting to non-essential communication such as marketing or non-email-based reminders.'=>'Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tsuteḍ tuqqna tufrint n yiseqdacen-ik i wakken ad ttwarmesen s tikti n unermes yettwafkan (Imayl, Tilifun, SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, Telegram, atg.), aya zemren ad yemgaradd ɣef tsertit-ik tabaḍnit, acku yeqqen ɣer tuqqna i tgectiwin ur d-ilaqen ara am usnasi neɣ yiwenniten ur nețțili ara s yimayl.','You can also reset all events of a blog to a new timezone in %s'=>'Tzemreḍ daɣen ad talseḍ ad tesbeddeḍ tidyanin meṛṛa n ublug ɣer tmennaḍt tasragant tamaynut deg %s','You can change the permalink structure of your events, locations, categories and tags here. Be aware that you may want to set up redirects if you change your permalink structures to maintain SEO rankings.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tbeddleḍ tamṣukt n usɣen amaɣlal n tidyanin, idrar, taggayin d tibzimin da. Ɣur-k, ahat tebɣiḍ ad tsbeddeḍ asmimeḍ ma tbeddleḍ tamṣukt n usɣen amaɣlal i wakken ad tḥerzeḍ ta’ɣuri n SEO.','You can choose to show a popup modal or inline under the main search bar triggered by an icon on the main search bar.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tferneḍ ad d-tbanen deg yiwen n usfaylu udhim neɣ s wudem uslig ddaw ufeggag n unadi amenzay, ara yettwarmed s yiwen n tignit deg ufeggag n unadi amenzay.','You can choose whether or not to show unavailable tickets to visitors.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tferneḍ ma ara d-skaneḍ neɣ ala tikitin ur yewjid ara i yimerza.','You can create more than one "type" of event, which can have its own admin section, URL structure, calendar and formatting. For example, you may have events, appointments, and workshops all running under the Events Manager engine!'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tesnulfuḍ ugar n yiwen n "unaw" n tedyanin, yal yiwen yesɛa tama-s n unedbal, taɣessa n URL, tafada akked umasal. Amedya, tzemreḍ ad tesɛuḍ tidyanin, timlilit akked tallalt i iteddun akk s yimakkan n Events Manager!','You can disable ALL styling altogether by setting this to \'no\'. By doing so, nothing will be styled, AT ALL, by Events Manager in the front-end. Basically, it\'s up to you and your theme!'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tesnseḍ AKK iɣunab s lekmal s usbadu n waya ɣer \'ala\'. S waya, ur yettwaɣenneb ayen ara, ULAC, sɣur Events Manager deg tazwara. D ayen i d-yeqqimen i kečč d usentel-ik!','You can disable this email by leaving the subject blank.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tsenseḍ imayl-a s weǧǧan n usentel d ilem.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with a %s to prevent getting overwritten.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tẓergeḍ yal alugen u ad tsenṣleḍ-iten seg %s i wakken ur ttwaffren ara.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this %s.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tẓergeḍ yal alugen u ad tsenṣleḍ-iten seg %s-a.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this recurring event.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tẓergeḍ allagen yemxalafen u ad ten-tfekkeḍ seg tedyant-agi i d-yettuɣalen.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this repeating event.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tẓergeḍ yal alugen u ad tsenṣleḍ-iten seg tedyant-a i d-yettuɣalen.','You can have single or multiple tickets, where certain tickets become available under certain conditions, e.g. early bookings, group discounts, maximum bookings per ticket, etc.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tesɛuḍ tikit yiwen neɣ aṭas n tikitin, anda kra n tikitin ttwejdent ddaw kra n tceṛṭin, amedya tuṭṭfiwin n bekri, isenqasen i yigrawen, amḍan afellay n tuṭṭfiwin i yal tikit, atg.','You can hide or leave the consent box checked for registered users who have provided consent previously.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad teffreḍ neɣ ad teǧǧeḍ tankult n tuqqna icukk i yiseqdacen yettwaseklen i d-yefkan tuqqna zik.','You can join from %s.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad ddueḍ seg %s.','You can log into our site here : %s'=>'Tzemreḍ ad teqqneḍ ɣer usmel-nneɣ dagi : %s','You can now give fine grained control with regards to what your users can do with events. Each user role can have perform different sets of actions.'=>'Tura tzemreḍ ad tefkeḍ tuqqna tarewlant ɣef ayen izemren iseqdacen-ik ad xedmen d tidyanin. Yal tamlilt n useqdac tezmer ad texdem tigawin yemgaraden.','You can only convert a repeating %s'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tbeddleḍ kan %s i d-yettuɣalen','You can reset your events to a new timezone and also complete the final migration step by deleting unecessary data in %s'=>'Tzemreḍ ad talseḍ ad tesbeddeḍ tidyanin-ik ɣer tmennaḍt tasragant tamaynut u daɣen ad tfakkeḍ amecwar aneggaru n tmigration s tukksa n yisefka ur nelli ara d ilaqen deg %s','You can use Google Maps to show where your events are located. For more information on using maps, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a>.'=>'Tzemreḍ ad tesqedceḍ Google Maps i wakken ad d-tesekneḍ anda llant tidyanin-ik. I wugar n telqayt ɣef useqdec n tummidin, <a href="%s">wali tasemlit-nneɣ</a>.','You can view your event here:'=>'Tzemreḍ ad twaliḍ tadyant-ik dagi:','You cannot RSVP to this booking with %s'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad d-terreḍ i tuṭṭfa-agi s %s','You cannot book more than %1$d spaces for the ticket %2$s.'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad tṭṭfeḍ ugar n %1$d n yidagen i tikit %2$s.','You cannot book more than %d spaces for this event.'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad tuṭṭfeḍ ugar n %d idagen i tedyant-agi.','You cannot change the CPT type of %s to %s. This custom post type already exists.'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad tbeddleḍ anaw CPT n %s ɣer %s. Anaw-a n umagrad yugnen yella yakan.','You cannot delete a ticket that has a booking on it.'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad tekkseḍ tikit yesɛan tuṭṭfa.','You cannot delete tickets if there are any bookings associated with them. Please delete these bookings first.'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad tekkseḍ tikitin ma llant tuṭṭfiwin yettwaqqnen yid-sent. Ttxil kkes tuṭṭfiwin-a qbel.','You cannot edit saved locations here.'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad tẓergeḍ idrar yettwakelsen dagi.','You cannot manage this %s.'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad tesferkeḍ %s-a.','You cannot read private %s'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad teɣreḍ %s ameẓlay','You cannot view others %s'=>'Ur tezmireḍ ara ad twaliḍ %s n wiyaḍ','You do not have any bookings.'=>'Ulac ɣur-k tuṭṭfiwin.','You do not have permission to attach media to that post.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tarzeḍ amidya ɣer umagrad-a.','You do not have permission to change this booking status.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tbeddleḍ addad n tuṭṭfa-a.','You do not have permission to create bookings through the API.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tesnulfuḍ tuṭṭfiwin s API.','You do not have permission to create/edit %s.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt i usnulfu/uẓrag n %s.','You do not have permission to delete %s'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tekkseḍ %s','You do not have permission to delete event terms.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tekkseḍ awalen n tedyanin.','You do not have permission to delete others %s'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tekkseḍ %s n wiyaḍ','You do not have permission to delete this booking.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tekkseḍ tuṭṭfa-a.','You do not have permission to delete this event.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tekkseḍ tadyant-a.','You do not have permission to delete this location.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tekkseḍ adrar-a.','You do not have permission to delete this ticket.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tekkseḍ tikit-a.','You do not have permission to do that.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad txedmeḍ aya.','You do not have permission to edit %s'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tẓergeḍ %s','You do not have permission to edit others %s'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tẓergeḍ %s n wiyaḍ','You do not have permission to edit that event, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tẓergeḍ tadyant-a, ihi tugna yettwasliyen ur tettwasbadu ara d tugna tameẓlit-is.','You do not have permission to edit that location, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tẓergeḍ adrar-a, ihi tugna yettwasliyen ur tettwasbadu ara d tugna tameẓlit-is.','You do not have permission to edit this attachment.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tẓergeḍ aseɣwen-a.','You do not have permission to edit this event.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tẓergeḍ tadyant-agi.','You do not have permission to manage %s'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tesferkeḍ %s','You do not have permission to manage event terms.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tesferkeḍ awalen n tedyanin.','You do not have permission to manage others %s'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tesferkeḍ %s n wiyaḍ','You do not have permission to manage this booking.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt n usefrek n tuṭṭfa-a.','You do not have permission to manage tickets for this event.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tesferkeḍ tikitin n tedyant-a.','You do not have permission to migrate data.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tneqleḍ isefka.','You do not have permission to publish %s'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tsuffɣeḍ %s','You do not have permission to save this booking.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad teklseḍ tuṭṭfa-a.','You do not have permission to save this event.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad teklseḍ tadyant-a.','You do not have permission to save this location.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad teklseḍ adrar-a.','You do not have permission to send a test email, or this page has expired. Please reload the settings page and try again.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt n uzen n yimayl n uɛeṛṛeḍ, neɣ asebter-agi yemmut. Ma ulac aɣilif ales asali n usebter n yiɣewwaren u ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen.','You do not have permission to update this ticket.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tesleqqmeḍ tikit-a.','You do not have permission to upload images'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tesliḍ tugniwin','You do not have permission to upload media.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad tessaliḍ amidya.','You do not have permission to view this booking.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad twaliḍ tuṭṭfa-a.','You do not have permission to view this event.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad twaliḍ tadyant-a.','You do not have permission to view this location.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad twaliḍ adrar-a.','You do not have permission to view this ticket.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara turagt ad twaliḍ tikit-a.','You do not have the rights to manage this %s.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara izerfan ad tesferkeḍ %s-agi.','You do not have the rights to manage this event.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara izerfan n usefrek n tedyant-agi.','You do not have the rights to manage this ticket.'=>'Ur tesɛiḍ ara izerfan n usefrek n tikit-agi.','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Events Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'Ulac ɣur-k isulen udmawanen yettwasbeddent deg yiɣewwaren n tneɣrufin n Events Manager. Rnu-ten deg <a href=\'%s\'>usebter n yiɣewwaren</a>','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Locations Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'Ulac ɣur-k timecraḍ tudmawanin yettwasbaden deg yiɣewwaren n tneɣrufin n umaẓrag n yidrar. Ma ulac aɣilif rnu-tent deg <a href=\'%s\'>usebter n yiɣewwaren</a>','You have %s confirmed bookings'=>'Tesɛiḍ %s tuṭṭfiwin yettusentmen','You have %s pending bookings'=>'Tesɛiḍ %s tuṭṭfiwin yegganin','You have a confirmed booking'=>'Tesɛiḍ tuṭṭfa yettusentem','You have a pending booking'=>'Tesɛiḍ tuṭṭfa yegguni','You have chosen to add or edit your current unavailable dates for all recurrences. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'Tferneḍ ad ternuḍ neɣ ad tẓergeḍ izemzen-ik ur nelli ara yellan i yal alugen. Ɣer wawal-a s tidet!','You have chosen to edit your %s times. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'Tferneḍ ad tẓergeḍ izemzen n %s. Ɣer wawal-a s tidet!','You have chosen to edit your recurrence date ranges. If you shorten the date range, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be cancelled or deleted.'=>'Tferneḍ ad tẓergeḍ izrar n yizemzen n yialugen. Ma tsenqseḍ azrar n yizemzen, yialugen meṛṛa yellan beṛṛa n uzrar amaynut ad ttwaḥbsen neɣ ad ttwakksen.','You have chosen to edit your recurrence date ranges. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'Tferneḍ ad tẓergeḍ tilisa n yizemzen n walugen-ik. Ɣer wawal-a s tidet!','You have confirmed your attendance.'=>'Tesnetmeḍ ttekki-inek.','You have currently disabled %s'=>'Tsensed %s akka tura','You have currently enabled %s'=>'Tarmed %s akka tura','You have declined your attendance, your booking is now cancelled.'=>'Tugiḍ ad tettekkiḍ, tuṭṭfa-inek tettwaḥbes tura.','You have declined your attendance.'=>'Tugiḍ ad tettekkiḍ.','You have not defined a date range long enough to create a recurrence.'=>'Ur tbeddleḍ ara azrar n yizemzen yelhan i usnulfu n yiwen n ualugen.','You have not definitively confrimed your attendance.'=>'Ur tesnetmeḍ ara s wudem ineggaru ttekki-inek.','You have successfully created an account at %s'=>'Terniḍ amiḍan akken iwata deg %s','You have successfully disconnected from your %s account.'=>'Teffɣeḍ akken iwata seg umiḍan %s-ik.' . "\0" . 'Teffɣeḍ akken iwata seg yimiḍanen %s-ik.','You have successfully finalized upgrading your site.'=>'Tfakkeḍ s lǧehd aleqqem n usmel-ik.','You have successfully migrated to Events Manager v6 formatting! We hope you enjoy the changes. In case you had some special formatting you realize you needed, there\'s the undo option below, it will reset all your migrated formats to how they were previoiusly. You can migrate again or individuall migrate each option within the settings page.'=>'Teddmeḍ akken iwata ɣer wamsal n Events Manager v6! Netturaja ad ak-yehwu ubeddel. Ma tesɛiḍ kra n umsal uslig i tesriḍ, tella tsemmet ddaw, ad tuɣal akk imasalen-ik yettwasuffɣen ɣer wayen i d-llan uzwir. Tzemreḍ ad tesuffɣeḍ i tikkelt-nniḍen neɣ ad tesuffɣeḍ yal tafrayt s yiwen deg usebter n yiɣewwaren.','You have successfully submitted your event, which will be published pending approval.'=>'Tuzneḍ tadyant-ik akken iwata, ad tettwasuffeɣ mi ara tettwaqbel.','You have successfully updated to Events Manager %s'=>'Tleqqmeḍ ɣer Events Manager %s akken iwata','You have successfully updated your event, which will be republished pending approval.'=>'Tleqqmeḍ tadyant-ik akken iwata, ad tettwasuffeɣ i tikkelt-nniḍen mi ara tettwaqbel.','You must allow us to collect and store your data in order for us to process your booking.'=>'Yessefk ad ak-d-nefk turagt ad nekles u nḥrez isefka-inek i wakken ad nesfeḍ tuṭṭfa-inek.','You must be logged in to view bookings.'=>'Yessefk ad teqqneḍ i wakken ad twaliḍ tuṭṭfiwin.','You must book at least %1$d spaces for the ticket %2$s.'=>'Ilaq ad tṭṭfeḍ ma drus %1$d n yidagen i tikit %2$s.','You must check the box allowing us to communicate with you via your provided contact methods.'=>'Ilaq ad tcebbeḍ tankult ara aɣ-yurgen ad ak-nnermes s tarrayin n unermis i d-tefkiḍ.','You must log in or register to make a booking.'=>'Ilaq ad teqqneḍ neɣ ad teklseḍ akken ad tgeḍ tuṭṭfa.','You must log in to cancel your booking.'=>'Ilaq ad teqqneḍ akken ad tesfesxeḍ tuṭṭfa-inek.','You must log in to view and manage your bookings.'=>'Ilaq ad teqqneḍ akken ad twaliḍ u ad tesferkeḍ tuṭṭfiwin-ik.','You must log in to view and manage your events.'=>'Ilaq ad teqqneḍ akken ad twaliḍ u ad tesferkeḍ tidyanin-ik.','You must log in to view and manage your locations.'=>'Ilaq ad teqqneḍ akken ad twaliḍ u ad tesferkeḍ idrar-ik.','You must request at least one space to book an event.'=>'Ilaq ad tesutreḍ ma drus yiwen n wadig akken ad tuṭṭfeḍ tadyant.','You nave successfully migrated to the default v6 formatting options, enjoy! We have an undo option, just in case...'=>'Teddmeḍ akken iwata ɣer yiɣewwaren n umasal amezwer n v6, ṣaḥḥa! Nesɛa afecku n usemmet, ma yella...','You will also need supply an OAuth redirect url to %s. Your url for this site is : %s'=>'Ad teḥwiǧeḍ daɣen ad d-tefkeḍ URL n uwelleh OAuth ɣer %s. URL-inek i usmel-a d : %s','You\'ll need to create an App with %s and obtain the App credentials by going to %s.'=>'Ilaq ad tesnulfuḍ asnas s %s u ad tawiḍ inekcumen n usnas s tmuɣli ɣer %s.','Your %s details are incorrect and cannot be published, please correct these errors first:'=>'Isefka n %s-ik ur nṣeḥḥa ara, ur zmiren ara ad ttwasuffɣen, ṣeggem tuccḍiwin-a qbel:','Your %s license includes this add-on.'=>'Turagt-ik %s teddukkel asnerni-a.','Your Details'=>'Ifatusen-ik','Your account has been successfully connected with %s!'=>'Amiḍan-ik yeqqen akken iwata d %s!','Your booking does not include virtual access to this event, or it is not confirmed yet.'=>'Tuṭṭfa-inek ur teddukkel ara anekcum virtuel ɣer tedyant-a, neɣ mazal ur tettwasentem ara.','Your booking emails show the venue to every attendee, including those with virtual-only tickets. Use %1$s for the Where line in %2$s so each attendee sees the venue, their join link or both.'=>'Imaylen n tuṭṭfa-inek sekanen adrar i yal amttekki, ula d wid yesɛan tikitin virtuel kan. Seqdec %1$s i izirig Anda deg %2$s akken yal amttekki ad yaweḍ ɣer wadrar, aseɣwen-is n uttekki neɣ sin.','Your booking has been recorded'=>'Tuṭṭfa-inek tettwaklas','Your booking is now unconfirmed'=>'Tuṭṭfa-inek ur tettusentem ara tura','Your confirmed booking email has no join link, so attendees with virtual access will not receive one by email. Add %1$s to it in %2$s.'=>'Imayl n tuṭṭfa-inek yettusentem ur yesɛi ara aseɣwen n uttekki, ihi imttekkiyen yesɛan anekcum virtuel ur t-d-ttalin ara s yimayl. Rnu %1$s deg %2$s.','Your current settings will be saved for this selected view.'=>'Iɣewwaren-ik amiran ad ttwasklasen i uskan-a yettwafernen.','Your declaration of withdrawal has been received.'=>'Tazmilt-ik n uffeɣ tettwaqbel.','Your event #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been approved.'=>'Tadyant-ik #_EVENTNAME di #_EVENTDATES tettwaqbel.','Your event details are incorrect and recurrences cannot be created, please correct these errors first:'=>'Isefka n tedyant-ik ur nṣeḥḥa ara, ur zmiren ara ad d-ttwasnulfun yialugen, ṣeggem tuccḍiwin-a qbel:','Your hold on these spaces has ended. You can still book them while they are available.'=>'Tfukk uḥraz n yidagen-a. Mazal tzemreḍ ad ten-tṭṭfeḍ ticki llan.','Your last attempt to reset all blogs to a certain timezone did not complete successfully. You can attempt to reset only those blogs that weren\'t completed by selecting your desired timezone again and then %s from the dropdowns below'=>'Ineggura n uɛiwed-ik n wennez n akk iblugen ɣer tmnaḍt tasragant tuzzigt ur yemmed ara akken iwata. Tzemreḍ ad tɛiwdeḍ ad tserreḥ ala iblugen ur ttwamdan ara s ufran n tmnaḍt tasragant i tebɣiḍ i tikkelt nniḍen, sakin %s seg wumuɣen ukessar','Your name'=>'Isem-ik','Your own legal withdrawal policy and model withdrawal form, shown on the withdrawal page. Events Manager does not generate legal text — paste your own from your legal adviser.'=>'Tasertit-ik n usuɣal tasertit akked tferkit n usuɣal, ittwaskanen deg usebter n usuɣal. Events Manager ur d-yesnulfu ara aḍris usertan, senṭeḍ win-ik seg umestawal-ik usertan.','Your plan'=>'Amahil-ik','Your search filter settings will be selected automatically.'=>'Iɣewwaren n usizdeg n unadi-inek ad ttwafernen s wudem awurman.','Your session expired, please try again.'=>'Tiɣimit-ik tfukk, ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen.','Your spaces are held for %s while you complete your booking.'=>'Idagen-ik ttuḥerzen i %s mi ara tfakkeḍ tuṭṭfa-inek.','Your user account cannot publish events or locations in Events Manager. Run the import as an administrator.'=>'Amiḍan-ik n useqdac ur izmir ara ad suffeɣ tidyanin neɣ idrar deg Events Manager. Selkem asekcem am unedbal.','Your withdrawal policy text'=>'Aḍris n tsertit-ik n usuɣal','Zip or postal code'=>'Tangalt n tpusta','Zoom Integration'=>'Asdukkel n Zoom','[%s] New User Registration'=>'[%s] Aklas n useqdac amaynut','[%s] Your username and password'=>'[%s] Isem-ik n useqdac d wawal-ik n uɛeddi','[No %s Page]'=>'[Ulac asebter n %s]','[Select a page]'=>'[Fren asebter]','`color` must be a valid hex colour (e.g. `#80b538`).'=>'`color` ilaq ad yili d ini hex ameɣtu (amedya `#80b538`).','`example_payload` is the minimal valid booking (required fields only). `example_payload_full` additionally shows every optional field at its correct location — the values are illustrative placeholders, so replace them with the booker\'s real input and omit any field they did not provide.'=>'`example_payload` d tuṭṭfa taɣessant yettwaqbalen (urtiyen ilaqen kan). `example_payload_full` ittwali daɣen akk urtiyen d axetṛan deg wadeg-nsen ameɣtu, azalen d imedyaten kan, ihi semselsi-ten s wayen i d-yefka umeṭṭaf yakan u kkes urti ur d-yefki ara.','all day'=>'ass akken','all events'=>'akk tidyanin','and'=>'d','at'=>'ɣer','booking'=>'tuṭṭfa','bookings'=>'tuṭṭfiwin','cancelled'=>'ttwaḥbsent','cancelled or deleted as per your settings below'=>'ttwasefsxen neɣ ttwakksen akken i d-tbennaḍ ddaw','categories'=>'taggayin','category'